  <para style="h">Atnutnu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Atnutnuloyi Atnutnu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Atnutnu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Atn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Atnutnuloyi Atnutnu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu la lo ncei n əshemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />O Tiyofyilus, dna n əmi pafyi n mi ɓə shnika ga ho nyi, mi ɓə kwu aɓo kafyi vnyanya n Yeisu ɓə ya zhni jesnu n əwo nyawui <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />nya əwyi n a ɓə la wo lo ncei n əshemi, she wo ɓəə kwu aɓəgbega əwo atnutnuloyi n wo ɓəə la knyí dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />N əwo azhnìgye avnu, wa kwu əwohni wu n əɓa aba jesnu wa wu ɓa aɓo n kwnuawye kwnukwnui n mwa bəgyé, nge wo ɓə n wyewyeyii. Wa kpeya da ɓa n du anyipyei shiinyi ya jesnu wa daɓo ntu Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Dna n əsa ho, woi ye tu woi kwnu nyagyigyi n ɓai, wa ga ɓa ɓəgbetu ye: “Fye to kwnuya n Urishelima m, ama fye kwu pmi ɓəgbeshi əmi Dada nyaga nya ń fye ɓə kwu wo mii da əkwo ɓo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ntuge Yohana ɓə zhni batizima n nuwnai nu, ama fyi n anyipyei fyewyi n ɓa ɓe nyi, a ɓə zhni fye batizima n Zafnu Gyigyiyii nu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Nlonu ɓa kwu shegwnu wo zhi jesnu ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Dagayi, dna nsaiye nu, n ho ye ha je Israila əbegyi gwo ga kwo?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Wa gna ɓa, “Kwo to zhni əfye əɓo nu fya kpe asa əye kwo anyipyei n Dada ncei kpe, n əwo ikwoi m. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama fye ɓə gwo kalá she Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə ɓe kpe n fye; jesnu fye ɓə kwu zè əmi Aɓəgbmiyi fyi n Urishelima, jesnu fyi n Yahudiya vnyanya n Samariyai, jesnu kwoi nya anyìcezhiba.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Shi wo ɓə kwu ɓəye da, a la wo gwnulo ncei n əɓa awye, jesnu ənyì kwa ɓwu wo n əɓa awyeba.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ɓai n awyei kpmiwu zhi byiwuu n əshebmana ɓai gye shi wo ɓə gnyi woi gwnulo, aza ngwnu-aba n aje abwuibwuii kpe ɓa kpmiyazhi n ma ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Ɓa gna, “Əfye Agəliliyi, knyiyi nu zhni fyenyi gnyiagnyi zhi fyei shi əshebmana awye a? Yeisu ye, ń a la wo lá n fye aba, woi gwnulo əshemi nyi, wo ɓə jezeɓe n ɓwasnu nlai nu, shi fye gye woi gwnulo əshemi nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Matiyas knyi wa dna n Yahuda apitaɓwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Nlonu Atnutnuloyi ɓa jezezhi Urishelima ɓai kpma n əpekwulu, n a yi nge Zaitu əpe nyi; əzna n əza ɓa zna Sibyiwyi gbmanyi kwoi laka n əzhiyaakwo. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />She ɓa ɓə kwu si, ɓa gwnukpe n nyakwnusni nya aba n ɓa ɓə fyi nyi. Aza aye nu nyi n ɓa ɓə fyi n ɓo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:13" />
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Byitusu, Yohana, Jemyis n Andurui;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Fyilibwus n Tomai,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Batolomyi n Matiyui;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Jemyis Alfyis nugwnu, Sima Ziloti, ɓədo n Yahudai Jemyis nugwnu.<verse eid="ACT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓai yezhi ciici fyi n abagbmanyi n aduwazhni, n kwnusnu n anyikwozai n Mariyamwui Yeisu əya, ɓədo n əwo amajei.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Fyi n anyipyei yi, Byitusu wa laka dna n avyiyi atasni (okwu n ɓa ɓə nyi n bəgyé ngye tagyi-gbmanyi ncei kpe shiiba) <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />wa gna, “Əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, ɓəshishi nu Nyakagyigyiyi kwa nu; n Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə da n saapa, dna n Dawuda əgbe ntu n Yahuda ɓo, n wo ɓə wú aza yi zokwo ń ɓa ɓə wna Yeisu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />A ɓə n woi ba dna n əyi okwu jesnu wo ɓə n əɓwai dna n əyi ɓəvyitnutnu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(N gyiwyei n a ɓə gba wo ntu n əwo əkpízhni ɓo nyi, Yahuda wa si əknyi; n abaayi nu n wo ɓə kaya n tukwoi wu shnishni, əwo nayi kwa cepwo, jesnu əwo agbmi vnyanya ɓaa kwnuya zhi n əbmyi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Əzahozahoyi n Urishelima ɓə kwu ɓəye wo, ntulonu ɓa yi əknyi yi n əɓa əbyei nge Akeldama, n kwo nu gyi nge, Əknyi Ami nya.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Byitusu wa gna, “Ntuge a n kwoi kafyilo n pafyi Zabwura nya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Fa əwo pwuwa kwaa gnyi n zhni agwusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">fa to əzaho wa dna n kwo m,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">jesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Fa əzado wa lodna n əwo əɓwi n gnabyetnutnu.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ntucenu kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu a knyi zaknayi n wo ɓə kwnusnu n yii n əsai vnyanya n Dagayi Yeisu ɓə dna n əyi atasni nyi, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />ənya n kwo ɓə ya n Yohana batizimazhni kwoi lo əsa n a ɓə lá Yeisu n əyi aba gwnulo ncei n əshemi. Ntuge ɓəshishi nu zaknayi n aza ye waa zè ɓəgbmiyi n kwnusnu n yii, əwo kala la nya.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ntulonu ɓa kwnu aza zhi ngwnu-aba: Yusufu n a ɓə yi wo nge Barsabas nyi (n a ɓə je wo yi nge Justus nyi) n Matiyasii. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Nlonu ɓa zhniaduwa, “Dagayi, ho kpe zahozahoyi ədu əye lo. Wu yi əza n ho la knyí n aza ngwnu-aba ye <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />wa la ɓəvyitnutnu ye, n Yahuda ɓə yashi, wa lo da aza n wo ɓə zhni əɓa nya nyi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Nlonu ɓa she əba, jesnu əba kwa wna Matiyas nu; ntulonu aa wo ɓe n atnutnuloyi awocei-gbmanyi yi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓeɓe dna n pyentikwos əwyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />She pyentikwos əwyi ɓə si, əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓe yefyi n aba gbmanyi n kwnusnu. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />N əsagbmanyii, kəsnu ngye ase yaakwo kwa gbmiɓe n əshemi jesnu kwaa nu nyakwnu vnyanya aba n ɓa ɓə sase fyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ɓa gye ənya n kwo ɓə wu ngye əná-anyitala, ɓa gnajeya jesnu ɓa ɓe ɓa yakpe n zahozahoyi n ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa kwu nu n Zafnu Gyigyiyii jesnu ɓa ya ɓai daɓo n anyitala ajei ngye shi Zafnu ɓə ga ɓa kalá.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Nsayii Ayahudiyi Shekwodnawoyi ɓə fyi n Urishelima ɓai kwnu n əknyi dəhodəhoi n anyì. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo kəsnu ye, deeji kwa yezhi n ɓəwowoi, ntuge zahozahoyi ɓə kwu wo ai da əwo əbye. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />N zhi n ɓəwowo yaakwoi, ɓa nyaɓo: “Aza ye vnyanya to zhni Agəliliyi nu m? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />To, kwa ze n wunanu zahozahoyi n yi, woi wo əɓa ɓəda dna n əwo əbye mama nya a? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Apatiyi, Amyedeyi n Aəlamyitiyi; aza n ɓa fyi n Myesopwotamyinya, Yahuda n Kapadosiyai, Pwontus n Asiyai, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Fyirgiya n Pamfyiliyai, Masar n Libyiya səpa hoi n kwo wo vyivyiwyi n Sirenii nyi; azhiɓeyi n ɓa kwnu n Roma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(Ayahudiyi n kwnusnu n azai n ɓa kwu vyi Ayahudiyi kwnunu); Akəretiyi n Arabyiyii; ya wo ɓai da Shekwoyi aɓəwowoi n əyi anyitalai!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />N zhi n ɓəwowoi jesnu n vnyivnyii, ɓa nya aje əɓo, “Dəye wu knyiɓei nu a?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ama azahoo da, ɓa kpe ɓa agyè nu ɓa gna, “Əje nu n ɓai kwnúgbe zhi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu awyeknaya ga deeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Nlonu Byitusu wa laka gnyi n kwnusnu n awocei-gbmanyi yi, wa la bəgye tu jesnu wa ga deeji awyeknaya: “Əmi Ayahudiyi aje, n əfyei vnyanya n fye fyilo n Urishelima nyi, fye fa ma ga fye ɓəye awyega; fye kna əɓo tnubwa pəceye n mi da nyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aza ye to n əjei nu sni zhi, ngye shi fye zhninubwo nyi m. Snukna ciwagbmanyi laabmi nya nu ye ɓwagnyi! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Aawo, əɓo nu nyi n sheɓəgwognayi Jowel ɓə da:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘Fyi n anyipyei kpmaknai, Shekwoyi da lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Mi ɓə zè əmi Zafnu kpe n aza vnyanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Əfye anugwnu n anyigwnui ɓa ɓə da sheɓəgwogna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">əfye aɓyikasa ɓə fyi n ɓəwyegye dna n Zafnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">əfye azakwoi ɓə nu ana.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kwo kpe n əmi atnutnuyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">azanugbai n anyikwozai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">Mi ɓə la əmi Zafnu zekpe ɓa fyi n anyipyei yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">jesnu ɓa ɓə da sheɓəgwogna.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mi ɓə wu aɓo awowoi kpe n ashebmana əsnii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">jesnu n aznùi kpe n əknyi snuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ami n ənái ɓədo n awú akwoloi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Nyipyei ɓə la pmyibma kwaa zè wyegbma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">jesnu əpya ɓə la pmyibma kwaa zè ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">nabai əwyi yaakwo n latu Dagayi nyai kwoi kpe ɓe.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Njesnu zahozahoyi n wo yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Dagayi əye, wo ɓə la pwo.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Əmi Aisrailayi aje, fye kna ɓəye tnubwa: Yeisu Nazeretiyi ɓə zhni əza nu n Shekwoyi ɓə knyí ga fye n aɓo wowoi, aɓo awowoi n aznùi ado n Shekwoyi ɓə wu dna n əfye atasni dna n wo, ngye shi fye kpəlo n əfyehni nyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ama Shekwoyi n əwo ɓəmwushi tnadoshnai, n wo ɓə pma əkwo əɓo yekpé n sapa; wo ɓə la Yeisu taya ga fye jesnu n bmazhni akpizhniyi nyai, fyaa wo wu, fya knyi wo akwusa tu n znudu. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ama Shekwoyi waa wo laka n əfyi, waa wo loya n azhnìgye əfyi nya, ntuge kwo to ɓə ɓa yezhni əfyi kwaa wo shiɓwa dna m. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dawuda ɓə kwu əɓo da tu n əwo ɓo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“ ‘Mi ɓə kwu gye Dagayi əwye gnyi n əmi abye ciici.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Ntuge wo gnyilo n əmi ɓwaizheɓwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">mi taa shnashna m.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ntucenu əmi ədu n agbmadai lo jesnu əmi nyitala kwoi dagbma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">əmi nayi ce, kwo ɓə la snu dna n awyetu,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />ntuge ho to ɓə lá mi zamwi dna n akwu m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ho to ɓə ye əho əza gyigyiyi nge wo bwo m.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ho kwu awogye anyìgyi nya wu mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ho ɓə nu mi n agbmadai gnyi n əho abye.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Əmi Aisrailayi aje, mi da fye əɓo n agwumyii, nge dada-zakwoi Dawuda ɓə la fyí, aa wo byi, jesnu əwo vnyigwo shilo n ya, nya n naiye. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ama wo ɓə zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu jesnu wa kwu kpe nge Shekwoyi ɓə la ɓəgbeshi shi wo n nyasíi ge, wo ɓə la əwo əɓyi ho tu n əwo əbeshnikpegye. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Wo ɓə kwu əɓo gyewye n kwo ɓə ye kwa ɓe, wa da Kirisiti kala la ɓo, nge a to ɓə fa wo dna n akwu m, kwo əwo nayi kwoi bwo m. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Shekwoyi wo la Yeisu ye laka gnyi n wyewyeyi, jesnu əyi vnyanya yi zhni əkwo aɓəgbmiyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />A la wo latu gnyi n Shekwoyi ɓwaizheɓwa, wo la ɓəgbeshi Zafnu Gyigyiyi nya gwo n Dada aba, jesnu wo la anabəlika zekpe, n fye gyewye nsaiye jesnu fyei wo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Ntuge Dawuda to ɓə gwnulo əshemi m, dudulonu wa gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“ ‘Dagayi ɓə kwu gna əmi Dagayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“La sasetu n əmi ɓwaizheɓwa<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />nya əsa ń mi ɓə zhni əho anuwnuyi ɓa kwu zè əho apitakpeba.” ’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Ntucenu fa Israila vnyanya kwa kwu ɓəye kpeye nge ɓəhnihnii nu: Yeisu ye, n fye ɓə la wo znudu nyi, Shekwoyi la wo zè Dagayi n Masifui.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Shi aza ɓə wo ɓəye, kwaa əɓa adu saya, ɓa gna Byitusu n atnutnuloyi ajei, “Əyi azaje, knyiyi nu n yi ɓa zhni a?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye yeabwi jesnu a zhni fye batizima, zahozahoyi n fye, dna n Yeisu Kirisiti əye ntu əfye aleifyi zo əɓo. Nlonu fye ɓa gwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi nyaga. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ntuge ɓəgbeshi ye zhni əfye nya nu, n əfye aɓyii, jesnu ntu n aza vnyanya ɓo, n ɓa lo n kpaai, jesnu ntu n aza vnyanya ɓo n Dagayi əyi Shekwoyi ɓə yi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />N aɓədagbma bəgyé ajei, wa kwnù ɓa; jesnu wa tna ɓa əɓwa, “Fye gnyi əfyehni n cala wnuwnuiya ye.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə gwo əwo ɓəda, a zhni ɓa batizima, jesnu aza ngye adugwu-ata ɓa kwu sheɓe ɓa n bəgyé n əwyii.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Avyiyi jedoɓəzhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Ɓa kwu əɓahni ga fyi n atnutnuloyi nyawu n jedoɓəzhnii, ga nyagyi gyi n aduwazhnii. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Zahozahoyi waa nu n ɓəwowoi ntu n aɓo awowoi bəgyé nyai, n aznùi n atnutnuloyi ɓə zhni. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Avyiyi vnyanya ɓa ɓə kwnusnu n ajei jesnu ɓai zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n ɓwaidnado. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ɓa kwnu aknyi n anyaɓwai, nabai ɓa ga əzahozahoyi n wo ɓə dna n snagyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Wyihowyihoi ɓa gwodu ɓai yezhi n abagbmanyi fyi n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí. Ɓai gyi nyagyi fyi n əɓa apwuwa jesnu ɓai kwnu nyagyi gyi n ajei fyi ń abwugbada jesnu n adu agaiciya nyai, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />ɓai ci Shekwoyi jesnu ɓai wo agbmada aza vnyanya bmyashi nya. Njesnu Dagayi woi ɓe ɓa bəgyé fyegyifyegyi, aza yi n ɓa ɓə gnyi ɓai ɓwa gnyignyi nyi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Byitusu ká zabmazhi nyaɓayi gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />N əwyihoi Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai gwnulo Dagayipwuwa n aduwazhni əsai, n əkwo nu nyi n snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyeii. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Nsayii, əza n a ɓə ma wo n bmazhi, a ɓə gnyi ai la wo lo ncei n Dagayipwuwa alofyiba n a yi ge Bmyabmyai nyi, aba n a ɓə n woi shi, wyihowyihoi woi ɓanya n aza yi n ɓa lofyi ń Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí nyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />She wo ɓə gye Byitusu n Yohanai ɓai ye ɓa lofyi n Dagayipwuwa, wa ɓa ɓa gyiwye. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa shi wo awye cewo. Nlonu Byitusu wa gna, “Shi yi awye!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ntulonu əza yi waa əwye byece ɓa, n awyetui ge ɓa ɓá ga wo nyaho.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Nlonu Byitusu wa gna, “Azulufa kwo zinali mi to ncei lo m, ama ənya n mi ncei lo mi ga ho kwo nu. Dna n Yeisu Kirisiti Nazeretiyi əye, laka ha znazna.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Wa shi wo ń ɓwaizhe wa bma wo zhni, wa laka gnyi, jesnu n əsagbmanyii, əza yi apitabwada n akwulokwuloi ɓa kwu kalá ɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Wa laka gnyiagnyi ɓá! Nlonu wa ya znazna. Njesnu wa lodna n kwnusnu n ɓai n Dagayipwuwa woi znazna, woi gyeagna jesnu woi ci Shekwoyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />She aza vnyanya ɓə gye wo əwye woi znazna jesnu woi ci Shekwoyi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />aza ɓa kwu wo kpeye nge əza yi nu ń wo ɓə zhni woi sase shi woi ɓanya n Dagayipwuwa aduba n a yi Bmyabmyai nyi, ɓa kwu nu zhi n əɓo wowoi jesnu n agbei yaɓwa ntu n əɓo ɓo n kwo ɓə kwu zhni wo nyi.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu daɓo n aɓogyeyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Əza yii ye gnyi n Byitusui shiɓwa n Yohanai, ca wo aza vnyanya, ɓa ɓe da ɓa n əsii n aba n a yi nge Sulemanu ashilagyí nyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />She Byitusu ɓə gye ɓəye əwye, wa gna ɓa: “Əmi Aisrailayi aje, knyiyi nu zhni ɓəye kwoi wo fye a? Knyiyi nu zhni fyei shi əyi awye ngye n əyi kalái nu, kwo n əyi gyigyii nu, n əza ye gnyi woi znazna a? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Shekwoyi Ibrahim nya, Ishakwu n Yakwuɓwui, Shekwoyi əyi adada nya, wo la əwo tnutnuyi Yeisu latu. Fye ɓə la wo taya ga nge a wu, jesnu fyaa əwo aɓəna n Byilatusu abye, kwo shikwonyi wo ɓəə la bwugbadna wa ya wo əɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Fyaa Gyigyiyi n Ɓəfyecezhniyi aɓəna, fya gna nge a la zawuyi loya ga fye. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Fyaa wyewyeyi gáyi wu, ama Shekwoyi waa wo laka n əfyi. Yi zhni ɓəye aɓəgbmiyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ń gaiciyaganunui dna n Yeisu əye, n əza ye n fye gye wo əwye nyi, jesnu fyei kpe wo əye nyi, n wa ɓwa kala. Yeisu əye nu n gaiciyaganunui, n kwo ɓe dna n Yeisu nyi, n kwo la kágna nunui ga wo, ngye shi əfye vnyanya zhi fyei gyewye nyi.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Nsaiye, əmi Aisrailayi aje, mi kpəlo nge fye ɓə zhni əɓo ye dna ntna gənyikpe nu, ngye shi əfye abyegyii ɓə zhni nyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ama zokwo nu nyi n Shekwoyi ɓə nu əɓo n wo ɓə kwu pmada fyi n əwo sheaɓəgwognayi vnyanya agbe, woi gna ge əwo Kirisiti ɓə gyeazhnì. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nsaiye fye yeabwi, fya pmyiawye ɓe da Shekwoyi, ntulonu a ɓa zo əfye aleifyi, nabai n zhishni əsa, ɓa myi kwa gbmiɓe da fye n Dagayi aba, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />jesnu n wo ɓə myi wa tnu n Kirisitii, n a la wo knyi ga fye, n əwo nu zhni Yeisu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ɓəshishi nu əshemi kwa gwo wo, nya əsa n Shekwoyi ɓə jezeɓe n nyahonyahoii, ngye shi wo ɓə shi əgbe n sapa fyi n əwo sheaɓəgwognayi agyigyiyi agbe nyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Ntuge Mwusa ɓə kwu gna, ‘Dagayi əfye Shekwoyi ɓə la sheɓəgwognayi kala gnyi ga fye, ngye əmi, dna n əfye aza atasni; ɓəshishi nu fyei kna ɓəhoɓəhoi tnubwa n wo gna fye. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Zahozahoyi n wo to kna wo tnubwa m, a ɓə la wo gbmiya n əwo aza kpeekpe.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />“Ɓəhnihni, ənya n kwo laka n Samwula, sheɓəgwognayi vnyanya n ɓa kwu ɓəda da, ɓa kwu anyipyei ye ɓo pmada. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Fye nu zhni sheaɓəgwognayi aɓyi ɓədo n ɓəgbeshii n Shekwoyi ɓə shi n əfye adadai nyi. Wo ɓə gna Ibrahim, ‘Dna n əho ayawyi nu n aza vnyanya n anyì ɓə ɓwa anabəlika.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />She Shekwoyi ɓə la əwo tnutnuyi kala gnyi, wa tnu n woi kpmisnui ga fye wa tu fye anabəlika woi pmyi zahozahoyi awye ya, n əfye n akpizhni azokwo.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Byitusu n Yohanai zhi n Sahindiri abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Apirisiti n Dagayipwuwa abagwuyi tukwodai ɓədo n Asadusiyii, ɓa ɓe da Byitusu n Yohanai əsa n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai daɓo n azai. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Ɓa ɓə zhi n bwugbawnu yaakwoi nu, ntuge atnutnuloyi ɓə zhi ɓai wunya jesnu ɓai zhni waazi Yeisu kala la nya n əfyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ɓa wna Byitusu n Yohanai, ɓa kwu ɓa fyi n zhalu nya fyegyi, ntuge wyeshe ɓə la she. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ama aza bəgyé n ɓa ɓə wo ɓəda nyi, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga; ntulonu azanugbai n ɓa ɓə ga gaiciya nyi, ɓa ɓə kwu snu ngye adugwu-atnu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, abegyiyi, abyeda n owa anyawuyii ɓa gwnudo fyi n Urishelima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anas pirisiti dnagbmai ɓə gnyi n abaayi, Kayafas ɓə gnyi n ɓo ce, Yohana, Alekzanda n azajei n ɓa kwnu n pirisiti dnagbmai pwuwa nyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Ɓa gna a ɓe ɓa n Byitusu n Yohanai n əɓa abye jesnu ɓa ya ɓa aɓənya: “N knyi kalái nu kwo əye n fya zhni ɓəye ncei a?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Nlonu Byitusu, n nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, wa gna ɓa: “Abegyiyi n abyeda əknyi nyai! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ngye a n əyii yizhi, ya ga nyadokwu nu n naiye, ntu n tnutnu manai ɓo n a zhni əzabmazhi ye, ngye əcenu zhni ai nya yi əɓo shi wa ɓwa kágna n wu, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />nlonu fye kwu ɓəye kpeye, əfye n Aisrailayii vnyanya: A zhni kwo dna n Yeisu Kirisiti Nazereti əye nu, n fye ɓə znudu nyi, ama Shekwoyi ɓə la wo laka n əfyi, n əwoi nu n kwo zhni əza ye gnyi n kágna n əfye abye. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yeisu zhni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Kwuta nu n əfye anyamiyi ɓə la kwo aɓəna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">əkwo nu la zè nyakwnu ɓwakwonu kwuta.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ata shna gnyignyi ɓwa n əzaho m, ntuge əye ədo to shnasnu lo ń əshemi snuta, n a la ga azanyikwoci n kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu, ya pwo n əkwoi m.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Shi ɓa ɓə gye Byitusu agwumyi n Yohana nyai jesnu ɓa kwu kpe nge ɓa to n ənyai babai lo m, azanyikwoci azanga nu ɓwasnu, ca wo ɓa, nlonu ɓa kwu kpe nge aza ye ɓə kwu kwnusnu n Yeisui. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ama shikwonyi ɓa ɓə kwu gye əza n wo ɓə gwo kágna nyi, n kwnusnu n ɓai, to ɓa ɓwa ɓəho n shnasnu n ɓa ɓá da m. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ntulonu ɓa ga əgbe nge ɓa la kwnuya n Sahindiri nabai atukwoda ɓa kwú aɓo kwuaje n ajei. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “Yi ye ya zhni knyiɓei nu n aza yei a? Əzahozahoyi n wo dnalo n Urishelima, wo kpəlo nge ɓa kwu əznù, n a taa kpe əkwo ɓwushi, zhni, jesnu yi taa kpe əkwo aɓəna m. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ama nabai ya kpma əkwo gnamyi lo n abyei, fyi n aza, ɓəshishi nu yaa ɓa kwnù, nge ɓa to je əɓo da dna n əye ye n zahozahoyi m.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nlonu ɓa je ɓa yi fyi, ɓa tu ɓa ɓəgbe nge ɓa to je əɓo da, kwo ɓa wunya, n Yeisu əyei m nanyinanyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ama Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyidei nu dnalo n ofyé n Shekwoyi awyeba a: yi kna əfye nu tnubwa, kwo əwo nya a? Əfye nu ɓa znu ɓəda ye ya ga əfyehni! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ama əyi, yi taa myi to ya daɓo n yi kwu gye jesnu yii wo m.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />She ɓa ɓə kwu ədna je ɓa fyi, ɓa ya ɓa aɓwa, ɓa lo. To ɓa myi ɓa dnabwugba shi ɓa ɓá ga ɓa tata m, ntuge aza vnyanya ɓə zhi ɓai ci Shekwoyi ntu n əɓo ɓo n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni nyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Ntuge əza n wo ɓə ɓwa kágna n ɓəwowoi nyi, wo ɓəə la du aye shiinyi ya.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agaiciyagayi zhniaduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />She a ɓə ya ɓa aɓwa, Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa jezelo da əɓa azaje jesnu ɓa gna ɓa aɓo vnyanya n apirisiti atukwoda n abyeda ɓəə kwu gna ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />She ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye, ɓa kwu əɓa bəgye wú fyi n aduwazhni ga Shekwoyi. Ɓa gna, “Dagayi Ikwoda Duduyi Vnyanya, əho nu ɓə zhni ashebmana n əknyii n shikwoi, n anyahonyahoii n ɓa fyilo ń ɓa nyi.” <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ho ɓə daɓo dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi dna n əyi dada Dawuda əgbe, əho tnutnuyi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Knyiyi nu zhni abye ɓai zhina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">jesnu aza ɓai pakwúlu gbəloi a? <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Asu fyi n əknyi, ɓa la kwukazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">jesnu abegyiyi ɓa kwu əgbepa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">tu n Dagayi tukwo n əwo əza pmyapmyayii.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ɓəhnihni Hiridusu n Pwontus Byilatusui ɓa ɓə kwu gwnudo n abagbmanyi n Abyedoi jesnu n Aisrailayii n ɓa fyi n əzhiyaakwo ye, ɓa pakwúlu tu n Yeisu, əho tnutnuyi gyigyiyi, n ho ɓə pmya wo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ɓa zhni əɓo n əho kalá ǹ əho ɓəyei ɓə ncei pmamwushi, nge kwo ɓə zhni. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nsaiye, Dagayi, shi əɓa ədnafyi awye jesnu ha bma əho atnutnuyi zhni, ɓa da əho ɓədagbma n agwumyi yaakwoi. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ta əho əɓwa ya ha ga kágna jesnu ha wu aznù, n aɓoawowoyii, dna n Yeisu əho tnutnuyi gyigyiyi əye.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />She ɓa ɓə kwu aduwazhni, aba n ɓa ɓə yezhi nyi kwa jeashna. Nlonu a kwu ɓa nu vnyanya n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, ɓa da Shekwoyi ɓədagbma n əgbei myimyii.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agaiciyagayi gná əɓa nyaɓwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Avyiyi vnyanya ɓa ɓə zhni gbmanyi nu n ədu n bwugbai. Zahozahoyi to ɓə nyi n wo ɓə n nyahonyahoii la nge kwo zhni əwo nya nu gbmanyi m, ama ɓa gná nyahonyahoi n ɓa ɓə ncei. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />N kalá yaakwoi, atnutnuloyi ɓa gwodu, ɓa gbmi əɓo tu n Dagayi Yeisu kala la ɓo. Nlonu Shekwoyi shebmyashi ɓə zhni tnutnu n kalá yaakwoi fyi n əɓa vnyanya <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />kwaa zè nge əzaho to ɓə dna n snagyi n əɓa atasni m. Ntuge n asa-asai aza n ɓa ɓə n aknyii, kwo anyakwnu, ɓa kwu ɓa kwnu, ɓa ɓe n agyiwyei anyakwnukwnui nya <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />n atnutnuloyi apita, jesnu a gná, ai ga zahozahoyi n wo ɓə dna əkwo əsna.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yusufu Levyiyi, woi gbmi n Saipwurus, n atnutnuloyi ɓə yi wo nge Banaba nyi (n kwo gyi nge “nugwnu bwugbakaladna nya”), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Wa kwnu əwo əknyi jesnu wa ɓe n gyiwyei wa ya zhi n atnutnuloyi apita.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananiyasi n Safyirai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Nsayi əza ɓə nyi ai yi wo ge Ananiyasi, ɓədo n əwo nyikwoi Safyira, əɓa ce, ɓa ɓə la əknyi kwnú. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />N əwo nyikwo akpéi ɓəhoɓəhoi nya, waa gyiwye kpeshì əwohni, ama wa ɓe n adoi n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, waa kwo yashi n atnutnuloyi abye.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Nlonu Byitusu wa gna, “Ananiyasi, kwa ze n wunanu Shetam wonyi la nu əho ədu knaaknà wonyi zhni hoi ceakata fyi Zafnu Gyigyiyi, ho nyi la gyiwye ho kpeshì əhohni, n ha kwnu əknyi ncei nyi a? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kwo to ɓə zhni əho nya nu, ha kpe kwo kwnu m? Jesnu shi ho ɓə la kwo kwnu, gyiwye to ɓə shi n ho aba nu m? Knyiyi nu na zhni ho nyi zhninubwo ge ho zhni ɓəye pya a? Ho to ɓwa akatáce fyi zanyikwoci nu m, ama fyi Shekwoyi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />She Ananiyasi ɓə wo ɓəye, wa myiya shi wa fyí. Ədna yaakwo kwa wo aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə wo əɓo n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni nyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Nlonu aɓyikasa ho ɓa ɓe, ɓa pwu əwo nayi əje, ɓa gbmiya lo n woi, ɓa byi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />N asnukna ngwnu-ata avnu, əwo nyikwo wa ɓe, to woi kpe əɓo əye n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni m. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Byitusu wa nya wo əɓo, “Gna mi, gyiwye nu nyi n əho n Ananiyasii ɓə kwnu əknyi nyii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Wa gna, “Əə, yi ɓə ɓwa kwo kwnu nlonu nù.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Byitusu wa gna wo, “Kwo ɓə zè n wunanu fya pakwúlu nabai fya tu Zafnu Dagayi nya mwi a? Knatnubwa! Aza apitabwada nu ɓwazhi nyi n abwokwnumi n ɓa byi əho əɓa nyi, jesnu ɓa ɓá gbmiya lo n hoi ce.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />N əsagbmanyii wa myiya shi n əwo apita aba waa fyí. Nlonu aɓyikasa ɓa lo ɓe, ɓa gye wo n fyí shi, ɓa gbmiya lo n woi ɓa byi wo ma əwo əɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ədna yaakwo kwa wo ikilisiya vnyanya jesnu n azai vnyanya n ɓa ɓə kwu aɓo ye wo nyi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atnutnuloyi ká bəgyé gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Amwutuyi ɓa wu aznù bəgyé, n aɓo awowoi fyi n aza. Njesnu avyiyi vnyanya ɓə zhni ɓai yezhi n Sulemanu ashilagyí nu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Əzaho to ɓə myi woi ye əwohni ɓədo n ɓai m, kwo shikwonyi aza ɓə zhni ɓai ga ɓa mwamwa n mwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Dudulonu, azanugbai n anyikwozai ɓə gnyi ɓai gna bəgyé mwamwa n ɓa ga gaiciya dna n Dagayi, nlonu ɓa kwu ɓe ɓa bəgyé. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Ntucenu, aza ɓa ɓe n anyasnayii kpe n adnadna jesnu ɓa kwu ɓa yakpe n agədo n apəcei, nabai kwo n Byitusu jejelukwo nu ɓa ɓwa yakpe azaho n ɓa, woi duya. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Deeji ce kwaa yezhi ɓai kwnu n azhimi n ɓa she Urishelima gwnu nyi, ɓai ɓe n anyasnayii ɓədo n aza yii ń azafnu ajegbmiyi ɓə gna ɓa gnagna, jesnu əɓa vnyanya, a ɓə la ɓa kágna.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atnutnuloyi wyenashe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Nlonu Pirisiti dnagbmai n əwo atnutnuyi ajei vnyanya, n ɓa ɓə kwnu n Asadusiyi okwu nyi, ɓa kwu nu zhi n shewoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ɓa wna atnutnuloyi ɓa kwu ɓa gwufyi n zhalu azagbàyi nya. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ama dna n sukwo yi, maləka Dagayi nya wa gwú zhalu abwokwnumi ya, jesnu wa kwnu ɓa ɓe ncei. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Wa gna, “Fye lo, fye kwu zhi n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, fya gna aza aɓo vnyanya wyewyeyi woiwoi ye nya.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, ɓa lofyi n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, ngye shi a ɓə gna ɓa, ɓa ya aza nyawu. She pirisiti dnagbmai n əwo azajei ɓə si adogwnuba, ɓa yi Sahindiri zhi n abagbmanyi; Israila abyeda ɓa yezhi n nunui: Ɓa tnu tnutnu lo zhalu nge a ɓe n atnutnuloyii.<verse eid="ACT 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama she ɓa ɓə si zhalu, to abagwuyi atukwoda ɓa gye atnutnuloyi n fyi ɓo m. Ntulonu ɓa jezelo ɓa wu alafyiya, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Ya lo yi nyi gye zhalu n gwugnyi myam, n abagwuyii gnyiagnyi zhi n abwokwnumi agbe; ama she ya gwu abaya, yi to gye zahozahoyi n dna m.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />She ɓa ɓə wo alafyiya ye, Dagayipwuwa gwuyi tukwoda n apirisiti atukwodai, ɓa kwu zhi n ɓəyeɓwui, ɓai saaɓo, aba n əɓo ye ɓə zozhi.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Nlonu əzaho wa ɓe wa gna, “Fye kwu gyega! Aza n fye yai ɓa fyi n zhalu nyi, ɓa fyi nu n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí ɓai wunya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />She ɓa ɓə wo dəye, abagwuyi tukwoda wa lo n əwo atukwoda ajei ɓa ɓe n atnutnuloyii. Ɓa to ɓə zhni apma n akalái m, ntuge ɓa ɓə wodna nge aza ɓa knyi ɓa akwuta.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />A lo ɓe n atnutnuloyii jesnu a kwu ɓa zhi n Sahindiri abye, nabai pirisiti dnagbmai wa nya ɓa aɓo. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Wa gna, “Yi ɓə la əgbe tu fye n əwyei bmyibmyii ge fye to je nyawu dna n əye ye m. Dudulonu fye la Urishelima nu gnyi n əfye nyawui, jesnu fye la bwugba dna nabai fya kwu yi zè aɓəgyiyi əza ye ami nya.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Byitusu n atnutnuloyii ajei ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəshishi nu ya shi Shekwoyi ɓəda əɓwa a fa zanyikwoci nya! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Shekwoyi əyi azakwoyi nya, wo ɓə la Yeisu laka n əfyi, əza n fye ɓə gyi wo tu n znudu fya wo wu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Shekwoyi ɓə la wo latu gnyi n əwo ɓwaizheɓwa, wo la zhni Əbeɓyi jesnu n Gnyiyii nabai n wo ɓa myi wa ɓe n Israilai fyi n abwuye jesnu wa zo ɓa aleifyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Yi zhni aɓo ye aɓəkwnuyi nu, nlonu cè, Zafnu Gyigyiyii, əwo nu n Shekwoyi la ga aza yi n ɓa vyi əwo ɓəgbetu nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />She ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye, ɓa kwu zhi n pwunu, jesnu ɓa ye ɓa wu ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama Farisiyi n a ɓə yi wo nge Gamaliya nyi, owa nyawuyi, əwo ń aza vnyanya ɓə zhni ɓai ga wo mwamwa nyi, wa laka gnyi n Sahindiri, wa ga əgbe ge a la aza ye kwnuya zhi n əbmyi kpa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Nlonu wa daɓo n Sahindiri yi: “Aisrailayi, fye zhni ɓəye nubwo pəceye əɓo n fye ye fya zhni kpe aza ye nyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />N əsa avnu nya, Tadiyos ɓə kpeyaɓe, woi gna ge wo zhni əzaho nu, jesnu aza ngye adugwu-anyi ɓa kwu vyi wo. Aa wo wu, əwo avyiyi vnyanya ɓaa gnamyi, əɓo yi to kwa shna tukwogyi m. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ń əwo avnu, Yahuda Gəliliyi wa kpeyaɓe n anyipyei azaba nya, jesnu wa sabye n aza afasayii. Əwohni ce, aa wo wu jesnu əwo avyiyi vnyanya ɓaa gnamyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ntucenu, əɓo n kwo shi nsaiye nyi, mi ga fye shaula: Fye kwu aza ye ɓwa fa lonu! Fye kwu ɓa ya ɓa lo! Ngye əɓa tnutnu ɓətukwo kwo ɓə pá ń zanyikwoci nu, kwo ɓə la zè gbəloi. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ama ngye kwo gbmi n Shekwoyi nu, fye taa myi fya shni kwo ɓəkpma m; fye ɓə ɓwa gye fye zhi fyei snukwnú n Shekwoyii nu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Əwo ɓəda kwaa əɓa bwugba yami. Ɓa yi atnutnuloyi fyi n əmi jesnu ɓaa ɓa gyinaya. Nlonu ɓa tu ɓa ɓəgbe ge ɓa to je ɓəda da dna n Yeisu əye m, nlonu, ɓa ya ɓa aɓwa ɓa lo.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Atnutnuloyi ɓa fa Sahindiri, ɓai nya agbmada ntuge a la ɓa ba fyi n aza n ɓa kwu kwnuce ɓa gyeazhnì vnyinkwo nya ntu n Yeisu əye ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Fyegyifyegyi, fyi n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí jesnu ɓai vyi apwuwa n apwuwai, to ɓa fa nyawu ɓo m kpeekpe, ɓai zhni nabagyi manai waazi nge Yeisu nu zhni Masifu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Anyagyignayi knyiknyi ngwnu-tnaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Fyi n anyipyei yi she amwutuyi ɓə ya bəgyé mwaɓe, Agiriki-ayahudiyi ɓa ceawyi ntu Aibraniyi-ayahudiyi ɓo, ntuge a ɓə la əɓa anyigbayi knàya ma n gnagna, dna n nyagyi gná fyegyifyegyi. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ntulonu Awoceaba yi ɓaa amwutuyi yezhi vnyanya n abagbmanyi ɓa gna, “Kwo taa bmya yaa əyi ɓəvyitnutnu Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nya yashi, nabai ya gná nyagyi m. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Əyi azaje, fye knyi aza ngwnu-tnaaba n əfye atasni, n a kpəlo ge ɓa nunui lo n Zafnui n wyemwai. Yi ɓa kwu tnutnu ye yafyi n əɓa akwnu <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />jesnu ya kwu əyihni ga fyi n aduwazhni ɓədo n ɓədagbma ɓəvyitnutnui.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ɓəmwushi ye kwa kwu da okwu ye vnyanya. Ɓa knyí Istifanus, əza n wo ɓə nunui n gaiciyagai jesnu n Zafnu Gyigyiyii; n Fyilibwusii ce, Pokworus, Nikano, Timon, Pamyena, jesnu Nikwolas woi gbmi n Antiyok, n wo ɓə la vyi Ayahudiyi kwnunu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ɓa ɓe n aza yei n atnutnuloyi aba, aza n ɓa ɓə zhniaduwa kpe ɓa, jesnu ɓa kpe ɓa əɓa aɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ntulonu Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kwa lapwi. Amwutuyi fyi n Urishelima ɓa mwa bəgyé wolowolo, jesnu apirisiti n mwa bəgyé ɓa kwu gaiciyaganunui shi əɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A lá Istifanus wna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Nsayii Istifanus, əza n wo ɓə nunui n Shekwoyi shebmyashi n kalái, wa zhni aɓo wowoi ayaakwo n aznùi fyi n aza. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ntucenu, apaapagnyi kwa laka, kwoi gbmi n aza aba n ɓa kwnu n Ayahudiyibwokwnu Azayayai nya (shi a ɓə zhni ai yi kwo), Ayahudiyi Sireni nya n Alekzandariya ɓədo n aknyii n Kilikiya n Asiyai, n ɓa nu ɓə ya aɓənakpeaje n Istifanusii. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ama to ɓa myi n ɓa gnyiapaapa n wyemwai, n Zafnu ɓə ga wo, əsa n wo ɓə daɓo nyi m.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Nlonu ɓaa kwo yefyi azaho fyaa nge ɓa da ge, “Yi kwu wo Istifanus woi da atukwopmi ɓo tu n Mwusa tukwo n Shekwoyii.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ntulonu ɓa kwu aza bwugbakala zhi, n abyedai ɓədo n owa anyawuyi nyai. Ɓa wna Istifanus ɓa ɓe n woi n Sahindiri. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Ɓa ɓe n Aɓəgbmiyi akatá nya, n ɓa ɓə gbmiɓo, “Əza ye too fa ɓəda daɓo tu n aba-gyigyiyi ye tukwo n owai m. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ntuge yi kwu wo woi gna nge Yeisu Nazeretiyi ye wo ɓa kwu abaye zhniagbma, jesnu wa shná akwnunu do n Mwusa ɓə fa kwo shi yi nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə sase fyi n Sahindiri, ɓa shi Istifanus awye znuu, jesnu ɓa gye əwo awyeba n wu ngye Maləka awyeba.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Istifanus ɓədada ga Sahindiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Nlonu pirisiti dnagbmai wa nya Istifanus əɓo, “Aɓo ye n a kpe ho nyi, ɓa zhni gaiciya nu u?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Wa dna ɓəye ɓəgbe nlai: “Əmi azaje n adadai, fye kna mi tnubwa! Shekwoyi latuyi ɓə la kpeya da əyi dada Ibrahim, woi ye dna n Myesopwotamyinya, wa kpe ɓe wa sase dna n Haran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Shekwoyi wa gna, ‘La əho əknyi fa n əho azai, jesnu ha lo əknyi ń mi ɓa wu ho nyi.’<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />“Ntulonu wa fa Acalidiyi əknyi, wa lo wa sase dna n Haran. N əwo dada əfyi avnu, Shekwoyi wa tnu n woi n əknyi ye, aba n fye sase fyi nsayi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Wo to ɓə ga wo əgwú n ya m, kwo əknyi n pitai gbmanyi m. Ama Shekwoyi waa ɓəgbeshi shi wo ge, əwo n əwo ayawyii n wo avnu, kwo ɓə la zè əɓa əknyi, kwo shikwonyi, n əsayii Ibrahim to ɓə n əɓyii m. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Shekwoyi wa daɓo n woi nlai: ‘Əho ayawyi ɓə kwu zè azhiɓeyi fyi n əknyi n kwo to zhni əɓa nya m, aye tagyi-anyi, jesnu ai kwu ɓa zè afyenu, ai zhni ɓa awyesnugbegye ɓo.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Shekwoyi wa gna, ‘Ama mi ɓə ga əknyi tata n ɓa ɓə zhni kwo fyenu tnutnu nyi, n əkwo avnu, ɓa ɓə kwnu n əknyi yi nabai ɓa ga mi mwamwa zhi n aba ye.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nlonu wa ga Ibrahim ɓəgbeshi nyaznu nya. Ibrahim waa zè Ishakwu dada nlonu waa wo znunya n nyipyei nyimwanyimwai əwo mama nya. Əsa fyewyi Ishakwu waa zè Yakwuɓwu dada, jesnu Yakwuɓwu waa zè dada, adada-azakwoi awoceaba nya.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Ntuge əyi adada-azakwoi ɓə woshe n Yusufui, ɓaa wo kwnú lo Masar n zhni fyenu. Ama Shekwoyi ɓə kwnusnu n woi <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />jesnu wa wo gwoya n azhnìgye vnyanya. Waa wyemwa ga Yusufu, jesnu wa bma wo zhni wa ɓwa bmyashi n Fyirauna, əsu Masariyi nya aba. Ntulonu Fyirauna waa wo zè begyii tu n Masar ɓədo n əwo galukwoi vnyanya.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />“Nlonu myikwnu nazhii kwa losa Masar vnyanya n Kaanai, kwa ɓe n azhnìgye yaakwoi, jesnu to əyi azakwoyi ɓa ɓwa nyagyi m. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Əsa n Yakwuɓwu ɓə wo nge nyagyi lo n Masar, wa tnu əyi azakwoyi tnutnu ɓa lo gnaɓyi kpmisnui. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Əɓa gnaɓyi lolo əɓwa baayi nya, Yusufu wa wu əwo azaje əza n wo ɓə zhni, jesnu Fyirauna wa kwu Yusufu əbye kpeye. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />N dəye avnu, Yusufu wa tnu əwo dada ɓo, Yakwuɓwu n əwo pwuwai vnyanya, əɓa vnyanya shiitnaaba-ceatnu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Nlonu Yakwuɓwu wa shnilo Masar, aba n əfyi ɓə wna wo dna, jesnu aba ń əyi azakwoyi ɓə fyí nyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />A ɓə kwu zhi n əɓa anayii n Shekem jesnu a kwu ɓa fyi n vnyigwo, n Ibrahim ɓəə la si n Hamon anugwnu dna n Shekem shi a ɓə n gyiwyei tu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Shi əsa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi ntuge Shekwoyi wa nu əwo ɓəgbeshi ga Ibrahim, əyi aza n ɓa ɓə fyi n Masar nyi, ɓai la əbye lapata n mwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Nlonu ‘əsu woyi, əza n wo to ɓə kpe Yusufu əye m, wa gwnutu n əbe n Masar.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Wa zhni əyi aza awyesnugbegye ɓo jesnu wa kwu əyi azakwoyi wnasnu woi tu ɓa kalá nge ɓa kwu əɓa aɓyipwutu sheya nabai n ɓa ɓá kwu fyíi.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />“N əsa yi nu n a ɓə ma Mwusa, jesnu wo to ɓə zhni əɓyi azanga nya nu m. Əwo apwuwada ɓa shi wo apya ngwnu-ata. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə lo n woi n əbmyi, Fyirauna nyigwnu wa la wo nlonu wa shi wo ngye əwo nugwnu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />A kwu ɓəyekpe dəhodəhoi n wyemwa n Amasariyi nya wu Mwusa jesnu əwo ɓədada ɓədo n əwo aɓəzhnii ɓə n kalái dna.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“She Mwusa ɓə kwu aye ɓwa shiinyi, wa dnabwugba wa lo əwo aza gnaɓyi, Aisrailayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Wa gye zaknayii gnyi Masariyi woi wna wo əsnu, ntulonu wa lo wo bma wo, jesnu wa gbata ga wo, waa Masariyi wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mwusa ɓə zhninubwo nge əwohni aza ɓa kwu kpe ge Shekwoyi nu ɓəə gnyi woi zhni apma n woi, wa ɓa gwoya, ama ɓa to ɓə kpe ce əye m. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Əfyé kwa gyi zhi, Mwusa wa gye Aisrailayi ngwnu-aba n zhi ɓai snugwu. Wa yì wonyi nabai wa kwu əɓa ogwuwnazhi, woi gna, ‘Əfye, fye zhni əfyehnifyehni nu; knyiyi nu zhni fyenyi ye fya wuaje əɓwa a?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Ama əza n wo ɓə gnyi woi wna əzabaayi əsnu nyi, wa ce Mwusa aɓwaya gnyi n gnagna wa gna, ‘Nyika nu n la ho zhni əbegyiyi n owadayi tu n əyi tukwo a? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ho zhninubwo ge ho ɓa wu mi nu shi ho wui Masariyi nsu nyi?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />She Mwusa ɓə wo lonu, wa bwusi lo Myidiya, aba ń wo ɓə la sase dna n zhni zhiɓeyi jesnu wa kwu aɓyinugbai ɓwa ngwnu-aba.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Shi aye shiinyi ɓəə la duya, maləka wa kpeya da Mwusa dna n əná-anyitala n abwugizhi dna n zhabwikawu n wo vyivyiwyi n Sinai Əpei. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />She wo ɓə gye ɓəye, ca wo wo ənyai n wo ɓə gyewye nyi. Shi wo ɓə yegwu ntuge wa shiawye vyivyiwyi, wa wo Dagayi woi gna: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Əmi nu zhni Shekwoyi əfye adada nya, Shekwoyi Ibrahim nya, Ishakwu n Yakwuɓwui.’ Mwusa wa vnyi n ədnai jesnu to wa ye wa je awyeshi m.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />“Nlonu Dagayi wa gna wo, ‘La abwada kwnu, ntuge aba n ho gnyi nyi, əknyi gyigyiyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ɓəhnihni mi kwu əmi aza snuwna gyewye dna n Masar. Mi kwu əɓa əmìdo wo, jesnu mi la shnizhi nu ma lo ɓa ya. Nsaiye ɓe, mi ɓa tnu ho tnutnu lo Masar.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Mwusa ye nu ɓwasnu n ɓa ɓə la wo aɓəna n aɓədagbma yei, ‘Nyika nu n la ho zhni əbegyiyi n owadayi a?’ Shekwoyi n əwohni tukwoi nu ɓə tnu n woi waa zhni əɓa əbegyiyi n gnyiyii, dna n maləka n wo ɓə kpeya da wo dna n zhabwi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Wa kwnu ɓa ya n Masar jesnu wa zhni aɓo wowoi n aznùi dna n Masar, n Shikwo Byei jesnu, aye shiinyi fyi n zhabwikawu.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Mwusa ye nu n wo ɓə gna Aisrailayi, ‘Shekwoyi ɓə la sheɓəgwognayi kala gnyi ga fye, ngye əmi, dna n əfye aza atasni.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Wo ɓə dna n adogwnuba dna n zhabwikawu, n kwnusnu n maləkai n wo ɓə daɓo n woi tu n Sinai Əpe nyi, jesnu n əyi azakwoyii; wa gwo aɓədagbma awyewyeyi nya wa kwu ɓa ga nabai ai ga yi.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Ama əyi azakwoyi to ɓə ye əwo ɓəda ɓwashi ɓo m. N əkwoɓwi, ɓaa əwo aɓəna jesnu fyi n əɓa adu, ɓaa jezelo Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ɓa gna Haruna, ‘Zhni ashekwoyi ga yi n ɓa ɓá gyilo n əyi abye. Ama Mwusa ye n wo ɓə kwnu n yii n Masar nyi, yi ta kpe əɓo əye lo n kwo kwu zhni wo m!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Əsa nu n ɓa ɓə zhni əshna dna n nakwoɓyiyi dogbe. Ɓa kwnu anyakwnukwnu ga kwo, jesnu ɓa dagbma fyi ń ənya n əɓa aɓwa ɓə zhni. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ama Shekwoyi waa awye pmyiya n əɓa aba, jesnu wa kwu ɓa ga fyi nabai ɓa gba nyipyei n əpyai ɓədo n akpasii. Dəye kwo la lodo n əɓoi n kwo kafyilo n sheɓəgwognayi pafyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Israila aza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">fye ɓə kwu ɓe mi n anyakwnukwnui n anyagai n aye shiinyi fyi n zhabwikawu?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Fye la dagayilubwi Molek nya shignyi jesnu n kpasii əfye shekwoyi Refam nya, ashna n fye ɓə zhni nabai fya gba ɓa. Ntucenu mi ɓa tnu n fyei fyi n okwnula wnawna n fyi n Babyila abye.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Əyi azakwoyi ɓə n Dagayilubwi, owa ɓəgbeshi nyai shi n kwnusnu n ɓai fyi n zhabwikawu. A ɓə zhni kwo shi Shekwoyi ɓə ga Mwusa əgbe nu, ngye ədo n wo ɓəə kwu gyewye nyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />She ɓa ɓə la Dagayilubwi gwo, əyi azakwoyi fyi n Joshuwa əsa, ɓa ɓe n kwoi shi, əsa n ɓa ɓə gyi abye yi əknyi n okwnui, n Shekwoyi ɓə nya ɓa ya nyi. Kwo ɓə la dna n əknyi yi nya Dawuda əsa, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />n wo ɓə kwu Shekwoyi bmyashi agbmada wo nyi, jesnu wa nyaɓo nabai wa zhni ashiba ga Shekwoyi Yakwuɓwu nya. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama Sulemanu nu ɓə mi nyakwnu ga Shekwoyi.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Kwo shikwonyi, Ikwoda Duduyi Vnyanya taa dna n anyakwnu n azanyikwoci nu naa mi n əɓa aɓwai m. Ngye shi sheɓəgwognayi ncei da lo: <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Dagayi da lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">“ ‘Əshemi nu zhni əmi əbeshnikpegye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">jesnu əknyi nu zhni əmi apitakpeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Knyi nyakwnui pya nu n fye ɓa mi ga əmi a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Kwo əmi asnusnuba gnyi n nanu a?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Əmi aɓwa nu to ɓə zhni anya ye vnyanya m?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Əfye atukwo agnanakwoyi! Əfye adu n atnubwai ye zhi lo n tnanyaznui. Fye ɓwa wulo ngye əfye azakwoyi nu: Fyei gnyiapaapa n Zafnu Gyigyiyii ciici. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Sheɓəgwognayi ho ɓə nyì n əfye azakwoyi to ɓə she wo əwyena m? Ɓa ɓə dudu ɓa kwu aza yi wu n ɓa ɓə da ɓəwyegye Ɓəfyeceyi ɓəɓe nya ɓo nyi. Nsaiye fye la wo ɓwi jesnu fye la wo wu, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />əfye n fye la owa gwo n amaləka ɓə gwo ga fye nyi, ama fye too shi kwo əɓwa m.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A knyi Istifanus akwuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />She Sahindiri aza ɓə wo dəye, ɓa kwu pwunu jesnu ɓa gyi əɓa anyikna ntu n əwo ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama Istifanus, n nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, wa kpewyewu n əshemi wa gye Shekwoyi latu, jesnu Yeisu n gnyiagnyi gnyi n Shekwoyi ɓwaizheɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Wa gna, “Fye shiawye, mi kwu gye əshebemi n gwuya gnyi jesnu Əza Nugwnu n gnyiagnyi gnyi n Shekwoyi ɓwaizheɓwa.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ntu n dəye ɓo, ɓa kwu əɓa atnubwa gwu jesnu, ɓa fyiakwu n abəgye akalá nyai, əɓa vnyanya ɓa yepwi wo, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />ɓa gnyì wo, ɓa gbmi wo ya gnyi n əzhiyaakwo əbmyi jesnu ɓa ya wo akwuta knyi. Əsa ń aɓəgbmiyi ɓə lo akwutaknyi, ɓa kwu əɓa aje ya zhi n əɓyikasa aba ai yi wo ge Soolu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ɓai ye zhi ɓai knyi wo akwuta, Istifanus wa zhniaduwa, “Dagayi Yeisu, gwo əmi wyewyeyi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Nlonu wa myiya shi n əwo anyikwutukwoi wa ciɓwi, “Dagayi, to la leifyi ye ba fyi ɓa m.” Shi wo ɓə kwu ɓəye da, wa wnagye.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Njesnu Soolu ɓə n əɓwai tu n əwo wuwu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Ikilisiya wyenashe n kwo gnamyii</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Dna n əwyi yii, wyenashe yaakwo kwa laka gnyi tu n Ikilisiya dna n Urishelima, jesnu aza vnyanya akpəge atnutnuloyi ɓaa gnamyi fyi laɓa n Yahuda əknyi n Samariyai. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Shekwoyi-adnawoi ɓa byi Istifanus jesnu ɓa zhni bwugbazhii yaakwo ntu n əwo ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama Soolu wa ya ikilisiya agbmazhni. Woi vyi apwuwa n apwuwai, wa kwnu azanugbai n anyikwozai wa kwu ɓa fyi n zhalu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyilibwus dna n Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓəə la gnamyi nyi, ɓa zhni ɓədagbma waazi n ɓwahoɓwahoi n ɓa ɓə kwu lo. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Fyilibwus wa shnilo əzhiyaakwo n Samariya jesnu wa da Masifu əɓo n abaayi. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />She deeji ɓə wo Fyilibwus ɓəda jesnu ɓa gye aznù n wo ɓə wu nyi, əɓa vnyanya ɓa kwu tnubwakna dəidəi n əɓo n wo ɓə da nyi. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ntuge ǹ akwufyii nu n abəgyei kwuwu ń azafnu ajegbmiyi ɓə kwnuya n aza bəgyé, jesnu bəgyé n ɓa ɓə n anayii fyífyii ɓədo n azabmazhii, ɓa kwu kágna ɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ntulonu agbmada yaakwo ɓə nyi dna n əzhiyaakwo yi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sima zokwusheyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kwo ɓə la mwasa əzaho ai yi wo ge Sima, wo ɓə zhni woi she zokwu nu dna n əzhiyaakwo, jesnu wo ɓə kwu aza bwugba vnyanya wna n Samariya; wo ɓə myi woi zhni aɓo wowo gbowogbowo. Wo ɓə gyigbe nge wo zhni əzayaakwo ho nu, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />jesnu aza vnyanya, awyekpmiwuyi n azasukwui, ɓa kwu əɓa abwugba ga wo jesnu ɓa gna, “A ɓə lá əye kpe əza ye tu nge, Kalá Yaakwo Shekwoyi nya.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Ɓa ɓə kwu vyi wo ntuge əsa ɓə la mwa woi zhni aɓo wowo ga ɓa n əwo zokwushei. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ama she ɓa ɓe kwu gaiciyaga Fyilibwus, shi wo ɓə da nabagyi manai, Shekwoyi əbemi nya ɓədo n Yeisu Kirisiti əyei, a kwu batizima zhni ɓa, azanugbai n anyikwozai. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Sima n əwohni tukwoi ce, waa gaiciyaga jesnu a kwu batizima zhni wo. Jesnu wa vyi Fyilibwus lo ɓwahoɓwahoi, aznù yaakwo əɓo, ɓə wo wo ɓədo n aɓo awowoi n wo ɓə gyewye nyi.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />She atnutnuloyi n ɓa ɓə fyi n Urishelima nyi, ɓə wo nge Samariya kwo la Shekwoyi ɓədagbma gwo, ɓa tnu Byitusu tnutnu ɓədo n Yohanai, ɓa lo Samariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə si əzhi yi, ɓa zhniaduwa ga agaiciyagayi awoiwoyi n abaayi, nabai n ɓa ɓa myi ɓai gwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ntuge Zafnu Gyigyiyi to ɓəə ɓe kpe n zahozahoyi n ɓa kpa m; a ɓəə ɓwa ɓa batizima nu zhni dna n Dagayi Yeisu əye. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Nlonu Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa kpe ɓa əɓa aɓwa, jesnu ɓa gwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />She Sima ɓə gye aza ɓai gwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi ntu atnutnuloyi aɓwa kpekpe ɓo, wa ga ɓa gyiwye <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />wa gna, “Fye ga mi ikwo ye cè, nabai zahozahoyi n ma kpe wo əmi aɓwa, n wo ɓa myi wa gwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe: “Fa əho gyiwye kwo shni n hoi, ntuge ho zhninubwo nge ho ɓa myi ha si Shekwoyi nyaga nu n gyiwyei! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ho to n aɓwadnabai lo kwo nyaho n ho ɓa toɓwa n ɓəvyitnutnu ye m, ntuge əho ədu to bmyalo n Shekwoyi awye m. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Yeabwi n əkpizhni ye jesnu ha zhniaduwa ga Dagayi n awyetui nge wo ɓa ye wa zo əho aleifyi ntu ɓənubwozhni ye pya ɓo, əho ədu nya. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ntuge mi kwu gye nge ho nunui lo n bwugbalilii, jesnu leifyi n hoi papai lo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Nlonu Sima wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zhniaduwa ga Dagayi ga mi nabai n nyahonyahoi n ho kwu da nyi, n kwo taa zhni mi m.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />She ɓa ɓə kwu pwo Dagayi ɓədagbma waazizhni, jesnu ɓai la əɓo gbmitu n Yeisu tukwo, Byitusu n Yohanai ɓa jezelo Urishelima, ɓai zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya fyi n azhigba bəgyé Asamariyayi nya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyilibwus n Etiyopyiyayii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Nsayi maləka Dagayi nya wa gna Fyilibwus, “Shnilo snuta lo zokwo, zhabwikawu nya, n kwo gbmi n Urishelima kwoi shnilo Gaza nyi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ntulonu wa wna əzna, jesnu lo ń zokwo wa gye Etiyopyiyayi zakakayi tukwoda yaakwo; əsu nyikwoza Kandake nya, ń nyaɓwasofyi vnyanya ɓə fyi n əwo akwnu nu nyi. Əza ye ɓə lo mwamwaga nu n Urishelima, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />jesnu dnalo n zokwo woi jezelo apyi, n sasetu n əwo snukna-dokwo woi ba Pafyi sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya nya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Zafnu wa gna Fyilibwus, “Lo da snukna-dokwo yi haa wo vyivyiwyi n kwoi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Nlonu Fyilibwus wa bwusi lo da snukna-dokwo, wa wo əza yi woi ba sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya. Fyilibwus wa nyaɓo, “Ho ɓwa awyega lo ənya n ho ba nyi?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Wa gna, “Mi ɓa ɓwa awyega n wuna, n əzaho nu to wu mi əkwo awyega ma a?” Ntulonu wa yì Fyilibwus nge wo gwnutu waa sasetu n kwnusnu n woi.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Əɓwi nu nyi n Nyakagyigyiyi n zakakayi ɓə dna woi ba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“A ɓə lo n woi ngye əknyi nu a znu əsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">jesnu ngye kwugyasnáyi, n əkwo əyi mwayi aba, n gnyi pyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ntulonu wo to ɓə kpe əwo əgbe ya m.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Dna n əwo snuwna a ɓə la ɓəda wo woɓyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Nyika nu ɓa da əwo ayawyi ɓo a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ntuge a ɓə la əwo wyewyeyi gbmi n anyì.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Zakakayi wa nya Fyilibwus əɓo, “Sukwu, gna mi, nyika nu n sheɓəgwognayi ɓə da əwo ɓo a, əwohni nu kwo əzado nu gbowo a?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Nlonu Fyilibwus wa ya n əɓwùyi ń nyaka yi ɓə gbmi n Nyakagyigyiyi nyi, wa gna wo nabagyi manai Yeisu nya.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Shi ɓa ɓə fyilo n əzna lo n zokwoi, ɓa si nuwna aba jesnu zakakayi wa gna, “Shiawye, nuwna fyi nyi. Knyiɓei nu ɓa kpma mi batizima zhni a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:36">[<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Fyilibwus wa gna, “Ndəi ho la gaiciyaga n əho ədui vnyanya, a ɓa myi a zhni ho batizima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">Zakakayi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi la gaiciyaga nge Yeisu Kirisiti nu zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu.”] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Njesnu wa ga əgbe nge a la snukna-dokwo kpegnyi. Nlonu Fyilibwus n zakakayii ɓa kafyi n nuwna jesnu Fyilibwus wa zhni wo batizima. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe n nuwna, Zafnu Dagayi nya wa la Fyilibwus n əsagbmanyii, jesnu to zakakayii wa shna wo wyegye m, ama wa gwodu lo n zokwoi woi dagbma. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ama Fyilibwus wa kpeyagnyi n Azotus jesnu wa zna laɓa woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya n azhi vnyanya nya əsa n wo ɓə la si Kaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Soolu abwuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Aɓwazhilo, Soolu woi ye gnyi woi snu əsnu azawu nya kpe Dagayi amwutuyi. Wa lo da pirisiti dnagbmai <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />wa nya wo apa kakai əɓo wa lo ncei n Ayahudiyibwokwnu n ɓa fyi n Damaskwos nyi, nabai n wa gye zahozahoyi n dna n ɓo woi vyi zokwo ye, azanugbai kwo anyikwoza, n wo ɓa myi wa wna ɓa ɓe ncei n Urishelima n zhni azhaluda. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Shi wo ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Damaskwosii, n əsagbmanyii bwuznagna kwoi gbmi n əshemi kwa bmyana fyi wo n shegwnu wo. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Wa myiya shi n əknyi jesnu wa wo bəgye kwoi gna wo, “Soolu, Soolu, knyiyi nu zhni hoi she mi əwyena a?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Soolu wa nyaɓo, “Ho zhni nyika nu a Dagayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmi nu Yeisu, n ho gnyi hoi she mi əwyena nyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Nsaiye laka ha lodna n əzhiyaakwo, a ɓə gna ho əɓo n kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ha zhni.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Aza n ɓa ɓə kwnu znazna n Soolui, ɓa kwu zhi gbegyégyé; ɓa kwu bəgye wo ama to ɓa gye zahozahoyi əwye m. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Soolu wa laka n əknyi wa gnyiagnyi, ama shi wo ɓə kpe əwo awye ya, to wa gyewyeba m. Ntulonu ɓa shi wo əɓwa, ɓa lofyi n Damaskwos. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Wa kwu anyipyei ɓwa ngwnu-ata n awyei bwabwai, jesnu to wa gyi nyagyi kwo wa sni nyahonyahoi m.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Dna n Damaskwos, mwutuyi ho ɓə dna n ɓo ai yi wo nge Ananiyasi. Dagayi wa yì wo dna n ɓəwyegye, “Ananiyasi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə, Dagayi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Dagayi wa gna wo, “Lodna n Yahuda pwuwa tu n Dnadna Cewoi jesnu hoi nya əza ɓo n wo gbmi n Tarsus ai yi wo ge Soolu nyi, ntuge wo dnalo woi zhniaduwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Dna n zafnu ɓəwyegye, wo ɓə kwu gye əza ai yi wo əye ge Ananiyasi, wa ɓe wonyi kpe wo əwo aɓwa ntuge wa je wyebagye.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiyasi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi mi kwu anabagyi bəgyé wo ntu əza ye ɓo n ɓwawui vnyanya n wo kwu zhni kpe əho aza gyigyiyi fyi n Urishelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Jesnu wo la ɓe n ya n ikwoi n kwo gbmi n apirisiti atukwoda aba, wa wna aza vnyanya n ɓa yi əho əye.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ama Dagayi wa gna Ananiyasi, “Laka ha lo! Əza ye zhni əmi tnutnuyi knyiknyiyi nu, wa da əmi əye ɓo ga Abyedo n əɓa asui jesnu ga Aisrailayi. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mi ɓa wu wo ge ɓəshishi nu she wo ɓa gyeazhnì nsnu ntu n əmi əye ɓo.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Nlonu Ananiyasi wa lo wa lodna n pwuwa yi. Wa kpe əwo aɓwa n Soolu, wa gna, “Əmizado Soolu, Dagayi Yeisu, n wo ɓə kpeya da ho n zokwo, əsa n ho ɓə gnyi hoi ɓe n ya nyi, wo la tnu n mii nabai ha je wyebagye jesnu haa nu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />N əsagbmanyii, anyaho ngye anyafnu ɓa kaya n Soolu awye jesnu wa je wyebagye. Wa laka gnyi a zhni wo batizima, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />jesnu she wo ɓə kwu nyagyi gyi, wa je akalá ɓwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Soolu dna n Damaskwos n Urishelimai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Soolu wa kwu anyipyei bəgyé ɓwa dna n Damaskwos n kwnusnu n amwutuyii. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />N əsagbmanyii, wa ya waazizhni dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu nge Yeisu nu zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə wo əwo ɓəda ca wo ɓa, ɓa nyaɓo, “Əwo nu to nyi n wo ɓə la azhnìgye kala dna n Urishelima ga aza yi ń ɓa kwu gaiciyaga n əye ye nyi m? Njesnu wo to ɓe ya wa kwu ɓa lo ncei n zhni azhaluda nu ga apirisiti atukwoda m?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Dudulonu Soolu wa gnyi woi gna mwamwa n kalái jesnu ca wo Ayahudiyi n ɓa ɓe fyi n Damaskwos nyi, woi wu nge Yeisu nu zhni Kirisiti.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />She anyipyei bəgyé ɓə la duya, Ayahudiyi ɓa pakwúlu ɓahniɓahni ntuge ɓa wu wo, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />ama Soolu wa kwu əɓa ɓəpyi əɓo wo. Nyipyei n sukwoi ɓaa əwyewna dəidəi n əzhiyaakwo aduba nabai ɓa wu wo. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ama əwo avyiyi ɓa la wo n sukwoi ɓa dna wo n cekwnu ɓa gbmi wo ya n wyegye n kwo ɓə ce n gəlu nyi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />She wo ɓə ɓe Urishelima, wa zhniatna nabai wa dnaɓwado n amwutuyii, ama əwo ədna kwa kwu wo ɓa vnyanya, to ɓai ga gaiciya nge wo kwu mwutuyi hnihnii nu zhni m. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ama Banaba wa la wo, wa lo n woi n atnutnuloyi aba. Wa gna ɓa she Soolu ɓə kwu Dagayi gyewye n zokwo, Dagayi wa kwu əɓo da n woi, jesnu she, dna n Damaskwos, wo ɓə kwu waazizhni ntna ədnawoi n Yeisu əye. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ntulonu Soolu waa dna n kwnusnu n ɓai, woi zna laɓa ntna ədna dna n Urishelima, woi daɓo n kalái dnadnai dna n Dagayi əye. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Wa daɓo jesnu ɓai naɓo kpeaje n Agiriki-ayahudiyi, ama ɓa zhniatna nabai ɓa wu wo. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />She ɓəye ɓə kwu lo avyiyi atnubwa, ɓa la wo ɓa shnilo n woi n Kaisariya jesnu ɓa tnu n woi n Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Nlonu ikilisiya dna n Yahuda vnyanya, Gəlili n Samariyai, ɓa kwu lofyi n əsa agbmada nya ɓədo n bwugbafui jesnu ɓa kwu akalá ɓwa. Ɓa gyianyì fyi n Dagayi dnawo jesnu Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa dna ɓa bwugbakala, ikilisiya kwa mwaɓe n bəgyé.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayeninyas n Dokasii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Shi Byitusu ɓə laɓa dna n əzna n əknyi yi, wa lo Dagayi aza gnaɓyi n ɓa ɓə fyi n Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />N əzhi yi wa gye əza ai yi wo ge Ayeninyas, n wo ɓə n nayii fyífyii jesnu n ɓwa yatu n pəce nu, aye ngwnu-nyimwanyimwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Byitusu wa gna wo, “Ayeninyas, Yeisu Kirisiti ka ho gna lo. Laka gnyi jesnu ha kpmi əho pəce.” N əsagbmanyii Ayeninyas wa laka gnyiagnyi <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə fyi n Lida n Sharoi nyi, ɓa gye wo əwye jesnu ɓaa pmyilo da Dagayi.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Dna n Joppa mwutuyi ɓə nyi ai yi wo Tabyita (n Girikii əwo əye nge Dokasi nu); wo ɓə zhni woi zhni aɓo amanai ciici jesnu woi bma awyekwoyi zhni. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Dna n əsa yi nyasna kwa sna wo, waa fyí jesnu aa əwo nayi fu nuwna, aa kwo ya dna n nyakwnudotu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lida ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Joppai; ntulonu shi avyiyi ɓə wo nge Byitusu dnalo n Lida, ɓa tnu n azai ngwnu-aba n wo aba ɓa gna wo, “Sukwu ɓe wo lo!”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Byitusu wa kwnulo n ɓai, jesnu shi wo ɓə si, a lo n woi n nyakwnudotu. Anyigbayi vnyanya ɓa kwu shekna wo zhi, ɓai ciɓwi ɓai wu əwo aje ɓədo n aje ajei n Dokasi ɓə lu woi ye gnyi n kwnusnu n ɓai n wyewyeyii.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Byitusu wa kwnu ɓa ya vnyanya n nyakwnu; nlonu wa ceakwokwo shi wa zhniaduwa. She wo ɓe pmyiawye wu n nyikwo fyífyii nayi əɓwa, wa gna, “Tabyita, laka gnyiagnyi.” Wa kpeawyeya, shi wo ɓə gye Byitusu wa laka sase. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Wa shi wo n əɓwa wa bma wo zhni wa laka gnyiagnyi. Nlonu wa yì avyiyi, n shnisnusnu anyigbayi, waa wo ga ɓa n wyewyeyii. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />A kwu ɓəye wo vnyanya n Joppa, jesnu aza bəgyé ɓa kwu gaiciyaga dna n Dagayi. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Byitusu waa dna n Joppa anyipyei fyewyi n kwnusnu n əpabmyiyi ai yi Sima.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kwonoliyos tnu Byitusu ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Dna n Kaisariya, əza ɓə nyi ai yi Kwonoliyos, bəzhetagyida, n a ɓə zhni ai yi nge Italiya Gwodo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Əwo n əwo pwuwai vnyanya ɓa ɓə zhni Shekwoyi-adnawoi nu n əɓahnii gagai; woi ga awyekwoyi anya n əɓwai loya jesnu woi zhniaduwa ga Shekwoyi n asai n a ncei kpe aduwazhni nya. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />N əwyihoi, əsa ngye snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyeii, wa gye ɓəwyegye. Wa gye maləka Shekwoyi nya pəipəi, n wo ɓə ɓe da wo wa gna, “Kwonoliyos!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kwonoliyos wa shi wo awye byiwuu n ədnai. Wa nyaɓo, “Dagayi, knyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Maləka wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əho aduwazhni n anyagai n ho ga awyekwoyi nyi, ɓa kwu gwnuzhi n zhni nyaga ɓəpá nya n Shekwoyi abye. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nsaiye tnu n azai ɓa lo Joppa ɓa lo ɓəə ɓe n əzai n wo əye nyi ge Sima, n a je wo yi ge Byitusu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Wo dnalo n kwnusnu n Sima yi əpabmyiyi, əza n əwo pwuwa ma shikwonyi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Əsa n maləka n wo ɓə daɓo n woi nyi ɓə la lo, Kwonoliyos wa yì əwo atnutnuyi ngwnu-aba ɓədo n okwnuyi wyenyiyii n wo ɓə zhni woi vyi wo əɓo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Wa gna ɓa ɓəhoɓəhoi n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni jesnu wa tnu ɓa tnutnu lo Joppa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu ɓəwyegye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, nyipyei kwoi tu n atukwo, əsa n ɓa fyilo ncei n əzna ɓai wo vyivyiwyi n əzhiyaakwoi, Byitusu wa gwnulo nyakwnusni tukwo ntuge wo zhniaduwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Myikwnu kwaa wo gwnu, woi ye nyaho wa gyi, jesnu əsa n a ɓə ye gnyi ai zhni nyagyi ɓo, wa gye ɓəgyegye dna n zafnu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Wa gye əshemi n gwuya gnyi, jesnu nyaho ngye shnipa yaakwo ai shnizhi n kwoi n əknyi n kwoi shi n əkwo aɓwakwonu ngwnu-anyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Kwo ɓə n anyafwanya apita-anyi da dəhodəhoi pyai kpe vnyanya, ɓədo n anyai n ɓa kwó n nubwoi kpe n əknyi jesnu n alui. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Nlonu bəgye kwa gna wo, “Byitusu, laka gnyi. Wu jesnu ha gyi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi nlonu nu to m kpeekpe! Mi too shni ənya ajegbmii gyi kwo tnagyii m.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Bəgye kwa daɓo n woi əɓwa baayi, “To yi nyahonyahoi nge ajegbmiyi n Shekwoyi la kwo zhni gyigyiyii m.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Dəye kwa zhni nlonu aɓwa ngwnu-ata, jesnu n əsagbmanyii a je kwo lagwnu lo ncei n əshemi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Aɓwazhilo Byitusui dna n ɓəwowoi ɓətukwo zafnu ɓəwyegye nya, aza n Kwonoliyos ɓə tnu n ɓai nyi, ɓa kpe Sima pwuwa aba jesnu ɓa kwu kpezhi n aduba. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ɓa ɓe ɓai nyaɓo kwo Sima n a je wo yi ge Byitusu nyi, ɓə dna n abaayi.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Shi Byitusu ɓə gnyi woi ye zhni ɓənubwo zafnu ɓəwyegye nya, Zafnu wa gna wo, “Sima, aza ngwnu-ata zhi lo ɓai zna ho shni. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ntulonu laka ha kashi lo əknyi. Ɓwato to wo ho ha kwnulo n ɓai m, ntuge əmi nu naa tnu ɓa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Byitusu wa shnilo wa gna aza yi, “Əmi nu zhni əza n fye znashni nyi. Knyiɓei nu naa ɓe n fyei a?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Aza yi ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi kwnu n Kwonoliyos aba nu, bəzhetagyida. Wo zhni ɓəfyeceyi nu jesnu əza n wo n Shekwoyi dnawoi. Ayahudiyi vnyanya ga wo mwamwa. Maləka gyigyiyi ɓə gna wo nge wo gna ho ha ɓe əwo pwuwa nabai n wo ɓa wo əɓo n ho ncei lo ha da.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Nlonu Byitusu wa yì ɓa fyi n apyimi ɓa kwu zè əwo azhiɓeyi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Byitusu dna n Kwonoliyos pwuwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Əfye kwa gyi zhi Byitusu wa wna əzna n kwnusnu n ɓai, jesnu avyiyi ho n Joppa ɓa kwnulo n ɓai. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi wa si Kaisariya. Kwonoliyos ɓə dna n əɓa awyetui jesnu wo ɓə la əwo əbyéɓala yezhi n abagbmanyi ɓədo n əwo anugwnudoi n ɓa wo vyivyiwyi n woi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Shi Byitusu ɓə lodna n pwuwa, Kwonoliyos wa shegwnu wo jesnu wa yashi n əwo apitaba dna n mwamwaga. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ama Byitusu wa zhni wo wa laka gnyiagnyi. Wa gna, “La laka gnyiagnyi. Mi zhni zanyikwoci cè ngye əho.”<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Woi ye gnyi woi daɓo n woi, Byitusu wa lodna n əmi wa gye deeji yaakwo n yezhi. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Wa gna ɓa: “Fye kpəlo dəidəi nge, kwo dnalo n əyi owa nge, Yahudiyi taa dna əɓwado kwo wa lo Əbyedo gnaɓyi m. Ama Shekwoyi wo kwu wu mi nge mi to yi zahozahoyi nge ajegbmiyi kwo tnagyii m. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ntulonu shi a ɓə tnu əmi ɓo, ma ɓe ntna aɓəna ho. Mi ɓa myi ma wo əɓo n ha tnu əmi ɓo n cenyi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kwonoliyos wa dnaɓəgbe, “Anyipyei ngwnu-ata n ɓa la duya nyi, mi ɓə dna n əmi pwuwa mii zhniaduwa n əsa yei, snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyeii. N əsagbmanyii əza n aje anabmyaii kpe wa gbmignyi n əmi abye <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />nlonu wa gna, ‘Kwonoliyos, Shekwoyi kwu əho aduwa wo, jesnu wo kwu əho anyaga ga ɓə pa, n ho ga awyekwoyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tnu Sima ɓo n Joppa n a je wo yi ge Byitusu nyi. Wo dnalo n azhiɓeyi n Sima əpabmyiyi pwuwa, n wo ma n shikwo əgbe nyi.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Nlonu ma tnu ho əɓo n əsagbmanyii, jesnu kwo bmyalo she ho la ɓe. Nsaiye, əyi vnyanya yi zhinyi n Shekwoyi abye, nyahonyahoi n Shekwoyi wo la tu ho əgbe, ho gna yi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Nlonu Byitusu wa ya ɓəda: “Nsaiye, mi la gaiciya ye kpeye, nge Shekwoyi ta knyi aza knyiknyi m <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ama wo gwo əza n əbyé dəhodəhoi n wo n əwo dnawoi dna n mì jesnu woi zhni əɓo n kwo zhni ɓəfyece. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Fye kpe nabagyi ye lo n Shekwoyi ɓə tnu Israila aza ncei nyi, woi da nabagyi manai bwugbafu nya dna n Yeisu Kirisiti; n əwo nu zhni aza vnyanya Dagayi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Fye kpe əɓo ye lo n kwo kwu zhni n Yahudiya əknyi vnyanya, ənya n kwo ya n Gəlili n Yohana batizimazhniyi waazizhni avnu: <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Shi Shekwoyi ɓə pmya Yeisu Nazeretiyi n Zafnu Gyigyiyii ɓədo n kalái, wa zna laɓa woi zhni aɓo amanai jesnu woi ká aza gna vnyanya n ɓa ɓe fyi n Shetam kalá akwnu, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓe kwnusnu n woi.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Yi zhni aɓəkwnuyi nu ɓəhoɓəhoi nya n wo ɓə zhni dna n Ayahudiyi əknyi jesnu dna n Urishelima. Ɓaa wo wu n gyitu n znudu, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />ama Shekwoyi waa wo laka n əfyi n nyipyei taayii, jesnu wa zhni a kwu wo gyewye. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Aza vnyanya nu to ɓə gye wo əwye m, ama aɓəgbmiyi n Shekwoyi ɓəə la pmaknyi zhi, ɓədo n əyii, n yi ɓe kwu nyagyi kwnugyi n woi jesnu ya kwnu nyasnisnii sni n woi, əsa n wo ɓe laka n əfyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Wa tu yi əgbe nge yi da nabagyi ye ga aza, jesnu ya daɓo ge əwo nu n Shekwoyi wo la knyi wa da aza awyewyeyida owa n afyífyii. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Sheaɓəgwognayi vnyanya gbmi wo əɓo nge zahozahoyi n waa gaiciyaga dna n wo, wo ɓa gwo aleifyi zozo dna n əwo əye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Byitusu woi ye gnyi woi da aɓədagbma ye, Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa shnikpe n aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə kwu ɓəda wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Avyiyi n ɓa ɓə anyai znuznui, n ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe n Byitusui, ca wo ɓa shi nyaga Zafnu Gyigyiyi nya kwo kwu ɓe kpe n Abyedo ce. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ntuge ɓa ɓə wo ɓa zhi ɓai daɓo n anyitala ədoi jesnu ɓai ci Shekwoyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Nlonu Byitusu wa gna, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Ɓəhnihni zaho to lo wa kpma ɓa batizima zhni n nuwnai m. Ɓa la Zafnu Gyigyiyi gwo n ɓwasnu shi yi ɓə gwo nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ntulonu wa ga əgbe nge a zhni ɓa batizima dna n Yeisu Kirisiti əye. Nlonu ɓa gna Byitusu nge wo la kwnudna n ɓai anyipyei fyewyi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Byitusu ga awyeknaya əwo aɓəzhni nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Atnutnuloyi n agaiciyagayii fyi n Yahudiya əknyi vnyanya, ɓa kwu wo nge Abyedo cè, ɓa la Shekwoyi ɓədagbma gwo. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ntulonu she Byitusu ɓə lo Urishelima, anyaznuyi agaiciyagayi ɓa daɓo kpe wo <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />ɓa gna, “Ho ɓə lo haa lodna n atnanyaznuyi pwuwa jesnu ha kwu nyagyi kwnu gyi n ɓai.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Byitusu wa ya anabagyi wu she kwo ɓə ya n kpmisnui, wa wu ɓa alafyiya vnyanya: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Mi ɓə dna n Joppa əzhiyaakwo nu mii zhniaduwa, dna n əgye-znugyei, ma gye ɓəwyegye. Ma gye ənya ngye shnipa yaakwo ai ta kwo ya shnizhi ncei n əshemi n əkwo aɓwakwonu ngwnu-anyi, jesnu kwa shnishi n aba n mi ɓə shi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ma shi kwo awye ma gye anyafwanya apita-anyi da n ɓa fyi əknyi, anyawnanyawna, anya n ɓa kwó n nubwoi jesnu n alui. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Nlonu ma wo bəgye kwoi gna mi, ‘Byitusu, laka gnyi, wu jesnu ha gyi.’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />“Ma dnaɓəgbe, ‘Dagayi, aawo, ɓəhnihni! Ənya ajegbmii ho kwo tnagyii to shni lodna n əmi əgbe m.’<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />“Bəgye kwo gbmi ɓe n əshemi kwa daɓo əɓwa baayi, ‘To yi nyahonyahoi nge ajegbmiyi n Shekwoyi la kwo zhni gyigyiyii m.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Dəye kwa zhni nlonu aɓwa ngwnu-ata, nlonu a je kwo lagwnu lo ncei n əshemi.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />“N ɓwasnu n əsayii nu, aza ngwnu-ata n a ɓə tnu n ɓai n əmi aba, ɓai kwnu n Kaisariya nyi, ɓa kpezhi n pwuwa aba n mi ɓə dna nyi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Zafnu wa gna mi nge mi to wo ɓwato n mi ɓa kwnulo n ɓai m. Əmi azaje ngwnu-tnanyi ye ce, ɓa kwnulo n mii, jesnu ya lofyi n əza yi pwuwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Wa gna yi shi maləka ɓə kpeya da wo dna n əwo pwuwa jesnu wa gna, ‘Tnu Sima ɓo n Joppa n a je wo yi ge Byitusu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Wo ɓə ɓe fye n nabagyii, n əho n əho pwuwai vnyanya, ɓə ɓwa gnyignyi n əkwo nu.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />“Shi mi ɓə ya ɓəda da, Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa shnikpe n ɓa ngye shi wo ɓə shnikpe n yi n pyentikwos ayayaba nyi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Nlonu ma pa əɓo n Dagayi ɓəə kwu da: ‘Yohana ɓə zhni batizima n nuwnai nu, ama a ɓə zhni fye batizima n Zafnu Gyigyiyii nu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ntulonu ngye Shekwoyi ɓə ga ɓa nyaga gbmanyigbmanyi nu, n wo ɓə ga yi, n yi ɓə kwu gaiciyaga dna n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nyi, mi ɓə zhni nyika nu, ma zhninubwo nge mi ɓa znu Shekwoyi zokwo a?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />She ɓa ɓə wo dəye, to ɓa shna gwodu n aɓənai m, ɓa ci Shekwoyi, ɓai gna, “Kwo wu nu nge, kwo Abyedo ce, Shekwoyi wo la abwuye ga ɓa n kwo ɓe n wyewyeyi nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikilisiya dna n Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Nsayi aza yi n ɓa ɓəə la gnamyi ntu awyesnugbegye ɓo, n kwo ɓəə la laka gnyi əsa n a ɓə wu Istifanus nyi, ɓa znazna ɓa kwu si Fonishiya, Saipwurus n Antiyoki, ɓai ɓwa ɓədagbma gnamyi fyi n Ayahudiyi atasni nu. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ama azaho n ɓa, aza n ɓa ɓə kwnu n Saipwurus n Sirenii, ɓa lo Antiyok ɓa ya ɓəda da n Agirikiyii ce, ɓai gna ɓa nabagyi manai ntu Dagayi Yeisu ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Dagayi əɓwa ɓə kwnusnu n ɓai, aza bəgyé ɓa kwu gaiciyaga jesnu ɓa pmyilo da Dagayi.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Nabagyi dəye, kwa si da ikilisiya dna n Urishelima, ɓa tnu Banaba tnutnu lo Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />She wo ɓə si, wa gye əɓo n shebmyashi Shekwoyi nya kwo kwu zhni nyi, wa wo agbmada, jesnu wa myi ɓa bwugbazhi vnyanya nge ɓa kwu kpefyi n Dagayi cewo n əɓa adui vnyanya. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Wo ɓə zhni əza manai nu, n nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii ɓədo n gaiciyagai, jesnu aza bəgyé ɓa kwu gaiciyaganunui fyi n Dagayi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Nlonu Banaba wa lo Tarsus wo zna Soolu shni, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />she wo ɓə gye wo əwye, wa ɓe n woi n Antiyok. Ntulonu dna n əye ɓwugyi Banaba n Soolui ɓa yezhi n kwnusnu n ikilisiyai ɓai wunya ga aza bəgyé. Dna n Antiyok nu n a ɓə yi amwutuyi n kpmisnu ge Kirisitiavyiyi.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Dna n əsa ye sheaɓəgwognayi ho ɓa kwnu shnizhi n Urishelima ɓai lo Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Zaknayi n ɓa, ai yi wo ge Agabwus, wa laka gnyi, dna n Zafnu, wa da ɓəwyegye myikwnu nazhii nya, n kwo ɓə gwnu dna n Roman əknyi vnyanya. (Dəye ɓə kwa nu dna n Kladiyus əbegyi əsa.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Amwutuyi, ngye shi zahozahoyi ɓə ɓa myi, wa dnabwugba wa ga bmazhni ntu avyiyi ɓo azanugbai n anyikwozai; n ɓa ɓə fyi n Yahudiya nyi. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ɓa ɓə zhni ɓəye ɓa tnu abyeda n əɓa anyagai dna n Banaba n Soolui akwnu nu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Byitusu fyafyaya ɓəwowo nya n zhalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Dna n əsa ye nu n əsu Hiridusu ɓə wna azaho n ɓa ɓə fyi n ikilisiya, wo ɓə ye wa she ɓa əwyena nu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wa zhni a wu Jemyis, Yohana zado n əbeyaakwoi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />She wo ɓə gye nge ɓəye ɓo, kwo kwu da Ayahudiyi, wa gwodu wa wna Byitusu ce. A ɓə zhni dəye dna n Awyefna Biledi Tnayisti nya nu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />She a ɓə la wo wna, waa wo gwudna n zhalu, waa wo ga ntuge akwnuyi ngwnu-anyi n okwu ɓa gwu wo n əsagbmanyii. Hiridusu ɓə ye woi gbmi wo ɓe ncei n Awyefna Gnanaznu nya avnu nu, ai da wo owa gnyi n bəgye.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ntulonu ɓaa Byitusu gwudna n zhalu, ama ikilisiya ɓə fyi ɓai zhniaduwa n əwyei bmyibmyii ga Shekwoyi ntu n əwo ɓo.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Dna n sukwo yi, n əkwo əfyegyizhi nu, n Hiridusu ɓəə ɓa gbmi wo ɓe ncei, wa da owa n woi nyi, Byitusu ɓə shi woi wnagye dna n zhalu n akwnuyi ngwnu-aba atasni, n woi papai n agbmai ngwnu-aba, jesnu abagwuyi ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi n alodnaba. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />N əsagbmanyii maləka Dagayi nya wa kpeyaɓe jesnu bwuznagna kwa fnu fyi n zhalu. Wa znu Byitusu əɓwa n abmayi, wa kwnu wo agyewyiya. Wa gna wo, “Laka gnyi, n pye!” Jesnu agbma ɓa kwnuya n Byitusu aɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Nlonu maləka wa gna wo, “Kwu əho aje kpe jesnu kwu abwada fyi.” Byitusu wa zhni əɓo n a ɓə gna wo nyi. Maləka wa gna wo, “Kwu əho əjeyaakwo shegye, ha vyi mi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Byitusu wa vyi wo wa gbmiya n zhalu, ama to woi kpe, nge əɓo n maləka zhni nyi, kwo zhni ɓəhnihnii nu m; wo ɓə zhninubwo ngye wo ɓe gnyi woi gye ɓəwyegye nu dna n zafnu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ɓa du abagwuyi kpmisnui ya n baayii, ɓa ɓe kpakwo snukna nya aba, n kwo nu gbmiya lo əzhiyaakwo nyi. Kwa gwu əkwohni ya ga ɓa, ɓa duya n kwo. She ɓa ɓəə kwu znazna dnadna gbmanyi nya, maləka wa fa wo n əsagbmanyii.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Nlonu Byitusu wa jezeɓe əwohni ací wa gna, “Nsaiye mi kwu kpe nge ɓəhnihni Dagayi nu naa tnu n əwo maləkai wonyi gnyi mi n Hiridusu akwnu, jesnu n nyahonyahoi, n Ayahudiyi ɓə n awyetui ge kwo ɓa zhni nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />She ɓəye ɓə la shnifyi wo, wa lo Mariyamwu pwuwa, Yohana əya, n a je wo yi ge Marukwus nyi, aba n bəgyé ɓəə la yefyi ɓai zhniaduwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Byitusu wa je alofyiba əbmyi nya, tnutnuyi ho ai yi wo Luda wa ɓe nge wa dnaɓəgbe. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />She wo ɓə kwu Byitusu bəgye kpeye, waa nu gnyi n agbmadai n mwa, wa jezelo ntna abagwuyai woi ɓəwyi, “Gye Byitusu nu gnyi n abwokwnumi!”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ɓa gna wo, “Ho la gbmiya n əhohni ací.” She wo ɓə la gyima nge kwo ɓe nyi nlonu, ɓa gna, “A ɓa gye əwo maləka nu.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ama Byitusu wa gwodu woi jeaba, jesnu shi ɓa ɓə gwu kpakwo ya ɓa gye wo, ca wo ɓa, ɓa kwu cezhi gbegyégyé. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Byitusu wa zhni ɓa n aɓwai ge ɓa kwu cepyi jesnu wa gna ɓa shi Dagayi wa gbmi wo ya n zhalu. Wa gna, “Fye kwu ɓəye gna Jemyis n əyi azajei ɓədo n amapwii,” nlonu wa fa ɓa wa lo ɓwado.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />N labmii, wyina kwaa gbmidna n akwnuyi atasni fyi n ɓəyeɓwi ntu əɓo n kwo la ɓwa Byitusu. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Shi Hiridusu ɓə kwu aza fyi ɓa zna wo shni, she ɓa ɓá myi, ama to wa gye wo əwye m, wa je abagwuyi aɓo nya nyanya, jesnu wa ga əgbe nge a la ɓa kpmiatukwo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 12:19">Hiridusu əfyi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Nlonu Hiridusu wa gbmi n Yahudiya wa lo Kaisariya, waa dna n ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Wo ɓə gnyi woi wuanya nu ń Atayayii n Asidoniyii; nsayi ɓa kwu əgbe lodo ɓa zna wo shni ɓa daɓo n woi. Shi ɓa ɓə la Byilatusu bmazhni ɓwa, əsu tnutnuyi n wo n gaiciyai ga wo, ɓa nya bwugbafu ɓo n əsu, ntuge ɓa ɓə ń tukwoi kpema n əsui əknyi nu ɓai ɓwa nyagyi.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />N əwyii n Hiridusu ɓə ncei shi nyi, she wo ɓə kwu əwo əsu aje kpe, wa sasetu n əwo əbeshnikpegye jesnu wa da ɓəda n aza bəgyéi abye. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Ɓa ɓəwyi, “Bəgye ye kwo zhni shekwoyi nya nu, toge zanyikwoci nya m.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />N əsagbmanyii, ntuge Hiridusu to ɓə ci Shekwoyii m, maləka Dagayi nya wa znu wo ənya ya shi, jesnu avnyi ɓa gyi wo, waa fyi.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ama Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kwa gwodu kwoi lapwi jesnu kwoi mwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amigna Banaba nya n Soolui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />She Banaba n Soolui ɓə kwu pwo əɓa tnutnu, ɓa kwnu n Urishelima ɓa la Yohana n kwnusnu n ɓai, n a ɓə je wo yi ge Marukwus nyi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Nsayii dna Antiyok ikilisiya, sheaɓəgwognayi ɓə fyi n ɓo, ɓədo n anyawuyii: Banaba, Simyiyon n a ɓə yi wo nge Niger nyi, Lushos n wo gbmi n Sireni, Manayem (əza n wo ɓə mwa n kwnusnu n Hiridusu əbegyiyi nyi) ɓədo n Soolui. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai ga Dagayi mwamwa n əgbewnai, Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa gna ɓa, “Fye la Banaba n Soolui knyi zhi mi ntu tnutnu ɓo n mi la ɓa yi fyi n əkwo nyi.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ntulonu she ɓa ɓə kwu pwo əgbewna ɓo n aduwazhnii, ɓa kpe ɓa aɓwa jesnu ɓa gna ɓa ami.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpe n Saipwurus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Əɓa ngwnu-aba, she Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə kwnu ɓa fyi n zokwo, ɓa shnilo Selushiya, ɓa kwuka n ɓo ɓa lofyi n əya nuwnanya ɓa lo Saipwurus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />She ɓa ɓə si Salamyis, ɓa da Shekwoyi ɓədagbma fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu. Yohana əɓa bmazhniyi, ɓə kwnusnu n ɓai.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ɓa znazna laɓa fyi n mwuse yi vnyanya, nya əsa n ɓa ɓə si Pafos ncei. Dna n abaayi ɓa gye Yahudiyi zokwusheyi n wo ɓə zhni sheɓəgwognayi katái nu nyi ai yi wo nge Ba-Yeisu, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />əwo nu ɓə zhni Gwomna Sagyiyos Palus aɓoaknawnayi. Gwomna əza ceceyi, wa tnu Banaba ɓo n Soolui ntuge wo ɓə ncei pma wa wo Shekwoyi ɓədagbma. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ama Elimas zokwusheyi (ntuge əwo əye ɓətukwo nu ɓə nu) wa gnyiapaapa n ɓai, wa zhni shi wo ɓa myi wa pmyi gwomna awye ya n gaiciyaganunui. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Nlonu Soolu, n a ɓə zhni ai je wo yi ge Bwulus nyi, n nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, wa ce Elimas əwye cewo wa gna, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Əho Shetam əɓyi jesnu nuwnuyi əɓo manai dəhodəhoi nya! Ho nunui lo n kwocedna dəhodəhoi pyai vnyanya ɓədo n gyifyii. Ho taa fa Dagayi ɓəfyece azokwo agbmazhni ɓo m? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nsaiye Dagayi əɓwa kwo gbmitu ho lo. Ho ɓaa zhni wyebwayi əsa fyewyi, kwo nyipyei bwuznagna, ho taa je myi n əkwo wyegye m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">N əsagbmanyii ɓwugye n wyegbmai ɓa yakpe n wo, wa laɓa n awyebwai, woi zna əza shni n wo ɓa shi wo əɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />She gwomna ɓə gye əɓo n kwo kwu zhni nyi, waa gaiciyaga, ntuge nyawu ntu Dagayi ɓo ɓə kwu wo əwo.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyi n Antiyok Pyisidiya nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ɓa kwnu n Pafos, Bwulus n əwo atnutnu kwnuzhniyii ɓa lofyi n əya nuwnanya ɓa lo Pyega dna n Pamfyiliya əknyi, aba n Yohana ɓə fa ɓa, wa jezelo Urishelima nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ɓa kwnu n Pyega ɓa lo Antiyok Pyisidiya nya. N Sibyiwyii ɓa lofyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu ɓa kwu sase. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Shi ɓa ɓə la ənya ba dna n Owa n Sheaɓəgwognayii, atukwoda n Ayahudiyibwokwnu ɓa tnu tnutnu ga ɓa ɓai gna, “Əyi azaje, ngye fye n ɓədagbma bwugbakaladna nyai lo ga aza, sukwu fye ɓe ncei.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />She Bwulus ɓə laka gnyi wa wu əwo əɓwa nge wo ɓa daɓo jesnu wa gna: Əmi Aisrailayi aje, n əfyei Abyedo n fye ga Shekwoyi mwamwa nyi, fye kna mi tnubwa! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Shekwoyi Aisrailayi nya ɓə knyí əyi azakwoyi; wa zhni ɓa ɓa kwu nyaɓwa ɓwa əsa n ɓa ɓə fyi n Masar; n kalá duduyii wa kwnu ɓa ya n əknyii; <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Wa ɓwa əmì n əɓa aɓəzhnii fyi n zhabwikawu aye shiinyi; <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />jesnu waa kwu abye gyi ngwnu-tnaaba n okwnui n Kaana, waa əɓa əknyi la wa ga əwo aza kwaa zhni əɓa əgwú. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />A ɓə zhni aɓo ye vnyanya fyi n aye 450 nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“N dəye avnu, Shekwoyi wa ga ɓa awadayi kwa nya sheɓəgwognayi Samwula əsa. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Nlonu Aisrailayi ɓa nyaɓo nge a dna ɓa əsu, jesnu wa ga ɓa Soolu, Kish nugwnu, n Banyami əbyé n wo ɓə gyi əbe aye shiinyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />She a ɓə la Soolu gbmiya n əbe, waa əbe dna Dawuda. Shekwoyi ɓə la əɓo gbmi ntu əwo ɓo: ‘Mi la Dawuda ɓwa Jesse nugwnu, əza n wo zna əmi ədu shni; wo ɓa zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n mi ncei pma wa zhni.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“N əza ye ofye nu n Shekwoyi wo la ɓe Israila ǹ Gnyiyii, Yeisu, ngye shi wo ɓə shi əgbe nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yeisu ɓə snu n wo ɓə nyi, Yohana woi kwu waazi abwuye nya zhni ɓədo n batizimai ga aza vnyanya n Israila. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Shi Yohana ɓə gnyi woi pwo əwo tnutnuzhni ɓo, wa gna: ‘Fye zhninubwo nge mi zhni nyika nu a? Əmi nu to zhni əza n fye tuwye nyi m. Ama əza lo n wo ɓe lo n əmi avnu; əwo abwada abma, mi to kwnuce lo ma loya m.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Əmi azaje Ibrahim aɓyi ɓədo n fyei Abyedo Shekwoyi-adnawoi, a ɓə tnu tnutnu gnyignyi nya ye ga əyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Urishelima aza n əɓa əbegyi yii to ɓə kpe Yeisu əye m, dudulonu dna əwo knyiznu, ɓa kwu sheaɓəgwognayi aɓədagbma nu n a ba kwo n Sibyiwyi dəhodəhoi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kwo shikwonyi ɓa to ɓə ɓwa aɓoɓwashi ba cewoi ntu əfyi owa znutu ɓo m, ɓa gna Byilatusu nge wo la wo znudu. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />She ɓa ɓə kwu əɓo zhni n a ɓə ncei kakpe ntu əwo ɓo, ɓa shni wo n znudu ɓaa wo byidna n vnyigwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ama Shekwoyi wa la wo kala n əfyi, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />aza yi n ɓa ɓə kwnu znazna n woi, ɓai kwnu n Gəlili ɓa lo Urishelima nyi, ɓa ɓə kwu wo gyewye anyipyei n mwa bəgyé. Əɓa nu zhni aɓəkwnuyi nsaiye n əyi aza aba.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />“Yi gna fye anabagyi manai: ɓəgbeshi n Shekwoyi ɓə shi əyi azakwoyi nyi, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />wo kwu kwo nu ga yi n yi zhni əɓa aɓyi; she wo ɓə lá Yeisu kala n əfyi. Ngye she kwo kakpe lo n Zabwura baayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘Ho zhni əmi nugwnu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">n naiye mi la zè əho dada.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Shekwoyi ɓə la wo laka n əfyi nabai n wo taa shna bwo m kpekpe. Ngye she Shekwoyi ncei da lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“ ‘Mi ɓə ga fye anabəlika gyigyiyi jesnu anabəlika tashnakpma nya n mi ɓə shi Dawuda ɓəgbeshi nyi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ntulonu a cei je ka dnalo n ɓwado:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“ ‘Ho taa fa əza gyigyiyi wa bwo m.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Nsayii she Dawuda ɓə kwu Shekwoyi atnutnu ɓəmwi nu, n əwo cala, waa wnagye; a ɓə la wo byi n kwnusnu n əwo azakwoi jesnu əwo nayi ɓə la bwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ama əza n Shekwoyi ɓə laka n əfyi nyi, to ɓə bwo m.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Ntucenu əmi anugwnudo, mi ncei pma fya kwu kpe nge, dna ń Yeisu nu, n a da aleifyi zo ɓo ga fye. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Dna n əwo nu, zahozahoyi n wo ga gaiciya, n a gnyi wo ya, n leifyi dəhodəhoi; ɓogyikpmaya n fye to ɓə myi fya ɓwa ɓa dna n Mwusa owa m. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Fye zhni pəceye nabai aɓo n sheaɓəgwognayi ɓə kwu da nyi, to ɓa nu kpe n fye m:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“ ‘Əfye aɓwugyiɓədayi, fye shiawye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ce wo fye, jesnu fya kwu zhniagbma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ntuge mi ye ma zhni əɓəho nu n əfye anyipyei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">n fye to ɓə ɓa ga kwo gaiciya m kpeekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kwo n əza ɓə gna, wo ɓa gna fye ce gnagna nu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Shi Bwulus n Banabai ɓə zhi ɓai kwnu n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, aza ɓa pa ɓa nyawu n Sibyiwyii n kwo ɓé lo n abye nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />She a ɓə kwu bwokwnu gnami, Ayahudiyi n azai n ɓa ɓəə kwu əɓahni ga ɓai vyi Ayahudiyi kwnunu nyi, ɓa vyi Bwulus n Banabai, ɓa daɓo n ɓai jesnu ɓa gyi ɓa əwye nge ɓa gwodu fyi n shebmyashi Shekwoyi nya.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />N Sibyiwyii n kwo ɓə yatu nyi, aza ɓə ɓwace fyewyi nu n əzhi vnyanya n ɓa to ɓə yezhi nabai ɓa wo Dagayi ɓədagbma m. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />She Ayahudiyi ɓə gye deeji, ɓa kwu nu zhi n shewoi. Ɓa ya ɓai gnyiapaapa n əɓoi n Bwulus ɓə gnyi woi da nyi jesnu ɓa fyi wo akpmi n mwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Nlonu Bwulus n Banabai ɓa dna ɓa ɓəgbe n əgbei myimyii: “Kwo ɓə la zhni ɓəshishi nu ya da fye Shekwoyi ɓədagbma n kpmisnu. Shikwonyi fye la əkwo aɓəna, jesnu fye too ń bwugbadnai lo n əfyehni nge, fye kwnuce lo fya ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya m, nsaiye, yi ye ya pmyiawye wu Abyedo nu. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ntuge ɓəgbetu nyi n Shekwoyi wo la ga yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘Mi kwu fye zhni bwuznagna ntu Abyedo ɓo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">nabai n fye ɓa lo n gnyignyii n anyiceshiba.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />She Abyedo ɓə wo əɓo ye, ɓa dagbma jesnu ɓa ga Dagayi ɓədagbma mwamwa; jesnu aza vnyanya n a ɓə n ɓai tnu ntu wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya ɓo, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Dagayi ɓədagbma kwaa lapwi fyi n əknyisəpayi vnyanya. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ama Ayahudiyi atukwoda ɓa fyi anyikwoza Shekwoyi-adnawoi n azanugbayii aɓoya n ɓa ɓə kwnuzhi ai kpe ɓa əye n əzhiyaakwo. Ɓa la awyesnugbegye ɓo kala tu Bwulus n Banabai, jesnu ɓaa ɓa kwnuya n əɓa əknyisəpa. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ntulonu ɓa lu əɓa apita aɓwutukwnu ya kwaa zè ɓəkwnukwnù n əɓa aba jesnu ɓa lo Ikwoninya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Nlonu amwutuyi ɓa kwu nu zhi n agbmadai ɓədo n Zafnu Gyigyiyii.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Fyi n Ikwoninya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Fyi n Ikwoninya, Bwulus n Banabai ɓa lo Ayahudiyibwokwnu she ɓa ɓə dami. Fyi n abaayi, ɓa daɓo n Ayahudiyii n Agirikiyii kwa kwu lofyi ɓa dəidəi, bəgyé n ɓa, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ama Ayahudiyii n ɓa to ɓə ga gaiciya nyi m, ɓa kwu Abyedo abwugba kala zhi jesnu ɓa kwu ɓa fyi əmwi kpe n əyi azaje. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ntulonu Bwulus n Banabai, ɓa kwu mwasa fyi n abaayi, ɓai daɓo n əgbei myimyii ntu Dagayi ɓo, n wo ɓə gbmi əwo shebmyashi ɓəda əɓo jesnu wa ga ɓa ikwo ɓa wu aznù ɓai zhni aɓoawowoi. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Aza n əzhiyaakwo yi ɓaa gnaje; azaho ɓa kwu ma n Ayahudiyi ɓwa, azaje n kasnu n atnutnuloyi ɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Abyedo n Ayahudiyii ɓədo n əɓa atukwodai, ɓa ɓə n kwului pashi, ɓa zè ɓa awyegbmiaje jesnu ɓa knyi ɓa akwuta. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ama ɓa kwu əkwo əɓo kpe, ɓa bwusi lo Likwoninya azhiyaakwo Listira nya n Dabyei ɓədo n azhigbai n ɓa shegwnu ɓa nyi, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />aba n ɓa ɓə gwodu ɓa zhni waazi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyi n Listira n Dabyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Əza ɓə dna n Listira n wo ɓə bmazhi. A ɓə ma wo n pmasnu nlonu jesnu wo to ɓə shni znazna m kpeekpe. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Wa kna Bwulus ɓəda tnubwa əsa n wo ɓə gnyi woi daɓo. Bwulus wa ce wo awye cewo, wa gye nge wo ɓəə n gaiciyaganunui, n wo ɓa gwo kágna <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Wa yì wo n bəgye kalái, “Laka gnyiagnyi!” Əza yi wa laka gnyiagnyi wa ya znazna.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />She deeji ɓə gye əɓo n Bwulus kwu zhni nyi, ɓa ɓəwyi n Likwoninya əbyei, “Əyi ashekwoyi, ɓa la kazhi ɓe da yi, dna n zanyikwoci dogbe!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Ɓa yi Banaba ge Zeyus njesnu Bwulus ɓa yi wo ge Hamis ntuge əwo nu ɓə zhni ɓəda da yi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Zeyus pirisiti ń əwo ashnanyakwnu ɓə ɓwagnyi n əzhiyaakwo gəlu avnu nu nyi, wa lo ɓe əzhiyaakwo aduba n anakwonugbai shi ɓədo n amamawyií, ntuge əwo, n əwo deejii, ɓə ncei pma ɓa kwnu anyaga ga ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ama she Banaba n Bwulusii atnutnuloyi ɓə wo əɓo ye, ɓa sa əɓa aje ya jesnu ɓa bwusi lo da deeji ɓai ɓəwyi: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Anugwnudo, knyiyi nu zhni fyei zhni əɓo ye a? Əyihni ce yi ɓwa azanyikwoci nu zhni ngye əfye. Yi ɓe fye n anabagyi manai nu, yii gna fye ge fye la awye pmyiya n anya atnatukwogyii, fya vyi Shekwoyi wyewyeyida, n əwo nu ɓə zhni ashemi n əknyii n shikwoi n anyahonyahoii n ɓa fyilo n ɓa nyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />N sapa, wo ɓə lá əbyé dəhodəhoi fa nge kwo wna əkwohni zokwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Dudulonu wo too fa əwohni gnyi ntna ɓəgbmi m: Wo kwu aɓo amanai zhni ga yi, she wo ga fye əgbma n kwo kwnu n əshemi nyi, jesnu n anyagyii n əɓa asai; Woi ga fye nyagyi n mwa jesnu woi nu əfye adu n agbmadai.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kwo dudu n aɓədagbma yei, kwaa ɓa dnaɓo ɓa kpma deeji anyakwnukwnu ga ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Nlonu Ayahudiyi ho n ɓa ɓə kwnu n Antiyok n Ikwoninyai, ɓa kwu deeji ɓwa ma n əɓa səpa. Ɓa knyi Bwulus akwuta jesnu ɓa gnyì wo ya shi n əzhiyaakwo əbmyi, ɓai zhninubwo nge, wo la fyí nu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama she amwutuyi ɓə la yezhi n shegwnu wo, wa laka gnyiagnyi wa lodna n əzhiyaakwo. Əfye kwa gyi, əwo n Banabai ɓa kwnu ɓa lo Dabye.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jejeze lo Antiyok Siriya nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ɓa zhni waazi n əzhiyaakwoi jesnu ɓa kwu amwutuyi ɓwa n mwa bəgyé. Nlonu ɓa jezelo Listira, Ikwoninya n Antiyoki, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />ɓai myi amwutuyi agwuzhi jesnu ɓai fyi ɓa abwugbakala nge ɓa kwu kpefyi n gaiciyaganunui. Ɓa gna, “Ɓəshishi nu ya gyeazhnì aɓo bəgyé nya, nabai yii lofyi n Shekwoyi əbemi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bwulus n Banabai ɓa tnu atukwoda ga ɓa fyi n ikilisiya dəhodəhoi jesnu dna n aduwazhni n əgbewnai, ɓa kwu ɓa fyi n Dagayi akwnu, əza n əɓa gaiciyaga ɓə kpema əwo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />She ɓa ɓə duya n Pyisidiya, ɓa lo ɓe Pamfyiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />jesnu she ɓa ɓə kwu Ɓədagbma waazizhni n Pyega, ɓa shnilo Attaliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ɓa kwnu n Attaliya ɓa lo əya nuwnanya ɓa jezelo Antiyok, aba n a ɓə zhni ɓa aduwa Shekwoyi shebmyashi nya, ntu tnutnu ɓo n ɓa ɓəə kwu pwo kwo zhni ɓo nsayii nyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />She ɓa ɓe si abaayi, ɓa ye ikilisiya zhi n abagbmanyi, ɓa wu ɓa anabagyi aɓo nya vnyanya n Shekwoyi ɓəə kwu zhni fyi n əɓa akwnu jesnu she wo ɓə gwú kpakwo gaiciyaganunui nya ya ga Abyedo. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Jesnu ɓa kwu mwasa fyi n abaayi n kwnusnu n amwutuyii.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ikilisiya bwokwnuyaakwo n Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Azaho ɓə kwnu shnizhi n Yahudiya ɓa lo Antiyok ɓai wunya ga avyiyi: “Akpəge a la fye znunya ngye shi Mwusa kwnunu ncei wu nyi, fye taa ɓwa gnyignyi m.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Əɓo ye kwa zhni Bwulus n Banabai ɓa naɓokpeaje n ɓai n zhina zhizhii. Ntulonu a tnu Bwulus n Banabai n kwnusnu n avyiyi ajei, ɓa gwnulo Urishelima ɓa lo ɓə gye atnutnuloyi n atukwodai ntu ɓənya ye ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ikilisiya kwa kwnu ɓa fyi n zokwo, jesnu she ɓa ɓə znazna ɓa duya n Fonishiya n Samariyai, ɓa da nabagyi she Abyedo ɓə la abwiye-gwo. Anabagyi ye ɓa zhni avyiyi vnyanya ɓa dagbma. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />She ɓa ɓə si Urishelima, ikilisiya n atnutnuloyi ɓədo n abyedai, ɓa zhni ɓa amaabe, ɓa wu ɓa alaafyiya ɓəhoɓəhoi nya n Shekwoyi ɓəə kwu zhni fyi n əɓa akwnu.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Nlonu avyiyi ho n ɓa ɓə fyi n Afarisiyi okwu ɓa kwukazhi ɓa gna, “Ɓəshishi nu Abyedo aa ɓa znunya jesnu ɓa shi Mwusa owa ɓwa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Atnutnuloyi n abyedai ɓa gwnudo ɓa shi əɓo ye awye. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Shi ɓa ɓə kwu aɓo da n mwa, Byitusu wa laka gnyi wa daɓo n ɓai: “Əyi azaje, fye kpəlo ge əsa n kwo la duya nyi, Shekwoyi ɓə la əɓo dna knyí n əyi atasni ge, Abyedo ɓa wo ɓəda anabagyi manai nya n əmi əgbe nu ɓa ga gaiciya. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Shekwoyi n wo kpe adu əye nyi, wa kwu wu nge wo la ɓa gwo əsa n wo ɓə ga ɓa Zafnu Gyigyiyi, n ɓwasnu she wo ɓə ga yi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Wo to ɓə wu kakai n əyi aba n əɓai m, ntuge wo ɓə la əɓa adu pmya fyi n gaiciyaganunui. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nlonu nsaiye, knyiyi nu zhni fyei ye fya tu Shekwoyi mwi fyei fyi Abyedo korogbma n bəgye, ədo n əyi kwo əyi azakwoyi to ɓə myi ɓa shni shi nyi ma a? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Aawo! Yi n gaiciyai ga lo nge dna n shebmyashi əyi Dagayi Yeisu nya nu n yi ɓə ɓwa gnyignyi, n ɓwasnu shi ɓa kwu ɓwa nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Azayezhi yi vnyanya ɓa kwu cepyi shi ɓa ɓə kna Banaba n Bwulusii tnubwa ɓai gna ɓa aznù ɓo n aɓoawowoii n Shekwoyi ɓəə kwu zhni fyi n Abyedo atasni woi zhni apma n ɓai. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />She ɓa ɓə pwo, Jemyis wa daɓo. Wa gna, “Əmi azaje, fye kna mi tnubwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Sima wo kwu wu yi, she Shekwoyi ɓə kpmi əɓo abazhni wa knyi aza ga əwo əye ń Abyedo aba. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Sheaɓəgwognayi aɓədagbma ɓa kwu lodo n dəyei, ngye she kwo kafyilo:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘N dəye avnu mi ɓə jezeɓe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">jesnu mii je Dawuda alubwi amyimyiiya mi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Əkwo agwusa mi ɓə je kwo mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">jesnu mi ɓə je kwo laka gnyi she kwo ɓə shnisnu<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />nabai azanyikwoci n ɓa ce nyi, n ɓa ɓə zna Shekwoyi shni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">kwo Abyedo vnyanya n ɓa n əmi əyei tu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Dagayi nu da əɓo ye, n əwo nu zhni aɓo ye nyi’<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />anya n a ɓə kwu ɓa kpe əye n sapa.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Ntucenu əmi ɓəznu nu nyi, nge yi to lá zokwo ye zhni ɓədnai n Abyedo aba, n ɓa gnyi ɓai pmyiawye ɓe da Shekwoyi nyi m. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />N əkwoɓwi, yi ka əpa ga ɓa, ya gna ɓa ge ɓa kwu fa ashna nyagyi gyi ɓo, n asisiɓozhnii, n abwui anyakpa nya n a pmyi ɓa bəgye nyi, jesnu n amisnii. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ntuge a kwu Mwusa owa waazizhni n əzhiyaakwo dəhodəhoi tunyi n sapa jesnu a ba kwo lo fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu n Sibyiwyi dəhodəhoi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwokwnuyaakwo paka lo Abyedo agaiciyagai aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Nlonu Atnutnuloyi n abyedai n ikilisiyai vnyanya, ɓa dnabwugba ɓa tnu əɓa aza, ɓa tnu ɓa tnutnu lo Antiyok n kwnusnu n Bwulusii n Banabai. Ɓa knyi Yahuda (n a ɓə yi wo nge Barsabas nyi) n Silai, aza n ɓa ɓə zhni atukwoda nu fyi n avyiyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ɓa tnu n əpa kakai yei n əɓa akwnu:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Atnutnuloyi n abyedai, əfye azaje,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Lo da Abyedo avyiyi fyi n Antiyok, Siriya ɓədo n Kilikiyai:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Gnaɓyi.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Yi kwu wo ge azaho n əyi atasni, ɓa ɓə la kwnu ntna əyi gbega jesnu ɓai gna fye gnagna, ɓai wnu fye abwugba n əɓoi n ɓa da nyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ntulonu əyi vnyanya yi kwu ye ge yi ɓa tnu azaho ya tnu ɓa tnutnu n əfye aba n kwnusnu n əyi anugwnudo ayeyeyi, Banaba n Bwulusii; <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />aza n ɓa kwu əɓahni awyewyeyi mà, n əfyi, ntu Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti əye ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ntucenu, yi tnu n Yahudai nu n Silai ɓa gbmiɓo n əgbei, ənya n yi ncei kafyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kwo wulo ngye, əɓo manai nu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi aba, ɓədo n əyii; to ya kpe fye azhnì n nyahonyahoi n du aɓo ye n yi ye fya shiɓwa, n ɓa kakpe shi nyi m: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Fye ɓa kwu fa ashna nyagyi gyi ɓo, n amisnii, n abwui anyakpa nya n pmyi ɓa bəgye nyi, jesnu n asisiɓozhnii. N fya kwu fa aɓo ye, a gye fye kwu zhni n bmya.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Yi fá fye n laafyiyai.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ntulonu a fyi ɓa n zokwo ɓa shnilo Antiyok, aba n ɓa ɓə ye Ikilisiya zhi n abagbmanyi ɓa ga ɓa paka. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Aza ɓa ba kwo, jesnu ɓa dagbma ntu əkwo ɓəda bwugbakaladna nya ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuda n Silai, aza n ɓa zhni sheaɓəgwognayi nu n əɓahni nyi, ɓa daɓo n mwa ntuge kwa myi avyiyi agwuzhi jesnu kwa dna ɓa bwugbakala. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />She ɓa ɓə kwu snu əsa fyi n ɓo, avyiyi ɓa gna ɓa ami n anabəlika bwugbafu nyai, ɓa jezelo da aza yi n ɓa ɓə tnu n ɓai nyi. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ama Sila wa ye waa kpedna n abaayi.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ama Bwulus n Banabai ɓa kwu kpefyi n Antiyok, aba n əɓa ɓədo n azajei n mwa bəgyé ɓə wunya jesnu ɓa zhni waazi Dagayi ɓədagbma nya.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gbeka dna n Bwulus n Banabai atasni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />N dəye avnu n əsadoi, Bwulus wa gna Banaba, “Fa ya jezelo ya ɓyi avyiyi gna fyi n azhi vnyanya n yi kwu ɓədagbma waazizhni nyi, jesnu ya gyewye she kwo wo ɓa lo.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banaba ɓə ncei pma wa la Yohana, n a je wo yi nge Marukwus nyi, n kwnusnu n ɓai, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />ama Bwulus to ɓə gye kwo bmyalo, ɓa la wo m, ntuge wo ɓə kwu ɓa fa fyi n Pamfyiliya jesnu to wa je gwodu n tnutnui n kwnusnu n ɓai m. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Əgbe kwaa ɓa ka n əwyei bmyibmyi, kwa zhni ɓaa gnajeya. Banaba wa la Marukwus, ɓa lofyi n əya nuwnanya ɓa lo Saipwurus, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />ama Bwulus wa knyi Sila ɓa kwuka, avyiyi ɓa kwu ɓa ga fyi n Dagayi shebmyashi. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Wa duya n Siriya n Kilikiyai woi myi aikilisiya agwuzhi.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timoti ɓwadodna n Bwulusii n Silai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bwulus wa ɓe Dabye, wa gbmi wa lo Listira, aba n mwutuyi ɓə dna ai yi wo nge Timoti. Əwo əya ɓə zhni Yahudiyi nu jesnu gaiciyagayi, ama əwo dada ɓə zhni Girik nu. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Agaiciyagayi n ɓa ɓə fyi n Listira n Ikwoninyai, ɓa ɓə kwu əɓo manai da tu n əwo tukwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bwulus ɓə ncei pma wa lo əzna n woi, ntulonu waa wo znunya ntu Ayahudiyi ɓo n ɓa ɓə fyi n səpai nyi, ntuge əɓa vnyanya ɓə kpe nge əwo dada ɓə zhni Girik nu. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Shi ɓa ɓə zna ɓai kwnu n əzhi gbmanyi ɓai lo əzhido, ɓa gna ɓəpitala n kwo ɓə gbmi n atnutnuloyi aba n abyedai; ədo n ɓa ɓə la n Urishelima ntuge aza ɓa shiɓwa nyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ntulonu aikilisiya ɓa kwu myizhi dna n gaiciyaganunui jesnu ɓa mwaɓe fyegyifyegyi n bəgyé.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus ɓəwyegye Makidoninyayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bwulus n əwo anugwnudoi, ɓa znazna fyi n Fyirgiya əknyisəpa vnyanya n Galatiyai, ntuge Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə la wo kpma ɓədagbma waazizhni n Asiya əknyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe Masiya əknyi əgna, ɓa zhni shi ɓa ɓá myi ɓa lofyi n Byitinya, ama to Yeisu Zafnu wa ye ɓa nge ɓa lofyi m. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ntulonu ɓa du Masiya ya ɓa shnilo Trowas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Dna n sukwo yi, Bwulus wa gye ɓəwyegye Makidoninyayi wo gnyi woi ɓa wo, “Fye piya ɓe Makidoninya fya bma yi zhni.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Shi Bwulus ɓə kwu ɓəwyegye ye gyewye, ya ye əyihni wolowolo n əsagbmanyii ya kwuka ya lo Makidoninya, ya gwo kwo nge Shekwoyi wo la yi yi nu, nge yi zhni waazi ga ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya abwuye dna n Fyilibyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ya kwuka n Trowas ya kwnufyi n shikwo, ya lo əya nuwnanya lo Samotira jesnu əfye kwa gyi zhi ya lo Ninyapwolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ya kwuka n abaayi ya znazna lo Fyilibyi, Aromayi əknyifna-begyidnaba n əknyii. Əkwo nu ɓə zhni əzhiyaakwo dnagbmai n Makidoninya əknyi. Yi ɓə kwu fyi n ɓo n anyipyei yi mwa bəgyé.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />N Sibyiwyii, ya kwnuya zhi n əzhiyaakwo aduba, zhi n əbmyi kwoi lo əlà, aba n yi ɓə n əwyei tu ge, yi ɓə ɓwa aduwazhni aba. Ya kwu sase zhi, ya ya ɓəda da n anyikwozai, n ɓa ɓəə la yezhi n ɓo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Əzaknayi n aza yi n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai knatnubwa nyi, nyikwoza nu, woi gbmi n Tiyatira, ai yi wo ge Lidiya. Wo ɓə zhni woi kwnú aje ayeda nu. Wo ɓə zhni Shekwoyi mwamwagayi nu. Dagayi wa gwu əwo ədu ya nabai wa gwo Bwulus nyawu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />She a ɓə zhni wo batizima n əwo apwuwadai, wa yì əyi fyi n əwo pwuwa. Wa gna, “Ngye fye la mi gwo nge mi zhni gaiciyagayi nu n Dagayi, akpəge fye ɓe fya kwu fyi n əmi pwuwa.” Njesnu wa tna yi aɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus n Silai fyi n zhalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />N əwyihoi she yi ɓə zhi yii lo aduwazhni aba, ya shegwnu fyenu ɓyinyikwoi n wo ɓə n zafnui dna n kwo wu aɓo n ɓa ye ɓeɓelo n abye. Wo ɓə zhni woi ɓwa gyiwye n mwa ga əwo adagayi n zokwusheshei. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Wa vyi Bwulus n əyii n yi ɓə kwnusnu n woi nyi, woi fyiakwu, “Aza ye zhni Shekwoyi Ikwoda Duduyi Atnutnuyi nu, n ɓa wu fye zokwo n fye ɓa ɓwa gnyignyi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Əɓyinyikwoi ye wa gwodu woi da ɓəye fyi n anyipyei bəgyé. Kwa ɓe kwaa Bwulus gyi minagyi dəidəi, kwa zhni wo wa pmyiawye wa gna zafnu nukwoi, “Dna n Yeisu Kirisiti əye, mi tu ho ɓəgbe, gbmiya ɓe n wo!” Dna n əsayii, zafnu nukwoi kwa gbmiya n wo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />She əwo adagayi ɓə kwu kpəge əɓa awyetu gyiwye ɓwa nya kwo kwu zo, ɓa wna Bwulus n Silai, ɓa gnyì ɓa lo adubayaakwo n ɓai ntuge ɓa lo ɓə gye əɓo n atukwoda ɓa zhni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ɓa ɓe n ɓai n awadayi aba ɓa gna, “Aza ye zhni Ayahudiyi nu, ama ɓa zhi ɓai la gbuzui kala gnyi n əyi əzhiyaakwo <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />ɓai wu akwnunu n əyi Aromayi ta ye m, kwo ge ya zhni m.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Deeji kwa dnaɓwado ń Bwulus lulu n Silai, jesnu awadayi ɓa ga əgbe nge a la aje kpma ɓa, a lu ɓa n abwusii. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />She a ɓə kwu ɓa lu dəidəi, a kwu ɓa sheya fyi n zhalu, a gna zhalugwuyi ge wo gwu ɓa n əwyei bmyibmyii. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />She wo ɓə gwo gbetu ye, wa kwu ɓa gwufyi n zhalu miimii nya jesnu wa kwu ɓa gyizhi n agbmai n apita.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Dna n sukwo sadu, Bwulus n Silai ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai zhniaduwa jesnu ɓai kwoanyi ga Shekwoyi, əɓa azhaluda aje ɓai kna ɓa tnubwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />N əsagbmanyii əknyi kwa jeashna n kalái, kwa zhni zhalu yi ashnipa kwa jeashna. N əsagbmanyii zhalu akpakwo ɓa gwuya zhi vnyanya, nlonu əzahozahoyi agbma ɓa kwnuya. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Zhalugwuyi wa kwnu-agyewyi, she wo ɓə gye zhalu akpakwo n gwuya zhi, wa wa əbeyaakwo woi ye wa wu əwohni ntuge wo ɓə zhninubwo nge azhaluda ɓa la bwusi. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ama Bwulus wa sáwyi, “To wu əhohni əɓwa m, əyi vnyanya fyilo n ya!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Zhalugwuyi wa tnu pyitila ɓo, wa lodna lo əmi əsii, wa she əwohni yazhi n Bwulus abye n Silai, woi vnyi n ədnai. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Nlonu wa kwnu ɓa ɓe ncei n əbmyi, wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fyaamwasa, knyiyi nu n mi ɓa zhni ntuge ma pwo a?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “La gaiciyaga n Dagayi Yeisu, ho ɓa pwo; əho n əho apwuwadai.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Nlonu ɓa da wo Dagayi ɓədagbma ɓədo n azajei vnyanya n ɓa fyi n əwo pwuwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Dna n sukwoyii, zhalugwuyi wa kwu ɓa, wa zhna ɓa aci ya; nlonu n əsagbmanyii əwo n əwo apwuwadai vnyanya a zhni ɓa batizima. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Zhalugwuyi wa ɓe n ɓai n əwo pwuwa wa ga ɓa nyagyi; waa nu n agbmadai ntuge wo la gaiciyaga n Shekwoyi; əwo n əwo apwuwadai vnyanya.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />She əfye ɓə gyi zhi, awadayi ɓa tnu əɓa atnutnuyi tnutnu lo zhalugwuyi aba n gbetu yei: “Kwu aza yi ya aɓwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Zhalugwuyi wa gna Bwulus, “Awadayi ɓa la əgbe ga nge, əho n Silai, a la fye kwnuya. Nsaiye fye ɓa myi fya lo. Fye lo n bwugbafui.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ama Bwulus wa gna atnutnuyi: “Ɓa kwu yi lu n aza awye ntna owada, kwo shikwonyi yi zhni Aromayi nu, jesnu ɓa kwu yi sheya fyi n zhalu. Nsaiye ɓa ye ɓa kwnu yi ya fyaa? Aawo! Ɓa ɓe n əɓahnii ɓa da yi apye yii kwnuya.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Atnutnuyi ɓa lo ɓa da awadayi ɓəye, she ɓa ɓə wo nge Bwulus n Silai ɓa zhni Aromayi nu, ɓa kwu wodna. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ɓa ɓe, ɓa tna ɓa aɓwa, jesnu ɓa da ɓa apye ɓai kwnuya n zhalu, ɓai ɓa ɓa nge ɓa la kwnu n əzhiyaakwo yi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />She Bwulus n Silai ɓə kwnuɓe n zhalu, ɓa lo Lidiya pwuwa, aba n ɓa ɓə snu n azajei, azanugbai n anyikwozai jesnu ɓa dna ɓa bwugbakala. Nlonu ɓa kwnuya, ɓa lo.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dna n Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />She Bwulus n əwo anugwnudoi ɓa ɓəə la duya n Ampyipwolis n Apwoloninyai, ɓa ɓe Tasalonika, aba n Ayahudiyibwokwnu ɓə gnyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />She wo ɓə dami woi zhni, Bwulus wa ɓwa Sibyiwyi ngwnu-ata, woi lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, woi zhni ɓənubwo n ɓai dna n Anyakagyigyiyi, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />woi kna ɓa awyeya jesnu woi wu ɓa nge kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ge, Kirisiti ɓə gyeazhnì jesnu woi laka n əfyi. Wa gna, “Yeisu ye n mi gnyi mii da fye əwo əɓo nyi, əwo nu zhni Kirisiti.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Kwa kwu Ayahudiyi ho kwnuawye jesnu ɓa dnaɓwado n Bwulusii ɓədo n Silai n ɓwasnu she Agirikiyi Shekwodnawoyi bəgyé ɓədo n anyikwoza awyekpmiyii fyewyi ɓə zhni nyi.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ama Ayahudiyi aje ɓə zhi n nuwnui; ntulonu ɓa ye aza zhi n ɓa ɓə n alu nukwoi, agyikicizhniyi ɓai kwnu ń gnyikwo, ɓa pa ɓa anyàwu, jesnu ɓa ya gyikicizhni fyi n əzhiyaakwo. Ɓa bwusi lo Jason pwuwa ɓai zna Bwulus shni n Silai nabai ɓa kwnu ɓa ɓe deeji ncei. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama she ɓa to ɓə gye ɓa əwye m, ɓa gnyì Jason ɓədo n avyiyi ajei, ɓa lo n ɓai n əzhiyaakwo atukwoda aba ɓai ɓəwyi: “Aza ye n ɓa la gbuzui laka gnyi ń anyì vnyanya nyi, ɓa kwu ɓe n ya, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />jesnu Jason wo la ɓa gwo fyi n əwo pwuwa. Ɓa zhi ɓai znu Kaisa aɓəgbetu əgna nu vnyanya, ɓai gna nge əsu ədo lo, n a yi ge Yeisu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo dəye, deeji n əzhiyaakwo atukwodai ɓa kwu jeje. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Nlonu ɓa zhni Jason n azajei ɓa gwo əɓahni əɓwa n atukwoda aba, ɓa ya ɓa, ɓa lo.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyi n Byeriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />She sukwo ɓə zè zhnizhni, avyiyi ɓa gna Bwulus ami n Silai lo ncei n Byeriya. N ɓa sisii n ɓo, ɓa lofyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Nsayii Abyeriyayi Ayahudiyi ɓə du aza yi n ɓa ɓə fyi n Tasalonika nyi n alu manai; ntuge ɓa ɓə la ɓəda gwo n pwawo yaakwoi jesnu ɓa pmi Anyakagyigyiyi fyegyifyegyi, ɓa kpe kwo ngye əɓo n Bwulus ɓə da nyi, nge kwo zhni gaiciya nu. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ntu dəye ɓo, bəgyé n ɓa, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga, n ɓwasnu she Agirikiyi anyikwoza awyekpmiwuyi bəgyé n azanugbayii ce, ɓə kwu gaiciyaga nyi.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ama she Ayahudiyi n ɓa fyi n Tasalonika ɓə wo nge Bwulus zhni waazi Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nya lo n Byeriya, azaho n ɓa, ɓa lo ɓo ce, ɓai fyi deeji ya njesnu ɓai kwu ɓa abwugbakala. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />N əsagbmanyii avyiyi ɓa gna Bwulus ami lo shikwo əgbe, ama Sila n Timotii ɓa kwu kpefyi n Byeriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə gna Bwulus ami nyi, ɓa ɓe n woi n Atens jesnu ɓa kwuka n ɓo n gbegai ntu Sila ɓo n Timotii nge ɓa zhni ɓa ɓə da wo shi kwo ɓa yezhni ntna əsa gyii.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dna n Atens</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Bwulus woi ye dna woi pmi ɓa dna n Atens, bwugba kwaa wo wnuya n mwa, she wo ɓə gye əzhiyaakwo n nunui gnyi n ashnai. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ntulonu wa kwnuɓənubwozhni dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu n Ayahudiyii ɓədo n Agirikiyii n ɓa wo Shekwoyi ədna, jesnu gnyi n adubayaakwo n aza yii fyegyifyegyi, n ɓa ɓə zhi n abaayi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Əpyikwuriya okwu ɓədo n Sitoyiki aɓoajekwuyi okwui n ɓa ta ye nge a wu agbmada kwo snasna nyi m, ɓa ɓe ɓa naɓo kpeaje n woi. Azaho n ɓa, ɓa nyaɓo, “Ɓədankwolo nya ye gnyi woi ye wa da knyiɓei nu a?” Azaje ɓa gna, “Wo wulo ngye wo gnyi woi da ashna azhiɓeyi nya ho nu ɓo,” Ɓa ɓə da dəye ntuge Bwulus ɓə gnyi woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya nu, ntu Yeisu ɓo ɓədo n əwo kalalai n əfyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Nlonu ɓa la wo ɓa lo n woi n Arepagwus ayezhiba, aba n ɓa ɓə gna wo ge, “Kwo ɓa yezhni ya kpé nyawu woiwoi ye ɓəgənyi, n ho gnyi hoi wu nyi? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ho gnyi hoi ɓe n aɓo azhiɓeyi nyai nu fyi n əyi atnubwa, jesnu yi ncei pmalo ya kpé əɓa ɓətukwo ye.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ateniyi vnyanya ɓədo n azhiɓeyii n ɓa ɓə fyi n ɓo, ɓa ɓə zhni ɓa la əsa n mwa toge ɓai zhni ɓəho m, akpəge ɓai daɓo jesnu ɓai kna aɓo awoiwoyi tnubwa.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Nlonu Bwulus wa laka gnyiagnyi dna n Arepagwus yezhi wa gna: “Ateniyi! Mi kwu gye nge n zokwo dəhodəhoi, fye zhni Shekwoyi aznashniyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ntuge əsa n ma sheɓa ncei ma shi anya awye n fye ga ɓa mwamwa nyi pəceye, kwo bəgədi ho n ma gyewye nyi, kwo ɓə n ənya yei kakpe n kwo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="ACT 17:23">Ntu n Shekwoyi ɓo n a ta Kpe Əwo Əye Lo M.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:23">Ntulonu fye n tnayekpei lo, ənya nya n fye gba kwo nyi; əɓo nu nyi, n mi ye ma gna fye.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Shekwoyi n wo ɓə zhni anyì n anyai vnyanya n ɓa fyi n kwo nyi, əwo nu zhni Dagayi əshemi nya n əknyii, jesnu wo to dna n dagayipwuwa nu, ń a mi n azanyikwoci aɓwai nyi m. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Njesnu a ta zhni wo tnutnu n azanyikwoci aɓwai nu, ngye wo gyi nyaho əsna lo m. N əkwoɓwi, əwo n əwohni tukwoi, əwo nu ga zahozahoyi wyewyeyi n əsnui ɓədo n anya ajei n ɓa ce nyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />N zaknayii, wa zhni abye vnyanya, nabai n ɓa ɓá fyi n anyì vnyanya; jesnu wa kwu asa kpe ɓa fyi n nabagyiɓopá, ɓədo n əɓa aknyignai. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Shekwoyi ɓə zhni dəye nabai n ɓa ɓə zna wo shni nu, kpesnu ɓa su wo kpe jesnu ɓa ɓwa wo; kwo shikwonyi wo to mwakpa lo n zahozahoyii n yi m. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />‘Ntuge yi gyianyì fyi n wo nu, yii znazna fyi n wo jesnu yii ɓwa əyihni fyi n wo.’ Ngye she əfyehni aɓəkpedayi ho ncei da lo, ‘Yi zhni əwo aɓyi nu.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Ntucenu shikwonyi yi zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi nu, yi to zhninubwo ge ikwoda vnyanya wo wulo ngye zinali nu kwo azulufa kwo kwuta nakwoi m; ənyadogbe n azanyikwoci aɓwa nu ncei zhni shi n əgbai nyi m. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />N sapa Shekwoyi ɓə kwu tnagənyikpe ye pya myinawyei, ama nsaiye wo ga aza vnyanya ɓəgbetu lo, n ɓwahoɓwahoi nge ɓa yeabwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ntuge wo la nyipyei shi n wo ɓə da anyì owa ncei ntnagyifyi, n əzai n wo la knyignyi nyi. Wo la dəye pəwu n zahozahoyi aba, əsa n wo ɓə la wo kala ncei n əfyi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />She ɓa ɓə wo əɓo ntu əfyikalakwu ɓo, azaho n əɓa mi, ɓa ma asnaɓwugyi, ama azaje ɓa gna, “Yi ncei pmalo yii je ho tnubwakna ntu ɓəye ɓo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />N dəyei, Bwulus wa gbmiya n bwokwnu. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Azaho ɓa kwu zhni Bwulus avyiyi jesnu ɓa kwu gaiciyaga. Aza n ɓa ɓə ga gaiciya nu nyi; Diyonisis əza n wo ɓə dna n Arepagwus avyiyi, jesnu nyikwozai ai yi wo ge Damaris, ɓədo n azajei n mwa bəgyé.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Dna n Kworenti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />N dəye avnu, Bwulus wa gbmiya n Atens wa lo Kworenti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Dna n abaayi, wa gye Yahudiyi ai yi wo ge Akwuila. Wo ɓə gbmi n Pwontus nu, əsa to ɓəə mwa she wo ɓə gbmiɓe n Itali n əwo nyikwoi Pirisila m, ntuge Kladiyus ɓə la əgbe ga Ayahudiyi vnyanya nge ɓa la kwnu n Roma. Bwulus wa lo ntuge woo gye ɓa, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />jesnu shikwonyi wo ɓə zhni lubwituyi nu cè ngye ɓa, waa kpedna wa kwnu tnutnuzhni n ɓai. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Sibyiwyi dəhodəhoi wa kwnuɓənubwozhni n azai fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu woi zhni shi wo ɓa myi, woi wunya n Ayahudiyi aba n Agirikiyi n aɓwatnai.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />She Sila n Timotii ɓə kwnu n Makidoninya ɓa ɓe da wo, Bwulus waa əwohni ga dna n waazizhni kwohnikwohni, woi gbmiɓo ga Ayahudiyi nge Yeisu nu ɓə zhni Kirisiti. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ama she ɓa ɓə gnyiapaapa n Bwulusii jesnu kwaa si ɓai knyiakpmi, wa kwnu əwo aje ya dna n bwugbawnu jesnu wa gna ɓa, “Əfye ami ɓa kwu kpe n əfye atukwo! Mi zhni tnaɓətui nu ntu əɓəye ɓo. Ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei, mi ɓa lo da Abyedo.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Nlonu Bwulus wa gbmi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, wa lo pwuwa n kwo yatu Titiyus Justus pwuwa nyi, Shekwoyi mwamwagayi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisipwus Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda ɓədo n əwo apwuwadai vnyanya ɓa kwu gaiciyaga n Dagayi; jesnu Akworentiyi bəgye n ɓa ɓə kwu Bwulus waazi wo nyi, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga jesnu a kwu batizima zhni ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Dna n sukwo hó, Dagayi wa daɓo n Bwulusii dna n ɓəwyegye: “To wodna m; gwodu ha daɓo, to la cepyi m. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Ntuge mi kwnusnu lo n hoi, jesnu əzaho ta znu ho ənya kwo wa wu ho əɓwa m, ntuge mi n azai fyilo n əzhiyaakwo ye n mwa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ntulonu Bwulus waa dna n Kworenti əye ɓwugyi n tokwnui woi wu ɓa Shekwoyi ɓədagbma.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galiyo n wo ɓə zhni gwomna tu n Akaiya, Ayahudiyi Kworenti nya ɓa pagbe, ɓa wna Bwulus ɓa ɓe n woi n awadaba. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Ɓa gna, “Əza ye gnyilo woi tna aza aɓwa nge ɓa ga Shekwoyi mwamwa ń azokwoi n owa to ncei ye lo m.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />N ɓwasnu n əsai n Bwulus ɓə ye wa daɓo ncei, Galiyo wa gna ɓa, “Ndəi əfye Ayahudiyi fye ɓə zhi fyei maaɓo alu nukwoi ho nya nu, kwo aɓogala ayaakwo ho, kwo ɓəə ɓaa mi zè əɓo n kwo kwnuce lo ma kna fye tnubwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ama shikwonyi kwo lo ntu aɓənya ɓo nu aɓədagbma nya, ɓədo n əfye owai; fye kwu kwo wnado fyehnifyehni. Mi taa da owa tu n aɓo ye pya m.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ntulonu wa nya ɓa ya n owada bwokwnu. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Nlonu deeji n kwo ɓə zhi n abaayi nyi, ɓa pmyiawye wulo Sositeni əɓwa Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda jesnu ɓa lu wo gnyi n gwomna awye; jesnu to Galiyo wa gye əwo anuwna m, kwo cewyi.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pirisila, Akwuila n Apwolosii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bwulus waa dna n Kworenti waa snusa. Nlonu wa gbmi wa fa əwo azaje fyi, azanugbai n anyikwozai, wa lo Siriya n əya nuwnanyai, Pirisila n Akwuilai ɓa da wo apye. Wo ɓə snu n wo piyalo, waa əwo tukwoyi gbeya n Kankiriya ntu ɓəgbeshi ɓo n wo ɓəə la shi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ɓa si Afyisus, aba n Bwulus ɓə fa Pirisila gnyi n Akwuilai nyi. Əwo n əwohni tukwo wa lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu wa kwnuɓənubwozhni n Ayahudiyii. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />She ɓa ɓə nya wo əɓo ge wo ye la kwnudna n ɓai əsa fyewyi, to wa ye m. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ama she wo ɓə fa ɓa waa əɓo shigbe, “Ngye Shekwoyi ɓəye nu, mi ɓə jezeɓe.” Nlonu wa lo əya nuwnanya wa gbmiya n Afyisus. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />She wo ɓə si Kaisariya, wa gwnulo Urishelima wa ɓyi ikilisiya əgna jesnu wa shnilo Antiyok.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />She wo ɓə la snusa dna n Antiyok, Bwulus wa gbmi n abaayi wa zna laɓa woi gbmi n aba gbmanyi woi lo ədo dna n Galatiya əknyi vnyanya n Fyirgiyai woi myi amwutuyi gaiciyaga zhi vnyanya.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Aɓwazhilo, Yahudiyi ai yi wo ge Apwolos, woi gbmi n Alekzandariya, wa ɓe Afyisus. Əza ye ɓə n ənyai babai dəidəi n Anyakagyigyiyi ɓəyekpei n gwnuaɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />A ɓə kwu ənya wu wo n Dagayi zokwo jesnu wa daɓo n awyetu yaakwoi wa wunya ntu Yeisu ɓo n nunui dəidəi, kwo shikwonyi wo ɓə n Yohana Batizimazhniyi yekpei nu ɓwasnu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Wa ya ɓəda n kalái dnadnai, dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu. She Pirisila n Akwuilai ɓə kna wo tnubwa, ɓa yi wo dna n əɓa pwuwa, ɓa ga wo awyega Shekwoyi zokwo nya n kwnuaɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />She Apwolos ɓə ye wa lo Akaiya, əwo azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai ɓa dna wo bwugbakala jesnu ɓa ka paka ga amwutuyi fyi n abaayi nge ɓa la wo gwo. She wo ɓə si abaayi, waa zhni bmazhni yaakwo ga aza yi dna n Shekwoyi shebmyashi, n ɓa ɓə kwu gaiciyaga nyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi gnyiapaapa n əwyei bmyibmyii n Ayahudiyii n ɓa ɓə zhi n aɓəna ɓo nyi n bəgyé, woi wu dna n Anyakagyigyiyi nge Yeisu nu zhni Kirisiti.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus dna n Afyisus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apwolos wo ye dna n Kworenti, Bwulus wa wna zokwo lo n zhabwii wa si Afyisus. N abaayi wa gye amwutuyi ho: <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye ɓə la Zafnu Gyigyiyi gwo, əsa n fye ɓə ga gaiciya nyi?” Ɓa dnaɓəgbe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">“Aawo, yi to shni Zafnu Gyigyiyi əɓo wo m.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ntulonu Bwulus wa nyaɓo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">“Fya ɓə ɓwa knyi batizima yi nu a?” Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yohana batizimazhni nya nu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bwulus wa gna, “Yohana batizimazhni ɓə zhni batizima abwuye nya nu. Wo ɓə gna aza ge, ɓa kwu gaiciyaga n əza n wo ɓe lo n əwo avnu nyi, n əwo nu zhni Yeisu nyi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo dəye, a zhni ɓa batizima dna n Dagayi Yeisu əye. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />She Bwulus ɓə kpe ɓa əwo aɓwa, Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa shnikpe ɓa; ɓa daɓo n anyitala ajei jesnu ɓa da sheɓəgwogna. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓə nyi ngye azanugbai awoceaba nu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Bwulus wa lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu wa daɓo n əgbei myimyii apya ngwnu-ata, woi naɓo n əɓai n aɓwatnai ntu Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ama azaho ɓa kwu əɓa adu kpakalá; to ɓa ye ɓa ga gaiciya m, jesnu ɓai wnu Zokwo ye əye ya gnyi n bəgyé. Ntulonu Bwulus wa gbmiya n əɓa aba. Wa kwu amwutuyi n kwnusnu n woi, jesnu ɓai kwuaɓoaje n nyipyei dəhodəhoii fyi n Tirannus nyawu nyakwnu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Dəye kwa gwodu nlonu aye ngwnu-aba, kwa zhni Ayahudiyi n Agirikiyii n ɓa ɓə fyi n Asiya əknyi nyi, ɓa kwu Dagayi ɓədagbma wo.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Shekwoyi wa zhni apma n Bwulusii wa zhni aɓəwowo adnagbmai, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />kwaa zè nge kwo amisawnuya aje ɓədo n ajeɓyiyi ajewnafyi nyai n kwo ɓə la to n əwo nayi, ai kwu ɓa lo anyasnai ncei, ɓai ɓwa kágna n əɓa anyasna jesnu ase ɓai kwnuya n ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ayahudiyi ho, n ɓa ɓə laɓa ɓai kwnu azafnu anukwoi ya, ɓa zhniatna nabai ɓa zhni apma n Dagayi Yeisu əyei kpe n aza yi n ɓa ɓə n asei fyi nyi. Ɓa ɓə zhni ɓai gna, “Dna n Yeisu əye n Bwulus zhni əwo waazi nyi, mi tu fye ɓəgbe, fye kwnuya.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Skeva, Ayahudiyi apirisiti tukwoda, əwo aɓyi azanugbai ngwnu-tnaaba nu ɓə laɓa ɓai zhni aɓo ye. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />N əwyihoi, ase kwa dna ɓa ɓəgbe, “Yeisu, mi kpe wo əye lo, jesnu mi kpe Bwulus əye lo, ama anyika nu zhi n fyei a?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Nlonu əza n wo ɓə n asei dna nyi, waa du ɓa n kalá, wa kwu ɓa gyisnu əɓa vnyanya, wa lu ɓa ɓəhnihni nya, ɓa kwnuya n nyakwnu yi n aɓwotoloi, amii zhe ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />She Ayahudiyi n Agirikiyii n ɓa ɓə fyi n Afyisus ɓə kwu anabagyi ye wo, ədna kwa wo aza vnyanya, ɓaa Dagayi Yeisu əye shi dna n mwamwaga. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Aza bəgyé yi n ɓa ɓə kwu gaiciyaga nsayii nyi, ɓa ɓe, ɓa yeabwi zhi n aza awye, ɓa da aɓənukwoi n ɓa ɓəə kwu luzhni. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Aza n ɓa ɓə zhni ɓai she zokwu, ɓa ɓe n əɓa apa nyakazhii kpmikpmii shi, ɓa ye ɓa gwnuaje, ɓa gyi ɓa əná n aza awye vnyanya. She ɓa ɓə kwu gyiwye aje kwaa gbmi azulufa adugwu shiitnu. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />N zokwo ye nu Dagayi ɓədagbma kwa lapwi laɓa jesnu kwa mwa dna n kalá.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />She aɓo ye vnyanya ɓə kwu zhni, Bwulus wa dna dnabwugba wa lo Urishelima wa duya n Makidoninya n Akaiyai. Wa gna, “She mi ɓə la lo abaayi, ɓəshishi nu mii lo gnaɓyi n Roma cè.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Wa tnu əwo abmazhniyi tnutnu ngwnu-aba, Timoti n Irasitusii n Makidoninya, ama waa ce dna n Asiya əknyi waa snusa fyewyi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyikici dna n Afyisus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Dna n əsa yi, gyikici yaakwo kwa laka gnyi, ntu Yeisu Zokwo ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Azulufa əpyada ai yi wo ge Demyetus, n wo ɓə zhni woi zhni Atemyis ashna azulufa nya nyi, wa ɓe n agbákwnuyi n aɓwazei n mwa n abaayi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Wa yì ɓa zhi n abagbmanyi, n kwnusnu n azajei n ɓa fyi n əɓa aɓwaze pya, wa gna: “Əmi anugwnudo, fye kpəlo nge gyiwye loɓe, da yi lo n mwa, n aɓwaze ye. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Fye gyewye lo jesnu fyei wo she Bwulus ye, wo kwu aza abwugba wna n mwa bəgyé, n ɓa fyi n Afyisus nyi, jesnu wo la aza pmyiawye kpeekpe n ɓa fyi n Asiya əknyi nyi. Wo gna lo nge ashna ń zanyikwoci aɓwa nu ɓə zhni, nge ɓa to zhni ashekwoyi nu m, kpeekpe. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Azhnìgye lo, to ɓwasnu ge əyi aɓwaze nu ɓə ɓwu əkwo əye manai nuwna m, ama nge Atemyis ashnapwuwa yaakwo n əkwohni ce, n a gba kwo n Asiya əknyi vnyanya ɓədo n anyì nyi, a ɓə la əkwo zafnu mwamwa ga kpmazhi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />She ɓa ɓə wo dəye, ɓa ya minagyi gyi, ɓa ya wyiɓe, “Atemyis Afyisuyi nya zhni ənya yaakwo nu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Əsa fyewyi, əzhiyaakwo vnyanya kwaa totu gnyi n wyiɓei. Aza ɓa wna Gayus ɓədo Arisitakwusii, Bwulus znazna anugwnudo n ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe n Makidoninya n kwnusnu nyi, əɓa vnyanya ɓa bwusi lo awyefnanyakwnu n kwnusnu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bwulus ɓə ye wa gbmignyi n deeji abye nu, ama to amwutuyi ɓa ye wo m. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Kwo əknyi yi atnutnuyi, Bwulus anugwnudo, ɓa tnu tnutnu ga wo ɓai tna wo aɓwa nge wo to lo awyefnanyakwnu m.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Yezhi yi ɓə fyi gnyi n ɓəyeɓwi nu: Azaho ɓəwyi əɓo gbmanyi nya, azaje əɓədo nya. Aza bəgyé to ɓə kpe əɓo ye n kwa zhni ai yezhi n ɓo m. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Ayahudiyi ɓa gbmi Alekzanda gnyi n abye, ɓa gna wo aɓəgbega n wo ɓa da. Wa kwu aɓwa wu nge ɓa kwu cepyi nabai wa gnyi əwohni tukwo n aza aba. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ama she ɓa ɓə kwu kpe nge wo zhni Yahudiyi nu, əɓa vnyanya n əgbei gbmanyi, ɓa ɓəwyi kwuu ngye asnukna ngwnu-aba, ɓai gna: “Atemyis Afyisuyi nya zhni ənya Yaakwo nu!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Əzhi nyakanyakayi wa zhni deeji kwa kwu cepyi wa gna, “Əmi azaje Afyisuyi, anyì vnyanya ta kpəlo nge, Afyisus əzhiyaakwo nu zhni Atemyis yaakwo əshnanyakwnu gwuyi, ɓədo n əkwo dogbe n kwo ɓə kaya shnizhi n əshemi nyi m? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi a taa kpe aɓo ye aɓəna nyi m, kwo gwo fyaa nazhi jesnu to fya zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi dna n pyepye m. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Fye kwu ɓe n aza yei n ya, kwo shikwonyi ɓa too wyi nyaho n əshnanyakwnu kwo ɓa da wyegbaci ɓo tu n əyi əshna m. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ngye Demyetus n əwo aɓwazeyi ajei n ɓəho yaakwoi lo tu n zahozahoyi tukwo, owa abwokwnu gwuya zhi lo jesnu awadayi fyilo. Fye lo fye kwnu əfye aɓəsna ɓə ncei n abaayi. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ngye əɓədo lo n fye ye kwa kwnuɓe ncei n du dəye, a ɓa da kwo n awadayi adogwnuba nu. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Shi kwo gnyi nyi, yi fyi zhi n abwi nu, a ɓə tu yi əɓo gyikici kala la nya, ntu əɓo ɓo n kwo kwu zhni nnaiye nyi. N kwa zè nlonu, yi to ɓə myi ya ga nyadokwu ɓəgala ye nya m, shikwonyi ɓəho to lo n kwo ɓə kwnuce a zhni kwo m.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Shi wo ɓə kwu dəye da, wa gna azadogwnu ami.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓa duya n Makidoninya n Girisii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />She gyikici ɓə la nazhi, Bwulus wa tnu amwutuyi ɓo, she wo ɓə kwu bwugba fyi ɓa kala, wa gna ɓa ami jesnu wa wna əzna lo Makidoninya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Wa znazna dnalo n səpa yi, woi da aɓədagbma bwugbakaladna nya n mwa ga aza, n kpmasnu wa si Giris, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />aba n wo ɓə la dna apya ngwnu-ata. Ntuge Ayahudiyi ho ɓə kwu əwo kwúlupa n ɓwasnu dna n əsa n wo ɓə ye wa piyalo Siriya nyi, ntulonu wa jezelo n Makidoninya zokwoi. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Aza n ɓa ɓə da wo apye nu ɓə nyi, Sopata Pyirus nugwnu Byeriyayi, Arisitakwus n Sekwundusii ɓai kwnu n Tasalonika, Gayus woi gbmi n Dabye, n Timotii ce; jesnu n Ticikwusii ɓədo n Trofyimwusii ɓai kwnu n Asiya əknyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Aza ye ɓə gyilo n əyi abye, ɓa lo ɓa pmi yi zhi n Trowas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Shi Gnanaznu awyefna ɓə kwu zo fna, ya lo əya nuwnanya n Fyilibyi ya ɓwa anyipyei ngwnu-atnu, ya snu n əyi azajei zhi n Trowas; yi ɓə kwu fyi n abaayi anyipyei ngwnu-tnaaba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Itikwus laka n əfyi dna n Trowas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />N nyipyei kpmisnui laadi nya, ya yezhi n abagbmanyi ntuge ya gyi Dagayi nyagyi. Bwulus wa daɓo n azai, shikwonyi wo ɓə ncei pma wa fa ɓa n əfyegyizhii nu, wa daɓo nya sadù. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Apyitila bəgyé ɓə vyaana kpe n nyakwnudotu aba n yi ɓə gwnudo fyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Əɓyikasa ai yi wo nge Itikwus, n wo ɓə tu n wyegye, əgyewna kwului kwaa wo kwu, shi Bwulus ɓə daɓo waa mwasa. She wo ɓə la wnagye kwulu, wa kaya shi n əknyi n nyakwnudotu baayi, a la wo n fyífyii. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Bwulus wa kashi shnilo əknyi, wa ta əwohni ya tu n əɓyikasa yi, wa kwu əwo aɓwa kpe wo. Wa gna, “Agwu to vnyi fye m, wo n wyewyeyii lo!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Nlonu wa je gwnulo nyakwnudotu wa gná Dagayi nyagyi, ɓa gyi. She wo ɓə kwu əɓo da nya fyegyizhi, wa fa ɓa, wa lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Aza ɓa la əɓyikasa yi lo ncei n apyi n wyewyeyi, jesnu ɓa kwu atnazhni yaakwo nya ɓwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus gna Afyisuyi abyeda ami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ya kwu gyilo n abye, yii lo əya nuwnanya aba, jesnu ya lofyi n əya nuwnanya lo Assos, aba n yi ɓə lo yii la Bwulus dna n əya nuwnanya. Wo ɓə kwu aɓo ye kpeafye ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi lo abaayi n apitai nu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Shi wo ɓə shegwnu yi n Assos, wa lodna n əya nuwnanya da yi, ya gwodu lo Myitilin. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, ya lofyi n əya nuwnanya ya ɓe vyivyiwyi n Kiyosii. She əfye ɓə je gyi zhi, ya piya kpe n Samos, jesnu əfye kwa gyi zhi ya si Myiletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bwulus ɓə la bwugbadna nge wo ɓa sa Afyisus duya nabai to wa gyi əsa dna n Asiya əknyi m, ntuge awye ɓə n woi ya, wa si Urishelima; n kwo ɓa yezhni dna n pyentikwos əwyi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Dna n Myiletus, Bwulus wa tnu Afyisuyi ikilisiya abyeda ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />She ɓa ɓə si da wo, wa gna ɓa: “Fye kpəlo she mi ɓə gyianyì əsa vnyanya n mi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei, ənya n kwo laka n nyipyei kpmisnui n mi ɓə loɓe Asiya əknyi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mi ɓə kwu tnutnuzhni ga Dagayi dna n tukwogba yaakwo ɓədo n awyenyii, jesnu dna n mwumwu napyei ntu əmi Ayahudiyi anuwnui kwúlupa ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Fye kpəlo nge mi to ɓə bmabwugba ma zhni waazi ɓəhoɓəhoi nya, n kwo ɓa snu n bmazhnii n əfye aba m, ama ma wunya zhi n əfye aba, jesnu n aza bəgyé aba, mii vyi apwuwa n apwuwai. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mi kwu da Ayahudiyi n Agirikiyii nge ɓəshishi nu ɓa pmyiɓe da Shekwoyi dna n abwuye, jesnu ɓa kwu gaiciyaganunui dna n əyi Dagayi Yeisu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Njesnu nsaiye, Zafnu Gyigyiyi wo la myìtu mi, mi gnyi mii lo Urishelima nu, ama mi ta kpe əɓo əye lo n kwo ɓə ɓwa mi n ɓwaayi m. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Əɓo n mi ɓwa kpəlo əkwo nu nge, Zafnu Gyigyiyi kwnù mi lo nge dna n əzhiyaakwo dəhodəhoi, zhalu n azhnìgyei zhilo ɓai pmi mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Dudulonu, mi too gye əmi wyewyeyi n apma hoi n əmi aba m; əmi ɓəmwi gbmanyi əkwo nu ge, mii pwo əmi anyìgyi ɓo, jesnu mii kwu tnutnu zozhni n Dagayi Yeisu wo la ga mi nyi; tnutnu nabagyi manai ɓəgbmi Shekwoyi shebmyashi nya.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nsaiye, mi kpəlo nge, əzahozahoyi to lo n əfye, ń mi kwnú laɓa yii zhni waazi Shekwoyi əbemi nya, n wo ɓə je əmi əwyegye m, kpeekpe. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ntucenu, n naiye mi gna fye nu nge, mi to n ɓətui lo ń zahozahoyi ami, n fye m. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Ntuge mi to ɓə wo ɓwato ma wu fye Shekwoyi ɓəye nunui m. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Fye kwu əwyewna əfyehni, ɓədo n agəlucei vnyanya n Zafnu Gyigyiyi wo kwu fye zhni aɓəwyednayi nyi. Fye kwu zhni aknyiknayi Shekwoyi ikilisiya nya, ədo n wo ɓə si n əwohni amii nyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mi kpəlo nge shi mi fa fye, acamcam anapyei ɓə loɓe fyi n əfye atasni, ɓai wna gəluce əsnu. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Kwo aza fyi n əfyehni atasni, n ɓa ɓə kwukazhi, ɓai gbmi gaiciyanunui aɓoaje nabai ɓai kna amwutuyi ga əɓahni. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ntulonu, fye kwu zhigwu! Fye pá nge dna n aye ngwnu-ata; mi to ɓə fa əzahozahoyi kwnù ɓo, n nyipyeii, n sukwoi, ɓədo n əmi awyenyii m.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Nsaiye, mi fyi əfye n Shekwoyi akwnu nu ɓədo n ɓədagbma əwo shebmyashi nyai, n kwo ɓa myi kwa mi fye, jesnu kwa ga fye əgwú dna n aza yi atasni vnyanya n ɓa gyigyiyi lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Mi to ɓə kwnufnafna əzahozahoyi azulufa nya, kwo zinali kwo aje m. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Əfye n əfyehni tukwoi, fye kpəlo nge əmi aɓwa ye nu ɓə zhni tnutnu, ma ɓwa əmi apmanya, ɓədo n əmi atnutnu kwnuzhniyi anyai. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Dna n ɓəhoɓəhoi n mi ɓə kwu zhni, mi ɓə kwu wu fye nge, n tnutnu kalazhni nya ye pyai nu nlai, n yi ɓa bma akalágbai zhni, fyei pá Dagayi Yeisu aɓədagbma ɓo, n wo ɓə da n əwohni tukwoi: ‘Kwo dulo n anabəlika əza wa ga azaje ənya, a fa ədo n wo ɓa gwogwo nyi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />She Bwulus ɓə la pwo ɓəda ɓo, wa ceakwokwo shi n kwnusnu n ɓai vnyanya, wa zhniaduwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa ciɓwi, ɓai yama wo jesnu ɓa shepma wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Əɓo n kwo ɓə wnu ɓa bwugba n du, əkwo nu zhni əwo ɓəda ge, ɓa taa je əwo awyeba wyegye m, kpeekpe. Nlonu ɓa gna wo ami lo əya nuwnanya aba.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus znazna lo Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Shi yi ɓəə kwu aje gnami, ya kwnufyi n shikwo ya znazna cewo lo Kos. Əfye kwa gyi zhi, ya lo Rodis, ya kwuka n abaayi ya lo Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ya gye əya nuwnanya shi kwoi piyalo Fonishiya, ya lofyi n kwo, ya wna əzna. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Shi yi ɓə tawye ya gye Saipwurus, ya duya n əkwo snuta, ya znazna ya lo Siriya. Ya lo ya kwnuzhi n Taya, aba n əyi əya nuwnanya ɓə ye kwa kwnu akaya zhi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ya zna amwutuyi shni n abaayi jesnu ya kwu kwnufyi n ɓai anyipyei tnaaba. Dna n Zafnu, ɓa gyi Bwulus əwye nge wo to lo Urishelima m. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />She nyipyei ɓə la si n yi ɓa kwuka, ya fa n ɓo ya gwodu n əyi əznai. Əɓa vnyanya ɓədo n əɓa anyikwoi n aɓyii, ɓa gna yi ami, ɓaa kwnuya n yii n əzhiyaakwo, jesnu ya kwu ma n shikwo əgbe, ya knyiakwokwo zhi ya zhniaduwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Shi yi ɓə kwu aje gna mi, ya lofyi n əya nuwnanya, ɓa jezelo apyi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ya gwodu n əyi əznai fyi n əya, yii kwuka n Taya ya kwnuzhi n Pitolemi, aba n yi ɓə ɓyi əyi azaje əgna azanugbai n anyikwozai jesnu ya kwu kwnufyi n ɓai nyipyei ɓwugyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, ya kwuka ya kwu si Kaisariya jesnu ya kwu fyi n Fyilibwus pwuwa, waazizhniyi, gbmanyi dna n anyagyignayi Tnaaba yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Wo ɓə n anyigwnu akwului ngwnu-anyi, n ɓa da sheɓəgwogna<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Shi yi ɓə kwu fyi n əwo aba, anyipyei fyewyi, sheɓəgwognayi ai yi əwo əye nge Agabwus, wa shnizhi ɓe woi gbmi n Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />She wo ɓə ɓe da yi, wa kwu Bwulus gigyiznu shnipa, wa pa əwohni aɓwa ɓədo n apitai wa gna, “Zafnu Gyigyiyi kwu gna, ‘Nlai nu n Ayahudiyi, fyi n Urishelima, ɓəə pa əza n əwo gigyiznu əpa ye shi nyi, jesnu ɓa ɓə la wo ga dna n Abyedo akwnu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />She yi ɓə wo əɓo ye, əyi ɓədo n azajei ya gyi Bwulus əwye nge wo to gwnulo Urishelima m. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Nlonu Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei ciɓwi jesnu fyei bma mi ədu a? Mi la əmihni kwu, toge ai ɓwa mi papa nu m, ama mii fyi, dna n Urishelima ntu Dagayi Yeisu əye ɓo.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />She a to ɓə myi a kpma wo ce m, ya fa wo, ya gna, “Dagayi ɓəye, kwo zhni.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />N dəye avnu, ya lofyi n zokwo ya gwnulo Urishelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Amwutuyi ho ɓai kwnu n Kaisariya ɓa da yi apye jesnu ɓa ɓe n yii n Manason pwuwa, ya kwu fyi n ɓo. Wo ɓə gbmi n Saipwurus nu, wo ɓə dna n aza n ɓa ɓə zhni amwutuyi kpmisnui.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus Urishelima sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />She yi ɓə si Urishelima, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai ɓa gwo yi n agbmadai, <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, Bwulus ɓədo n əyii vnyanya, ya lo yii gye Jemyis, jesnu abyeda vnyanya ɓə fyi n abaayi. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bwulus wa ɓyigna nlonu wa wu ɓa alafyiya n nu aɓwokwnu nunui, aɓo n Shekwoyi ɓəə kwu zhni fyi n Abyedo atasni ntu əwo ɓəvyitnutnu ɓo.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />She ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye, ɓa ci Shekwoyi. Nlonu ɓa gna Bwulus: “Əyido, ho gyewye lo she Ayahudiyi bəgyé ɓa kwu gaiciyaga jesnu əɓa vnyanya ɓa n wyenyii lo ntu owa ɓwashi ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />A ɓəə kwu gna ɓa ge, ho wunya lo nge Ayahudiyi vnyanya n ɓa fyi n Abyedo atasni nyi, ɓa la pmyiya n Mwusa owa ɓwashi, hoi gna ɓa ge, ɓa to je əɓa aɓyi nyaznu m, kwo ɓa gyianyì vyi əyi azakwoyi kwnunu m. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Yi ɓa zhni n wunanu a? Ɓəhnihni ɓa ɓá wo nge ho la ɓe, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />ntulonu, zhni əɓo, n ya gna ho nge ho zhni. Aza lo n kwnusnu n yii ngwnu-anyi n ɓa kwu ana sni. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Kwu aza ye, ha dnaɓwado n ɓai n kwnunu pmyapmya nya, jesnu ha gba əɓa gyiwye, nabai a wnu ɓa tukwo. Nlonu əzahozahoyi ɓa kpé nge gaiciyanunui to lo, n alafyiya n a kwu wu n əho ɓo nyi m, ama nge ho shi owa gbetu əɓwa lo. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ama ntu avyiyi Abyedo ɓo, yi kwu əyi bwugbadna əpa ka ga ɓa nge ɓa kwu fa ashna nyagyi gyi ɓo, n amisnii n abwui anyakpa nyai, n a pmyi ɓa bəgye nyi jesnu n asisiɓozhnii.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, Bwulus wa kwu aza yi, wa pmya əwohni n kwnusnu n ɓai. Nlonu wa lodna n Dagayipwuwa ntuge woo shì nyipyei n pmyapmya kwnunu ɓə zo ncei, jesnu n nyagai n a ɓə ga ntu əzahozahoyi ɓo n ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A lá Bwulus wna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />She anyipyei tnaaba ɓəə kwu ga zo, Ayahudiyi ho ɓai kwnu n Asiya əknyi, ɓa gye Bwulus dna n Dagayipwuwa. Ɓa kwu deeji vnyanya abwugbakala zhi, ɓa wna wo, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />ɓai ɓəwyi, “Əyi Aisrailayi aje, fye bma yi zhni! Əza nu nyi n wo wunya lo n zahozahoyi aba, jesnu n ɓwahoɓwahoi, tu n əyi aza tukwo, n əyi owai ɓədo n əyi aba yei. Gbowo n dəyei, wo kwu ɓe n Agirikiyii fyi n Dagayipwuwa, ɓanyi lá aba gyigyiyi ye tucegye.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Ntuge ɓa ɓə kwu shni Trofyimwus Afyisuyi wyegye n kwnusnu n Bwulusii dna n əzhiyaakwo, ɓai zhninubwo nge Bwulus ɓəə la loɓe n woi nu n Dagayipwuwa.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Əzhiyaakwo vnyanya kwaa totu gnyi, aza ɓa kwnuɓe n asəpa vnyanya ɓai bwusi. Ɓa wna Bwulus, ɓa gnyì wo, ɓa gbmi wo ya n Dagayipwuwa, nsayisayii ɓa kwu abwokwnumi gwu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ɓai ye ɓa zhnatna ɓa wu wo, Roma akwnuyi okwu bəzheyaakwo, wa wo n liya nge Urishelima əzhiyaakwo vnyanya ɓə nu gnyi ɓai kpmakwu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Wa kwu akwnuyi atukwoda n akwnuyi hoi n əsagbmanyii ɓa bwusi shnilo da deeji n pyepyei. She agyikicizhniyi ɓə gye bəzheyaakwo n əwo akwnuyii, ɓa kwu fa Bwulus lu ɓo.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Bəzheyaakwo wa ɓe wa wna wo, jesnu wa ga əgbe nge a la wo pa n agbmai ngwnu-aba. Nlonu wa nya wo əɓo, əza n wo ɓə zhni, jesnu n əɓoi n wo ɓə zhni. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Azaho fyi n deeji ɓa ɓəwyi əɓo gbmanyi nya, azaje, əɓədo nya, ama shi bəzheyaakwo to ɓə ɓwa gaiciyanunui shi m, ntu akwukpmi ɓo, wa ga əgbe nge a la Bwulus lo ncei n akwnuyi apyiznudna. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />She Bwulus ɓə si apitaknyikpe aba, snunutú agyikicizhniyi nya ɓə mwa, kwa zhni akwnuyi ɓa wo lashi. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Deeji n kwo ɓə vyi wo lo n avnu nyi, ɓa gwodu n wyiɓei, “A du wo əɓo ya!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus daɓo n deejii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Shi akwnuyi ɓə ye ɓa la Bwulus lo ncei dna n akwnuyi apyiznudna, wa nya bəzheyaakwo əɓo, “Sukwu, mi gna ho əɓo ho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho wo Girik əbye? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Əho nu to zhni Masariyi n wo ɓə gnyiapaapa n atukwodai jesnu ha sabye n azaɓwawuyii adugwu ngwnu anyì lo zhabwikawu ncei əsa n kwo la shedna nyi m?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi zhni Yahudiyi nu, mi gbmi n Tarsus nu n Kilikiya, əzhiyaakwo dnagbmai əzhiɓyi. Sukwu fa ma daɓo n hoi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />She bəzheyaakwo ɓə la əsa ga wo, Bwulus wa knyitu n apitaknyikpe aba asnada, wa zhni deeji n aɓwai. She ɓa ɓə kwu cepyi vnyanya, wa daɓo n ɓai n Ibraniyi nyitalai:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Əmi azaje jesnu n adadai, fye kna əmi ɓəgbedna tnubwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />She ɓa ɓə wo woi daɓo n ɓai n Ibraniyi nyitalai; ɓa kwu ce pyipyipyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Nlonu Bwulus wa gna: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Mi zhni Yahudiyi nu, a ɓə ma mi dna n Tarsus nu n Kilikiya əknyi, ama mi ɓə mwa dna n əzhiyaakwo ye nu. Mi ɓə banya dna n Gamaliya akwnu nu njesnu a ɓə la mi ta n ɓyiɓyiyi dna n əyi azakwoyi owa. Mi ɓə n əwyei nyinyíi n Shekwoyi əɓo n ɓwasnu ngye zahozahoyi nu n fye n naiye. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mii she aza wyena n ɓa wna Zokwo ye kwoi lo n ɓai n əfyi, mii wna azanugbai n anyikwozai mii sheɓaya fyi n zhalu, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />ngye shi pirisiti dnagbmai n abwokwnudai vnyanya n əɓahni tukwo, n ɓa ɓá gbmiɓo. Kwo n əɓa aba nu n mi ɓə gwo paka n əɓa akwnu, ma lo aza ncei n ɓa n gaiciyai kwnu ga fyi n Damaskwos, jesnu mi ɓə lo abaayi nabai mi ɓe n aza yei nu ngye aza-wnawnayi fyi n Urishelima nabai a ga ɓa tata.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“N nyipyei atukwogwnu əsai, shi mi ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Damaskwosii, n əsagbmanyii bwuznagna kwoi gbmi n əshemi kwa bmyana fyi mi n shegwnu mi. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ma myiya shi n əknyi, ma wo bəgye kwoi gna mi, ‘Soolu! Soolu! Knyiyi nu zhni hoi she mi əwyena a?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />“Ma nyaɓo, ‘Nyika nu n hoi a, Dagayi?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əmi nu Yeisu Nazeretiyi, əza n ho gnyi hoi she wo əwyena nyi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />“Aza n mi ɓə kwnu znazna n ɓai nyi, ɓa kwu bwuznagna gyewye, ama to ɓa kpe əza bəgye ɓəgənyi n wo ɓə gnyi woi daɓo n mii nyi m.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />“Ma nyaɓo, ‘Dagayi, knyiyi nu n mi ɓa zhni a?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">“Dagayi wa gna, ‘Laka ha lodna n Damaskwos. N abaayi nu n a ɓə gna ho aɓo vnyanya n a cei mwuzhi ho lo, ha zhni.’<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />“Aza n mi ɓə kwnu znazna n ɓai nyi, ɓa shi mi əɓwa ya lofyi n Damaskwos, ntuge bwuznagna palilii ɓə kwu mi bwawye.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Əza n a ɓə yi wo ge Ananiyasi, wa ɓe wa gye mi əwye. Wo ɓəi zhni ɓəfyeceyi nu n əwyei nyinyíi n owa ɓwashi, jesnu Ayahudiyi vnyanya n ɓa ɓə fyi n əzhi yi, ɓai kpe wo ye, ɓai gbmiɓo manai tu n wo tukwo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Wa gnyiagnyi ma əmi wa gna, ‘Soolu, əmizado, gwo əho wyebagye.’ Nsayisayii ma myi ma gye əwo əwye.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />“Nlonu wa gna, ‘Shekwoyi əyi azakwoyi nya wo la ho knyi, ha kpe əwo ɓəmwi əye, jesnu ha gye Əwo Ɓəfyecezhniyi əwye, jesnu ha wo əwo aɓədagbma n əwo əgbe. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ho ɓaa zè əwo ɓəgbmiyi ga aza vnyanya; əɓo n ho kwu gyewye jesnu hoi wo. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />To, ho gnyi hoi pmi knyiyi nu nsaiye a? Laka gnyi, a zhni ho batizima, a zhna ho aleifyi ya, shi ho yi əwo əye.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“She mi ɓə jezeɓe Urishelima jesnu mii zhniaduwa dna n Dagayipwuwa, ma ɓwa ɓəwyegye <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />ma gye Dagayi woi daɓo n mii. Wa gna, ‘N pye, fa Urishelima nsaisaiye, ntuge aza n ɓa fyi n ya nyi, ɓa taa gwo əho ɓəgbmi ntu əmi ɓo m.’<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />“Ma dnaɓəgbe, ‘Dagayi, aza ye kpəlo nge mi ɓə zhni mii vyi Ayahudiyibwokwnu gbmanyigbmanyi, mii wna aza yi fyi n zhalu jesnu mii lu ɓa, n ɓa kwu gaiciyaga ho nyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Njesnu she a ɓə zè Istifanus ami ya, n wo ɓə fyí ntu ho əɓo nyi, mi ɓə gnyi n abaayi n əɓwai tu nce, jesnu mii shi aza yi aje awye n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai wu wo nyi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Nlonu Dagayi wa gna mi, ‘Lo, ntuge mi ɓa tnu n hoi n aba akpamwai, lo da Abyedo.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus Roma əknyiɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Deeji kwa kna Bwulus ɓəda tnubwa nya əsa wo ɓə kwu əɓo ye zo da. Nlonu ɓa kwu əɓa abəgye wu njesnu ɓa ɓəwyi, “A la əza ye gbmiya n anyi! Wo to kwnuce lo wo ye gyianyì m!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Shi ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai ɓəwyi, ɓai kpma əɓa aje ayaakwo ya, jesnu ɓai she amwi gwnu n əshe, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Bəzheyaakwo wa ga əgbe nge a la Bwulus la lo ncei n akwnuyi apyiznudna. Wa gagbe nge a kwu wo lu jesnu a nya wo aɓo nyanya nabai a kpe əɓo n kwo zhni aza ɓai ɓəwyi ntu əwo ɓo nlai. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Shi ɓa ɓə tawoya shi ɓa ɓyewoya, Bwulus wa gna bəzheyaakwo n wo ɓə gnyiagnyi gnyi n abaayi nyi, “Owa ncei ye lo nge fye ɓye Romayi əknyiɓyi ya, kwo to ai wna wo n ɓəgyii m?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Shi Roma begyiyi ɓə wo dəye, wa lo da bəzheyaakwo wa wu wo kwo lafyiya. Wa nyaɓo, “Ho ye ha zhni knyiyi nu a, əza ye zhni Roma əknyiɓyi nu.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Bəzheyaakwo wa lo da Bwulus, wa nyaɓo, “Gna mi, ho zhni Roma əknyiɓyi nu?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 22:27">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə, mi zhni əkwo nu.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Nlonu bəzheyaakwo wa gna, “Əmihnii da ɓə gba agyiwye yaakwo nu ma kpe Roma əknyiɓyi zhni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Bwulus wa gna, “Ama əmihnii da a ɓə ma mi dna n Roma əknyi nu.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə ye ɓa nya wo aɓo nyanya nyi, ɓaa əɓa aɓwakwnu n əsagbmanyii. Bəzheyaakwo n əwohni tukwo, ədna kwa wo wo she wo ɓə kpe nge wo kwu Bwulus fyiagbma n wo zhni Roma əknyiɓyi nyi.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus gnyi n Sahindiri abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Bəzheyaakwo ɓə n cei pma wa kpe əɓo hnihnii ye n kwo snusnu Ayahudiyi ɓai ma Bwulus aɓo. Nlonu əfye kwa gyi zhi waa wo loya jesnu wa tnu apirisiti atukwoda ɓo n azai vnyanya n ɓa fyi n Sahindiri nge ɓa yezhi. Nlonu wa lo ɓe n Bwulusii, waa wo gnyi n əɓa abye.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bwulus, wa ce Asahindirida əwye cewo, wa gna, “Əmi azaje, mi kwu əmi Shekwoyi tnutnu zozhni n nunui dna n tukwovnyi manai nya n naiye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ntu dəye da ɓo, pirisiti dnagbmai, Ananiyasi wa ga aza yi əgbe n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi ma Bwulus nyi, nge ɓa znu wo əgbe ənya. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Nlonu, Bwulus wa gna wo, “Shekwoyi ɓa znu ho ənya, əho kwocednayi! Ho sasetu n abaayi hoi znu əɓo ya tu mi ngye shi owa ncei tu, dudulonu əho n əhohni tukwo, ho la owa znugna she ha ga əgbe nge a la mi znu əgbe nya!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi vyivyiwyi n Bwulusii, ɓa gna, “Ho zhni nyika nu, hoi knyi Shekwoyi pirisiti dnagbmai akpmi a?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmi azaje, mi to ɓəə kpe nge wo zhni pirisiti dnagbmai nu m; ntuge kwo kafyilo: ‘To da ɓəda nukwoi tu n əfye əbegyiyi tukwo m.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nlonu, Bwulus woi kpe nge azaho n ɓa, ɓa ɓə zhni Asadusiyi nu, jesnu azaje Afarisiyi, wa sawyidna n Sahindiri wa gna, “Əmi Azaje, mi zhni Farisiyi nu, mi gbmi n Afarisiyi ofye nu. A da owa n mii ntu əmi awyetu əfyikalakwu nya ɓo nu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />She wo ɓə da dəye, aɓənakpeaje kwa laka dna n Afarisiyi atasni n Asadusiyii, nlonu azadogwnu ɓaa gnajeya. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Asadusiyi gna nge əfyikalakwu to lo m, jesnu n amaləkai n azafnui m, ama Afarisiyi ɓa n gaiciyai ga n aɓo ye vnyanya.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Wyina yaakwo kwa laka gnyi, jesnu azaho n owa anyawuyi, n ɓa ɓə zhni Afarisiyi, ɓa kwukazhi agnyi ɓa naɓo n əwyei bmyibmyii. Ɓa gna, “Yi too gye əɓo nukwoi ho n əza ye aba m. Ngye zafnu nu, kwo maləka nu, naa daɓo n woi ma a?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Aɓənakpeaje kwa gna nazhizhi, ngye ɓa ɓaa Bwulus saya wyiwowyiwo, kwa zhni ədna kwa wo bəzheyaakwo. Wa ga əgbe nge akwnuyi ɓa shnilo ɓə fna wo n əɓa akwnu, n akalái, jesnu ɓa ɓə n woi n akwnuyi apyiznudna.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Dna n sukwo n kwo ɓə yatu nyi, Dagayi wa gnyiagnyi gnyi vyivyiwyi n Bwulusii wa gna, “La bwugba dnakalá! Shi ho la əɓo gbmi n əmi ɓo, n dna n Urishelima nyi, nlonu ɓəshishi nu n ho ɓə gbmi əmi ɓo ce, dna n Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwúlupa nabai a wu Bwulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, Ayahudiyi ho ɓa kwu kwúlupa, jesnu ɓa kwu nyasi si nge ɓa taa gyi nyagyi kwo ɓa sni nyaho m, akpəge ɓa lá Bwulus wu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ɓa ɓə du azanugbai shiinyi ya, n ɓa ɓə n aɓwai fyi n kwúlupa ye. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ɓa lo da apirisiti atukwoda ɓədo n abyedai ɓa gna, “Yi kwu nyasi si, n ədnaidna, nge yi taa gyi nyagyi m akpəge yi la Bwulus wu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />To, nsaiye, əfye n Sahindiri yi, fye ka paka ɓətu nya ga bəzheyaakwo, woi ɓe n woi n əfye abye n wu ngye fye ncei pmalo fya ɓwa aɓo akpokəloi nu shi, ntu ɓəda ye ɓo. Yi n əyihnii yeyei lo yii la wo wu to woi si n ya m.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ama she Bwulus mapwii nugwnu ɓə gnyi woi wo əɓa kwúlupa ye, wa bwusi lo akwnuyi apyiznudna wa kwu kwo gna Bwulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Nlonu Bwulus wa yì okwnu tukwoda ho wa gna, “La əɓyikasa ye lo ncei n bəzheyaakwo aba: wo n ɓəhoi lo wa gna wo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ntulonu wa la wo, wa lo n woi n bəzheyaakwo aba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Bəzheyaakwo wa gna, “Bwulus zhaluda, nu naa tnu mi əɓo, wonyi gna mi ge mi ɓə n əɓyikasa yei n əho aba, ntuge wo n ɓəhoi lo wa gna ho.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Bəzheyaakwo wa taɓwashi wo, waa wo pmyignyi n gnagna, wa nya wo əɓo, “Knyi əɓoi nu n ho ye ha gna mi a?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Wa gna, “Ayahudiyi ho ɓa kwu əgbe lodo ɓa nyaɓo nge ho ɓəə ɓe n Bwulusii n Sahindiri abye nsu, ɓai zhni ngye ɓa ye ɓa ɓwa aɓo akpokəloi nu shi dəidəi ntu əwo ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />To ɓə ye m, ntuge aza n du shiinyi ya n ɓa, n ɓwufyi lo, ɓai pmi wo, ntuge ɓai wu wo. Ɓa kwu nyasi si nge ɓa ta gyi nyagyi kwo ɓa sni nyaho m, sai ɓa la wo wu. Ɓa n əɓahnii kwukwui lo, ɓa zhi ɓai pmi əɓa ɓənya ɓəgbedna nu, n əho aba.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Bəzheyaakwo wa gna əɓyikasa yi ami n ɓəkpma yei: “To gna əzahozahoyi nge ho kwu lafyiya ye wu mi m.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Bwulus shnaba lo ncei n Kaisariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Nlonu wa yì əwo abəzhetagyida ngwnu-aba jesnu wa ga ɓa əgbe, “Fye kwu əfyehni kwuu nsayisayi, fya kwu bəzhetagyida ngwnu-aba, adokwo gwnuyi shiitnaaba jesnu n amashidai tagyi ngwnu-aba, fya lo Kaisariya n snukna ciwagbmanyii dna n sukwo ye. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Fye la adokwo vyi ɓo ga Bwulus nabai n a ɓa la wo lo Gwomna Fyelisi aba ncei dna n aknawna.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Wa ka paka shnilo ncei nlai:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Kwo gbmi n Klaudus Lisiyas aba nu,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Kwoi lo da Gwomna Manai, Fyelisi:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Amisa.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Ayahudiyii nu ɓə wna əza ye, jesnu ɓa ɓə ye ɓa wu wo nu, ama ma ɓe n əmi akwnuyii, ma gnyi wo, ntuge mi ɓə kwu wo nge wo zhni Roma əknyiɓyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Mi ɓə ncei pma ma kpe əɓo əye n kwo ɓə zhni ɓai kpe wo aɓo, ntucenu mii ɓe n woi n əɓa Sahindiri aba. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Əɓo n ma ɓe mi kpeye, əkwo nu nge, aɓəma ye laka ntu aɓonya ho nu, əɓa owa nya, ama əɓo kpokəlo ho to lo, n kwo kwnuce n əfyii kwo gwugwudna m. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />She a wu mi lafyiya kwúlupa tu n əza ye tukwo nabai a wna wo, minyi tnu n woi n əho aba n əsagbmanyii. Mi kwu gna əwo aɓəmai ce nge ɓa ɓe ɓa da aɓo n ɓa kpe wo nyi.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ntulonu akwnuyi ɓai vyi ɓəgbetu, ɓa la Bwulus dna n sukwoi n kwnusnu n ɓai, ɓa ɓe n woi ɓa kwu si Antipatis. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi ɓa fa akwnuyi adokwoda, ɓa la wo lo ncei, aza n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, ɓa jezezhi akwnuyi apyiznudna. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />She akwnuyi adokwoda ɓə si Kaisariya, ɓa ga gwomna paka jesnu ɓaa Bwulus ga əwo. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Gwomna wa ba paka, wa nyaɓo, əknyisəpa n wo gbmi. She wo ɓə wo nge wo gbmi n Kilikiya nu, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />wa gna, “Mi ɓə kna əho ɓəda tnubwa, əsa n əho aɓokpeyi ɓə kwu si n ya.” Nlonu wa ga əgbe nge a la Bwulus gwudna n Hiridusu galukwo abagwuyi akwnu.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Owada n Bwulusii dna n Fyelisi bwokwnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />N anyipyei ngwnu-atnu avnu, pirisiti dnagbmai Ananiyasi, wa shnilo Kaisariya n abyeda hoi ɓədo n owayekpeyii, ai yi wo ge Tatullus, ɓa ɓe n əɓa aɓəmai kpe Bwulus n gwomna abye. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />She a ɓə yi Bwulus ɓe ncei n əmi, Tatullus wa da əwo ɓəda tu n Bwulus tukwo n gnyi n Fyelisi abye, “Yi kwu mwasa yii sase fyi n bwugbafu dna n əho begyisa, əho ɓəwyegye n kpaai, kwo la ɓe yi n aɓəzhnizhii n əknyi ye. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />O Fyelisi əza duduyi! N ɓwahoɓwahoi jesnu n zokwo dəhodəhoi, yi kwu əho aɓəzhnizhi ye gyewye, jesnu a da yi lo n mwa zam. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama nabai to ma gna ho gnagna lo abye m, mi ɓa ɓa, nge ho ɓwabwugba n yii, ha kna yi tnubwa əsa cewyi.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />“Yi la əza ye wna woi zhni aɓogala, woi ma agyikici dna n Ayahudiyi atasni dna n anyì vnyanya. Əwo nu zhni gyikicizhni tukwoda, Anazereniyi okwu nya; <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />wo ɓə zhniatna wa tu Dagayipwuwa cegye; ntulonu ya wna wo jesnu [yi ɓə ɓaa owa znuya tu n əwo, shi əyi owa lo.] <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ama bəzheyaakwo Lisiyas, wa ɓe wa fna wo n əyi akwnu n akalái, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />wa ga əwo aɓəmayi gbetu nge ɓa ɓe əho aba. Əsa n ha nya wo aɓo fnyinyifnyinyi n əhohni tukwoi, ho ɓa ɓwa gaiciyanunui aɓo ye nya vnyanya n yi ɓe ncei kpe n əwo tukwo nyi.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Ayahudiyi aje ɓa tu aɓəma ye bwokwnu, ɓai gbmiɓo nge aɓo ye zhni gaiciya nu.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />She gwomna ɓə ga wo aba nge wo daɓo, Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe: “Mi kpəlo nge əsa la mwa, she ho ɓə ya owada dna n əknyi ye; ntulonu agbmada mi lo ma dnaɓəgbe əɓa aɓəma nya. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ho ɓa myi ha nyaɓo ntna ɓədnai, ha wo nge anyipyei too du awoceaba ya, she mi ɓe gwnulo Urishelima mi ga mwamwa m. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Əmi aɓəmayi to ɓə gye mi gnyi mii naɓo n zahozahoyi dna n Dagayipwuwa, kwo mii fyi deeji abwugba aɓwaya dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu kwo gnyi n ɓwahoɓwahoi dna n əzhiyaakwo m. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Njesnu ɓa ta myi ɓa gbmiɓo ɓe ncei pəipəi, n ɓa gnyi ɓai kpe mi nyi, nge gaiciya nu m. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Dudulonu, mi la ye nge mi ga Shekwoyi əyi azakwoyi nya mwamwa lo ngye shi mi vyi Zokwo nyi, ədo n ɓa yi nge okwu. Mi n gaiciyai ga lo n nyahonyahoi n kwo vyi Owa jesnu n adoi ń ɓa kafyilo n Sheaɓəgwognayi, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />jesnu mi n awyetu gbmanyigbmanyii nu lo n Shekwoyi, shi aza ye ncei lo nyi, nge əfyikalakwu lo ntu aɓəfyeceyi ɓo n akpizhniyii. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ntulonu mi snukwnú ciici maa əmihni tukwovnyi shi n tna-ɓogyi n Shekwoyi abye ɓədo n zanyikwocii.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“She mi ɓə la Urishelima fa aye bəgyé, ma ɓe əmi aza n anyagai ntu awyekwoyi ɓo jesnu ma ga Shekwoyi anyaga. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mi ɓə gyigyii shi kwnunu ncei tu; she ɓa ɓə gye mi n dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, mii pwo pmyapmya kwnunu kwu ɓo. Deeji to ɓə zhi n mii; kwo nge mi ɓə n əɓwai dna n gyikici m. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ama Ayahudiyi ho lo, ɓai kwnu n Asiya əknyi, kwo ɓə gwo, ɓa ye zhi lo n ya, n əho abye, nabai ɓa daɓo, ngye ɓa n ɓəhoi lo tu n əmi tukwo. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kwo aza ye n ɓa zhi n ya nyi; akpəge ɓa da ɓəkasa n ɓa ɓə ɓwa mi ncei, əsa n mi ɓə gnyiagnyi gnyi n Sahindiri abye nyi; <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />akpəge ɓəda ye nu gbmanyi, n mi ɓə ɓəwyi, əsa n mi ɓə gnyi ncei n əɓa abye: ‘Ntu afyífyiyi kalakwu ɓo nu n mi gnyi ai da mi owa n naiye n əho abye.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Nlonu Fyelisi, n wo ɓə kpe Zokwo ye, aɓo əye dəidəi nyi, waa owa kwu zhi. Wa gna, “Əsa n Lisiyas, bəzheyaakwo ɓə ɓe, mi ɓə znu əho ɓəda ya.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Wa ga bəzhetagyida əgbe nge a la Bwulus dna n abagwuyi akwnu, ama a la əsnuya-aba ga wo jesnu ɓa ye nge əwo anugwnudo ɓa vyi wo əɓo.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />N anyipyei bəgyé avnu, Fyelisi wa ɓe ɓədo n əwo nyikwoi Durosila, n wo ɓə zhni Yahudiyi nu nyi. Wa tnu Bwulus ɓo, nlonu wa kna wo tnubwa, she wo ɓə daɓo ntu gaiciyaganunui ɓo dna n Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Shi Bwulus ɓə daɓo ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo, əza əwohni wnashi ɓədo n owadai n kwo ɓe lo n abye nyi, ədna kwa wo Fyelisi jesnu wa gna, “Kwo la kwnu lonu nsaiye! Ho ɓa myi ha fa aba ye. Əsa n ma gye kwo bmya, ma tnu ho əɓo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Dna n əsa ye, wo ɓə gnyi woi tu əwye nge Bwulus ɓa ga wo gbebyi nu, ntulonu waa gnyi woi tnu wo əɓo ciici woi daɓo n woi.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />She aye ngwnu-aba ɓə la duya, Pwosiwus Fyesitus wa gyibe tu Fyelisi, ama ntuge Fyelisi ɓə ye wa ga Ayahudiyi bmyashi nu, waa Bwulus fa dna n zhalu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Owada n Bwulusii gnyi n Fyesitus abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />N anyipyei ngwnu-ata avnu, shi wo ɓə si əknyi yi, Fyesitus wa gbmi n Kaisariya wa gwnulo Urishelima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />aba n apirisiti atukwoda n Ayahudiyi abyedai ɓə kpmiyazhi n əwo abye, ntuge ɓa ɓe n aɓəmai kpe n Bwulus tukwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Ɓa gyiwye n Fyesitus aba, nabai wa wu ɓa bmyashi, a shna Bwulus aba lo ncei n Urishelima, ntuge ɓa ɓə gnyi ɓai ye əɓahni aza nu ɓa kwu ɓwufyi n abwugizhi, ɓai wu wo woi lo n zokwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fyesitus wa dnaɓəgbe, “A n Bwulusii shi dnalo n Kaisariya nu, jesnu əsa taa mwa m, əmihni gnyi mii lo n ɓo nu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Fa azaho n fye abyeda, ɓa kwnu ɓe n mii, ngye əza yi n kwu əɓo nukwoi ho zhni, ɓa lo ɓə kpe wo aɓəyi dna n abaayi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Shi Fyesitus ɓə ɓwa anyipyei ngwnu-nyimwanyimwa ɓai lo ngwnu-awo dna n kwnusnu n ɓai, wa shnilo Kaisariya. Əfye kwa gyi zhi, wa yì aza fyi n bwokwnu jesnu wa ga əgbe nge a gbmiɓe n Bwulusii n əwo abye. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />She Bwulus ɓə lodna, Ayahudiyi n ɓa ɓə kwnu shnizhi n Urishelima nyi, ɓa kwukazhi n shé wo gwnu. Ɓa kpe wo aɓo ashnawoi ama to ɓa myi ɓa ɓe n aɓəkwnuyii m.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Nlonu Bwulus wa da əwohni aɓəmaɓəgbedna: “Mi too zhni ɓəho abwi nya m, kwo n gbmiya n Ayahudiyi owa, kwo tu n Dagayipwuwa, kwo tu n Kaisa tukwo m.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fyesitus, nabai wa myi wa wu Ayahudiyi bmyashi, wa gna Bwulus, “Ho ɓa ye ha gwnulo Urishelima a da ho owa gnyi n əmi abye n ɓwaayi ntu aɓo dəye tukwo?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nsaiye mi gnyagnyi gnyi n Kaisa owa bwokwnu nu, aba n kwo kwnuce a da mi owa. Mi too zhni Ayahudiyi əɓo nukwoi ho m, shi əho n hohni ho kpe ce əye lo dəidəi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ngye a ɓə la mi wna nu n ɓəgyi nukwoi hoi, n kwo kwnuce lo n əfyii, mi to ɓə wo əfyi ɓyi m. Ama ngye aɓo n Ayahudiyi yekpe n mi nyi, n a to gye gaiciya dna n ɓa m, əzaho to n ikwoi lo, wa ya mi dna n əɓa akwnu m. Əmi aɓwatna lo da Kaisa nu!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Shi Fyesitus ɓə kwu sà n əwo abwokwnudai, wa gna: “Ho kwu ɓwuci ga Kaisa. Kaisa aba nu n ho ɓa lo!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fyesitus zna zokwofye shni n əsu Agiripa aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />She anyipyei fyewyi ɓə duya, Əsu Agiripa n Byenisii ɓa ɓe Kaisariya, nabai ɓa ga Fyesitus amisa mwamwaga nya. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Shikwonyi ɓa ɓə ye ɓa ɓwa anyipyei bəgyé nu fyi n abaayi nyi, Fyesitus wa da Bwulus owa ɓo n əsui. Wa gna: “Əza dnalo n ya, n Fyelisi ɓə la wo fa dna n zhalu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Shi mi ɓə lo Urishelima, apirisiti tukwoda ɓədo n Ayahudiyi abyedai, ɓa ɓe n aɓoi kpe n wo jesnu ɓa ɓà nge a la wo znuknyi.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />“Ma gna ɓa nge Aromayi kwnunu nu to a ga əza dna n əwo aɓəkpeyi akwnu, to ai ga əza aba wa gnyi əwohni ń aɓo, n a cei kpe wo nyi m. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Shi ɓa ɓə ɓe n ya n kwnusnu n mii, mi to ɓə zhni kalala n ɓəda yei m, ama əfye kwa gyi zhi, ma yi abwokwnuda jesnu ma ga əgbe nge a duɓe n əza yii. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />She əwo aɓəmayi ɓə kwukala zhi ɓa daɓo, ɓa to ɓə ɓe n ɓəkasa hoi tu n wo, she mi ɓə n əwyei tu nyi m. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />N əkwoɓwi, ɓaa n ɓəhoi nu shi lo, aɓənakpeaje nya n woi, ntu əɓa kwnunu ɓo jesnu ntu əzaho ɓo n a ɓə zhni ai yi ge Yeisu, əza n wo ɓə la fyí, ama n Bwulus gna nge wo ye n wyewyeyi lo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kwo ɓə kwu mi gbmiaje, she mi ɓə ɓa pmi aɓo ye pya gye; ntulonu ma nyaɓo kwo n wo ɓa ye wa lo Urishelima, a lo ə da wo owa dna n əɓo ntu aɓəma ye ɓo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ama she Bwulus ɓə tnaɓwa nge a lo n woi n Agwotusu aba nu, wo znu ɓəda ya, ma ga əgbe nge a la wo gwudna, nya əsa n mi ɓə myi ma tnu n woi n Kaisa aba.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Nlonu Agiripa wa gna Fyesitus, “Mi ɓa ye ma wo əza ye ɓəda n əmihni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nsu ho ɓei kna wo tnubwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus gnyi n Agiripa abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi, Agiripa n Byenisii ɓa ɓe owa bwokwnu n mwamwa yaakwoi kpe jesnu ɓa lofyi n akwnuyi azayaakwoi, ɓədo n azayaakwoi əzhiyaakwo nya. She Fyesitus ɓə ga əgbe, a duɓe n Bwulusii. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fyesitus wa gna: “Əsu Agiripa, n azai vnyanya n ɓa fyilo n ya n kwnusnu n yii, fye gye əza ye əwye lo! Ayahudiyi əzhi vnyanya ɓa kwu ənya ka, aɓəma nya, ga mi ntu əwo ɓo n Urishelima jesnu dna n Kaisariya n ya, ɓai ɓəwyi nge; kwo to gwo əza ye wo ye je anyìgyi n shnasnu m. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mi to ɓwa ɓəho shi ń wa zhni, n kwo kwnuce lo n əfyii m, ama ntuge wo la lo n ɓwucii n Kaisa aba, mi la bwugbadna ma tnu n woi n Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ama mi to n nyaho kpokəloi lo, n mi ɓa ka ga Əza Duduyi ntu əwo ɓo m. Ntucenu mi la ɓe n woi n əfye aba vnyanya, N shnisnusnu n əho aba Əsu Agiripa, nabai aɓo n ɓa ɓá kwnuɓe n aɓo nyanya nyi, n mi ɓa ɓwa ɓəho ma ka ənya tu n wo tukwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ntuge mi zhninubwo ge, kwo to n apmai lo ma tnu n zhaludai lo Roma ncei ntna aɓo akwnuwui n a cei kpe n wo tukwo m.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Nlonu Agiripa wa gna Bwulus, “A la aba ga ho ha daɓo ga əhohni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Ntulonu Bwulus, wa ta əɓwa ya wu, wa da əwohni ɓəda: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Əsu Agiripa, mi gye kwo n mii zhni əɓo manai nu ma gnyagnyi gnyi n əho abye n naiye ma dna Ayahudiyi aɓəmaɓəgbe vnyanya n ɓa ncei kpe mi nyi, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />n shnisnusnu ntuge ho kpe Ayahudiyi akwnunu aɓo əye lo vnyanya ɓədo n əɓa aɓəshefyiajei. Ntucenu, mi ɓa ho lo, ha kna mi tnubwa pəceye.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Ayahudiyi vnyanya ɓa kpəlo she mi ɓə shni anyì gyigyi n wu; ənya n kwo ɓə laka mii ye zhni əɓyicewyi, n əmi anyìgyi yayasa, mii ye dna n əmihni əknyi, jesnu dna n Urishelima cè. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Əsa la mwa she ɓa ɓə kpe əmi əye, jesnu ngye ɓa ncei pmalo ɓa gbmiɓo, nge mi ɓə la vyi okwu, toge n əzawyenyigbma nyai m, dna n əyi kwnunu, mii gyianyì n zhni Farisiyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nsaiye ntu əmi awyetu ɓo nu; əɓo n Shekwoyi ɓə la shi əyi azakwoyi əgbe nyi, n a da owa n mii n naiye. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Dəye nu zhni ɓəgbeshi n əyi abye ngwnu-awoceaba zhi n awyetui, she ɓa zhni Shekwoyi tnutnu n əwyei bmyibmyi; n nyipyei ɓədo n sukwoi. Əsu Agiripa, n tukwoi tu n awyetu ye ɓo nu, n Ayahudiyi ye zhi ɓai kpe mi aɓo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Knyiyi nu ɓa zhni əzaho n fye wa dnabwugba nge kwo zhni əɓo ɓədnai nu Shekwoyi woi kwu afyífyiyi kala a?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Əmihni ce, kwo ɓə la mi kwnuawye nge kwo ɓə bmya ma zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi shi mi ɓə ɓá myi ma gnyiapaapa n Yeisu Nazeretiyi əyei. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Njesnu əɓo ye nu ɓwasnu n mi ɓə dna mii zhni dna n Urishelima. N apirisiti tukwoda ikwoi nu n mi ɓə fyi Dagayi aza bəgyé n zhalu, jesnu əsa n a ɓə wu ɓa, mi ɓə la ɓwa gbmitu n ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Asa n mwa bəgyé n mi ɓə zhni mii vyi Ayahudiyibwokwnu ma zhni a ga ɓa tata, jesnu ma zhniatna nabai ma tu ɓa kalá ɓa da atukwopmi ɓəda. Əɓa wyenashe ɓó ɓə n mii zhni agbmada ɓo nu, kwa zhni ma vyi ɓa lo azhiyaakwo n aknyi ajei ma wna ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“N wyihoi, mi ɓəə gnyi mii lo Damaskwos n ikwoi shi ɓədo n tnutnugbegyii apirisiti tukwoda nya. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Əsu Agiripa, ngye n nyipyei atukwogwnui, əsa n mi ɓə dnalo ncei n zokwo, ma gye bwuznagna kwoi kwnu n əshemi n du nyipyei n fnafna, kwoi knaya n shegwnu mi ɓədo n əmi azna-kwnuznayii. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Əyi vnyanya ya myiya zhi n əknyi, jesnu ma wo bəgye kwoi gna mi n Ibraniyi nyitalai, ‘Soolu, Soolu, knyiyi nu zhni hoi shé mi əwyena a? Kwo dnaɓo lo ha gnyiapaapa n ho ədoduyii.’<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Nlonu ma nyaɓo, ‘Nyika nu n hoi a, Dagayi?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">“Dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əmi nu Yeisu, əza n ho gnyi hoi shé wo əwyena nyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nsaiye, laka gnyagnyi. Mi la kpeya da ho jesnu mi la ho knyi n zhni ɓəgbmiyi; əɓo nya n ho kwu gyewye nyi jesnu n ho ɓa gyewye n mi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mi ɓa gnyi ho n əho aza akwnu, ɓədo n Abyedoyii. Mi tnu ho tnutnu lo da ɓa nu <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ha gwu ɓa awye ya, ha kwnu ɓa n wyegbma lo bwuznagna aba, jesnu ha kwnu ɓa n Shetam kalá lo da Shekwoyi, nabai n ɓa ɓá myi ɓa gwo aleifyi abwizo, jesnu a kwu ɓa fyi n aza yi atasni n a la ɓa pmya n gaiciyaganunui dna n mi.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Əsu Agiripa, ntulonu, mi to ɓə wo əshebemi tnutnu əɓyi m, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Kpmisnuyi ga aza yi n ɓa fyi n Damaskwos, nlonu kwa lo da aza yi n ɓa fyi n Urishelima nyi, kwa lo da Ayahudiyi vnyanya jesnu nlonu kwa lo da Abyedo. Mi ɓə zhni waazi nabai ɓa yeabwi nu ɓa pmyiɓe da Shekwoyi jesnu ɓa wu əɓa abwuye fyi n əɓa aɓəzhni. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Cenu ɓə zhni Ayahudiyii ho ɓa wna mi dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí jesnu ɓa zhnatna ɓa wu mi. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ama Shekwoyi wo kwu mi bmazhni nya n naiye; ntulonu, mi gnyi n ya mii gbmiɓo nu ga azanaawyii ɓədo n azayaakwoi. Mi ta da əɓədo nu n du əɓo n sheaɓəgwognayi ɓə da n Mwusai nge ɓa ɓə zhni nyi m; <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />nge Kirisiti ɓə gyeazhnì, əwo nu ɓə la zhni əza kpmisnuyi n wo ɓa laka n əfyi, woi ɓe n ɓədatnu bwuznagna nyai ga əwo aza ɓədo n Abyedoyii.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Gnyi n aba ye Fyesitus wa znu Bwulus aɓəmaɓəgbe dna ya. Wa sáce wo, “Ho to ye dnalo n əhohni ací m. Əho nyaba yaakwo kwo la ho zè cijeyi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fyesitus əza duduyi, mi to jeaci nu gnyi m, əɓo n mi gnyi mii da nyi, gaiciya nu jesnu n dna n ofye. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Əsu dami lo n aɓo yei, jesnu mi ɓa myi ma daɓo n əgbei yayai ga wo. Ɓəye la mi kwnuawye nge ɓəho to lo, n aɓo ye, n kwo n woi znudna lo m; ntuge a to ɓə zhni kwo ma n gnagna nu m. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Əsu Agiripa, ho n gaiciyai ga lo n sheaɓəgwognayi? Mi kpəlo nge ho ncei ga lo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Nlonu Agiripa wa gna Bwulus, “Ho zhninubwo nge, dna n əsa fyewyi ye, ho ɓa tna mi aɓwa maa zè Kirisitivyiyi?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bwulus wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo əsa fyewyi, kwo kwo la mwasa; mi zhniaduwa ga Shekwoyi lo nge toge əho gbmanyi m, ama aza vnyanya n ɓa kna mi tnubwa lo n naiye, n ɓa ɓá kwu zè ngye əmi ama toge n agbma yei fyi m.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Əsu wa laka gnyi n kwnusnu n gwomnai n Byenisii, n aza yii n ɓa ɓə sase fyi n kwnusnu n ɓai nyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />She ɓa ɓə la kwnu n nyakwnu, ɓa ya ɓəda n ajei. “Əza ye too zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n kwo kwnuce lo n əfyii kwo zhalu m.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiripa wa gna Fyesitus, “Əza ye to ɓə gna nge wo kwu ɓwuci lo Kaisa aba nu m, mi ɓə ɓaa wo loya.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus dna n əya nuwnanya lo Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />She a ɓə la bwugbadna nge yi ɓa lo Italiya n əya nuwnanyai nu, a la Bwulus ɓədo n azhaluda ajei a kwu ɓa yafyi n bəzhetagyida akwnu, ai yi wo ge Jiliyos, n wo ɓə dna n akwnuyi anapyei aknyiknyi kampani nyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Ya lofyi n əya nuwnanya kwoi laka n Adiramyitiyu, kwoi shi kwa lo ayagyiba n ɓa ɓə ma lo n Asiya əknyi shikwogbe nyi, nlonu ya kwnufyi n shikwo. Arisitakwus, Makidoninyayi ɓə kwnusnu n yii, woi gbmi n Tasalonika.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Əfye kwa gyi zhi ya kwnuya zhi n Sidon əknyi; Jiliyos wa kwu abmyazhni Bwulus, wa fa wo wa lo əwo anugwnudo aba nabai ɓa vyi wo ɓo, ɓa ga wo anya n wo n əɓa apmai. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Ya kwuka n ɓo, ya je lofyi n əya nuwnanya, ya duya lo Saipwurus snuta, ntuge ase nukwoi ɓə ci ɓe n əyi awyei. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />She yi ɓəə la pi shikwo ya ma lo vyivyiwyi n Kilikiya əknyii ɓədo n Pamfyiliya nyai, ya sakwnu zhi n Myira dna n Lisiya əknyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Dna n abaayi bəzhetagyida wa gye əya Alekzandariya nya shi n ɓo kwoi lo Itali, wa kwnu yi fyi n kwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Yi ɓə kwu anyipyei ɓwa n mwa bəgyé yii kpəlo n əzna pəceye, jesnu yii gyeazhnì n əya dnai, deca ya kpe Kimdus kpmayi si. She əse kaláda to ɓə ye nge yi wna əyi zokwo shi kwo kwnuce m, ya bmaya lo n Kəreti abmayii n awyei ce n Salmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Ya znazna ma lo n shikwogbei n azhnìi, nlonu ya si aba ai yi ge Ayagyiba Manai, n wo vyivyiwyi n Lasiya əzhimii.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Əsa ɓə la yi wnuya n mwa tu n əzna jesnu əyi əyadna ɓə la pmagnyi n awusəgyi wu, ntuge nsaiye Nyipyei Abwizo nya ɓə la duya. Ntulonu Bwulus wa kwnu ɓa, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Əfye, mi kwu gye nge əzna ye, kwo ye kwa ɓe n awusəgyi nu jesnu kwa ɓe n anya nuwnaɓwi yaakwoi əya nya ɓədo n akayai, jesnu n əyi awyewyeyii ce.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ama bəzhetagyida, ədo n wo ɓə ɓa knà Bwulus ɓəda tnubwa nyi, wa zè wa vyi əyadnayi ɓəwu nu ɓədo n əya dagayii. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Shikwonyi ayagyiba to ɓə bmya n ɓa ɓá zhni vnyinyikwo fyi n ɓo m. Bəgyé ɓa gna yi gwodu ya dna əya nuwnanya lo, n awyetui nge yii si Fonikisi jesnu yii zhni vnyinkwo fyi n ɓo. Dəye ɓə zhni ayagyiba aba nu n kwo ɓə n awyei ce n Kəreti, kwo ɓə n awyei ce n snutakwo-shnikwó n snukwó-shnikwó.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbmaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />She əse snutakwo nya ɓə ya ci pəceye, ɓa gye ɓa la abaɓwa ɓa znazna, ntulonu ɓa lo əyagyi əwnu ya ɓa dna əya lo n Kəreti shikwogbei. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />To əsa kwa mwa m, vnuvnuyaakwo kaláda, n a yi kwo əye ge Snukwó-kpekwóɓwa əse nyi, kwa ci ɓe kwoi kwnu n mwuse. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Agbmaase ɓa wna əya nuwnanya, to ya shna myi n yi vyi əse m; ntulonu ya kwu aɓwa ga, ya wna əzna she kwo ɓə ci lo ncei. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Shi yi ɓə duya n mwuse ɓyiyi snuta n a yi kwo ge Kauda nyi, kwa yi dnaɓo n yi ɓa myi ya kwu əya wyewyeyignyinya wnakna, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />ntulonu ayadnayi ɓa la əya wyewyeyignyinya ɓa yadna n əya dnagbmai. Nlonu ɓa du awnu ya shni n əya nuwnanya snuta n əkwohni nabai aa kwo wnashi n abagbmanyi. Ntuge ədna ɓə wo ɓa nge ɓa ɓá gwnu Siritis mwuse amwi, ɓa lo əya gyinya ya dna n shikwo, ɓa fa kwo kwa vyi əse lo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Agbmaase ɓa wnu əyi əya nuwnanya ya n mwa kwokwo, əfye kwa gyi zhi, ɓa ya akaya kwnu ɓai sheya fyi n nuwna. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Dna n nyipyei taayi, ɓa she əya adosinya ya fyi n nuwna n əɓahni aɓwai. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />She yi to ɓə gye nyipyei əwye kwo akpasi fyi n anyipyei bəgyé m, jesnu agbmaase ɓa gwodu ɓai gna cici, əyi vnyanya ya bwugba kwnuya n əyi pwopwo ɓo.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />She əsa ɓə la mwa to ɓai je nyagyi gyi m, Bwulus wa laka gnyi n əɓa abye wa gna, “Əmi azaje, fye ɓə gna fya əmi ɓəwu gwo nge yi to kwuka n Kəreti m; nlonu nu, n yi ɓə ɓa pwo anya agbmazhni ye n anya nuwnaɓwii. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ama nsaiye mi tna fye əɓwa nge fye kwu abwugba fyiakala, ntuge əzaho wyewyeyi to lo n fye n kwo ɓa ɓwu m, əya nuwnanya nu ɓwasnu n kwo ɓa kwu zhnagbma. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nsu n sukwoi, maləka Shekwoyi nya; əza n mi dna n əwo akwnu nyi jesnu əza n mi zhni əwo tnutnu nyi, wo ɓə ma mi gnyi <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />jesnu wa gnai, ‘To wodna m, Bwulus. Ɓəshishi nu nge ho ɓə gnyiagnyi gnyi n Kaisa abye; jesnu Shekwoyi dna n əwo shebmyashi, wo kwu awyewyeyi vnyanya ga ho n ɓa kwnu znazna n hoi nyi.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ntulonu, əmi azaje, fye kwu abwugba fyiakala, ntuge mi n gaiciyaganunui lo dna n Shekwoyi nge kwo ɓa ɓwazhni she wa gna mi nyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Dudulonu, yi ɓa kwu gwnukpe n amwi n mwuse ho.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əyaɓaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Dna n nyipyei wocei-nyiiyi sukwo, yi ɓə ye lo ai gnyi yi, yii znuduya n Adriya shikwo, ngye dna n sukwo sadù, ayadnayi ɓa kwu kpe nge ɓa kwu wo vyivyiwyi n əknyii. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ɓa mwi nuwna lolo gye, ɓa gye kwo lo apita tagyi ncei kpe shiiba. Əsa fyewyi jesnu, ɓa je mwi ɓa ɓwa əkwo lolo apita shiiciwagbmanyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Yii fyi yii wodna nge yi ɓa shegyi akwuta, ɓa ya ayagyinya fyi n shikwo ngwnu-anyi n avnu, jesnu yii zhniaduwa nge əfye kwo gyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ayadnayi ɓa ye ɓahni nge ɓa bwusi ɓa fa əya nuwnanya, ɓa shni əya wyewyeyignyinya dna n shikwo, ɓai zhni ngye ɓa ye ɓa ya ayagyinya ho fyi n abyeɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Nlonu Bwulus wa gna bəzhetagyida ɓədo n akwnuyii, “Akpəge aza ye ɓa ye ɓa kwu kpefyi n əya nuwnanya ye, fye taa pwo m.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ntulonu akwnuyi ɓa ce awnu ya n ɓa ɓə n əya wyewyeyignyinyai shi nyi jesnu ɓa fa kwo kwa wna əkwo zokwo.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Əfye kwoi ga gyi, Bwulus wa tna ɓa əɓwa əɓa vnyanya nge ɓa gyi nyagyi. Wa gna, “Anyipyei awoceanyi n ɓa la duya nyi, fye fyi ɓe n anyiɓəyeɓwi nu ciici jesnu ntna nyagyi gyii; fye too gyi nyahonyahoi m. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nsaiye mi tna fye əɓwa nge fye kwu nyagyi gyi. Fye n əkwo apmai lo ntuge fya pwo. Əzaho to lo n əfye atasni n wo ɓa ɓwu əwo tukwoyi nuwna m, kwo gbmanyi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Shi wo ɓə da ɓəye, wa knyi biledi jesnu wa sa Shekwoyi ami gnyi n əɓa abye vnyanya. Nlonu wa sa kwo wa ya gyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓwa bwugbakala ɓa gyi nyagyi ce. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Əyi vnyanya n yi ɓə fyi n əya nuwnanya nyi yi ɓə nyi tagyi-aba ncei kpe shiitnaaba cei tnanyi nu (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />She ɓa ɓə kwu nyagyi gyi she ɓa ɓə ncei pma, ɓa ce əya akaya knyiya, ɓa she awyi ya fyi n shikwo.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />She əfyé ɓə gyi zhi, to ɓa kpe aba ye n ɓa zhni m, ama ɓa gye nuwna n pmyima n amwii n ayagyibai, ɓaa kwo dna n bwugba ɓa lo n əya nuwnanyai n amwi yi, n ɓa ɓá myi. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />She ɓa ɓə la ayagyinya ceya, ɓa fa ɓa fyi n shikwo. Njesnu ɓa awnu loya n kwo shi əyazokwo dna nya ɓwa, ɓa kwu əya abye wu n əse ɓwa, ɓa wna əzna lo shikwogbe. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ama əya kwa shegyi n amwi kwaa kpeshì, əkwo abyeɓwa kwa byidna n amwi to kwa shna myi n znaznà m jesnu əya avnu kwaa gnyi kwoi ɓaya ntu anuwnadokwo anyacei sheknyi ɓo.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Akwnuyi ɓa kwu kwúlupa nge ɓa wu azhaluda nabai to ɓa ye əzahozahoyi n ɓa nge wo gbinuwna wa bwusi m. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ama bəzhetagyida ɓə ncei pma wa gnyi Bwulus wyewyeyi, ntucenu to wa ye nge ɓa zhni əɓa kwúlupa əɓo m. Wa ga aza yi əgbe n ɓa ɓə ɓá myi n nuwnagbi, nge ɓa shefyi n nuwna ɓa wna əkpma. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Aza n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, ɓa zhni apma n ashnuwna jijii apatai, kwo kpe n əya nuwnanya apisa. Ń zokwo ye əzahozahoyi wa piyalo əkpma dna n nayida.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus wnakpma tu n Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Shi yi ɓə kwu wnakpma fyi n nayida, ya ɓe ya kpé nge a yi mwuse yi nge Malita nu. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Amalitayi ɓa gwo yi; ɓa wu yi yeye yaakwo n yi to ɓə n əkwo ɓəi dna m. Ɓa fnyi əná zhi jesnu ɓa zhni yi amaabe vnyanya ntuge əgbma ɓə gnyi kwoi zhi jesnu əse ɓə fufui. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bwulus wa wnù ashnuwna azhegbezhegbei zhi, əsa n wo ɓə kpe ɓa əná, gbezhi, she kwo ɓə wo gwugwurugwu, kwa sakwnu ɓe kwaa kwúgyi wo n əwo əɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />She Amalitayi ɓə gye owa n shegyi n əwo əɓwa, ɓa gna aje ge, “A ɓa gye əza ye zhni əzawuyi nu, kwo shikwonyi wo la pwo shikwo nuwna, əshna Owadayi Tnagyifyiyi ta ye nge wa gyianyì m.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ama Bwulus wa myi owa ya fyi n əná, jesnu to kwa zhni wo ɓəho m. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Aza ɓə zhi n awyetui nge wo ɓa snú nu n nayi, kwo wa myiya shi n əsagbmanyii wa fyi; ama she ɓa ɓə pmi əsa kwaa mwa to ɓa gye ɓəho kwoi zhni wo m, ɓa shna əɓa bwugba do, ɓa gna wo zhni shekwoyi ho nu.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Apyiznutu ɓə zhi vyivyiwyi n ɓa ɓə zhni Pwobiliyus anya, əwo nu ɓə zhni mwusei tukwoda. Wa gwo yi aɓwa-aba-aba fyi n əwo pwuwa jesnu wa ga yi nyagyi n əɓwai loloiya anyipyei ngwnu-ata. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Əwo dada ɓə tu n nyasnai n gədo; sukwona nu ɓə zhni wo ɓədo n snitayii. Bwulus wa lo woo gye wo əwye, she wo ɓə zhniaduwa, wa kpe wo əwo aɓwa nlonu wa ɓwa kágna. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Shi dəye ɓə kwu zhni nlonu, anyasnai vnyanya kpe n mwuse yi, ɓa ɓe jesnu ɓa ɓwa kágna. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ɓa ga yi mwamwa fyi n azokwo gbowogbowo; jesnu she əsa ɓə la si ya lofyi n əzna, ɓa ga yi anya n yi ɓə n əɓa apmai.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus Roma sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />She apya ngwnu-ata ɓə la duya, ya kwnufyi n shikwo, fyi n əya nuwnanya n kwo ɓə zhni vnyinkwo dna n mwuse nyi; kwo ɓə zhni Alekzandariya əya nuwnanya nu, n ashekwoyi ngwnu-aba atukwo adogbei kpe n əkwo tukwo; Kasto nya n Pwolukiyii. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Ya kwu kpezhi n Sirakwus jesnu ya kwu fyi n ɓo anyipyei ngwnu-ata. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ya kwuka n abaayi ya lo əya nuwnanya jesnu ya ɓe ya si Regiyum. Əfye kwa gyi zhi, vnuvnu snuta nya kwa kwukala zhi jesnu n fyegyi baayi, ya si Pwutoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />N abaayi, ya gye əyi azaje əwye, azanugbai n anyikwozai n ɓa ɓə pa yi nge yi kwu kwnufyi n ɓai ladiwyi ɓwugyi. Ntulonu ya ɓe Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Əyi azaje, azanugbai n anyikwozai ɓə kwu wo nge yi ɓə lo, ɓa znazna n kpaai ɓa kwu si Abyiyus Gnyikwo. Azaje ɓa shegwnu yi n Ashilagyí Ngwnu-ata. Shi Bwulus ɓə gye ɓa əwye, wa sa Shekwoyi ami, jesnu əwo bwugba kwaa kalá ɓwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />She yi ɓə si Roma, aa Bwulus fa nge wo dna n abahobahoi n wo ɓa dna n wohnii, n okwnuyi gbmanyi n ma wo, woi gwu wo.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus zhni waazi n gwudna n Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />N anyipyei ata avnu wa yì Ayahudiyi atukwoda abaayi nya zhi n abagbmanyi. She ɓa ɓə la yezhi, Bwulus wa gna ɓa: “Əmi azaje, kwo shikwonyi mi to ɓə zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi tu n əyi aza tukwo, kwo tu n əyi azakwoyi kwnunu m, a ɓə wna mi dna n Urishelima nu jesnu aa mi ga dna n Aromayi akwnu. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Aromayi ɓa nya mi aɓo nyanya, ɓa ɓə ncei pma ɓa ya mi, ntuge ɓa to ɓə gye mi n ɓəgyi ɓəgalazhni nyai n kwo kwnuce lo n əfyii m. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ama Ayahudiyi to ɓa ye m, ntulonu kwa mi zè ɓəshishi nu ma tnu n aɓwatnai lo da Kaisa. Ɓəhnihni mi to ɓə n kwoi dna nge ma ɓe n ɓəhoi nu tu n əmi aza m. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ntu əɓo ye ɓo nu, mii gna nge, mi ɓa gye fye ma daɓo n fyei. N tukwoi tu n Israila awyetu ɓo nu, ń a n mii pa dna n agbma ye.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi too gwo paka ho n Yahudiya ntu əho ɓo m, jesnu əzaho to lo n əyi aza, kwo gbmanyi, n ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe n abaayi, n ɓa kwu alafyiya ho wu, kwo ɓa da əɓo nukwoi ho tu n əho tukwo m. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ama yi ncei pmalo ya wo əɓo n ho gaiciyai ga n kwo. Əɓo n yi kpəlo, əkwo nu nge abahobahoi vnyanya, aza daɓo lo tu n Zokwo ye tukwo.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ɓa shi əsa n ɓa ɓə gye Bwulus əwye n nyipyei hoi; jesnu aza ɓə du n bəgyé n ɓa ɓə ɓe aba n wo ɓə dna nyi. Wa zhni ɓa waazi ənya n kwo laka n laabmi nya wyeshe, woi kná ɓa awyeya da Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo. Wa zhni apma n Mwusa Owai jesnu ɓədo n Sheaɓəgwognayi nyai, woi zhniatna wa wu ɓa əza n Yeisu zhni. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Əɓo n wo ɓə da nyi, kwo ɓə la azaho kwnuawye, ama azaje to ɓa ga gaiciya m. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nlonu, ɓa naɓokpeaje ɓahniɓahni, jesnu ɓa ya gnamyi she Bwulus ɓə kpma əɓo ye da ge: “Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə da gaiciyanunui nu ga əfye azakwoyi əsa n wo ɓə daɓo dna n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya əgbe:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />“ ‘Lo aza ye aba, hoi gna ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Fye ɓa kwu zhi fyei wo, ama fye taa kpəgənyi m, kwo fyewyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Fye ɓa kwu zhi fyei gyewye, ama fye taa kpeye m, kwo fyewyi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ntuge aza ye ədu kwo la shni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kwo dnaɓo lo ɓa wo əɓo n əɓa tnubwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">jesnu ɓa kwu əɓa awye kpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ntolonu m, ɓa ɓá kwu əɓo gyewye n əɓa awyei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa wo n əɓa atnubwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa kpəgənyi n əɓa adui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ɓa pmyiɓe nabai ma ga ɓa kágna.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“Ntucenu mi ye fya kwu kpe nge, a la tnu n Shekwoyi gnyignyii n Abyedo aba, jesnu ɓa ɓə kna kwo tnubwa!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Shi wo ɓə kwu ɓəye da, Ayahudiyi ɓa kwnuya n abaayi, ɓai naɓokpeaje n əwyei bmyibmyii.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bwulus waa dna əwohni pwuwa tagba nya, aye ɓwugyiɓwugyi ngwnu-aba, wa gwo azhiɓeyi vnyanya n ɓa ɓə ɓe ɓa gye wo əwye. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Wa da aza Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo, jesnu woi wunya tu n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti tukwo pəipəi, n bwugbai dnakalá vnyanya to zahozahoyii kpma wo kwo zhni m.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>